<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MAT" style="id">- Nkangala New Testament Zambia</book>
  <para style="h">Mateu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Muzimbu Uacili uasonekele Mateu</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mateu</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mat</para>
  <para style="mt2">Muzimbu Uacili uasonekele</para>
  <para style="mt1">MATEU</para>
  <para style="imt">Citsindikisi</para>
  <para style="ip">Muzimbu Uacili uasonekele Mateu uapua umo ua mikanda iuana mu Litavasano Lialiha ije ihandeka ha vuyoye vua Yesu Kilistu. Umo ku umo yauo va utumbula nguavo “Muzimbu.” kulumbununa “Muzimbu Uacili.” Va isonekele hanima ya kutsa ca Yesu kuli Mateu, na Mako, na Luka na Yiuano. Vaka kulilongesa kuvazivuka muaka muka uje Muzimbu ua Mateu vausonekele, vuno honi casa kupua mu miaka makumi atanu na limo hanima ya kusemuka ca Yesu. Naua kuvazivuka ku cihela cije vausonekelele, vuno honi vavengi vakasinganiekela nguavo hamo vausonekelele mu Palisitane kaha naua hamo mu nganda ya Yelusalema.</para>
  <para style="ip">Muka ku usonekani ikeye vene Mateu, uje uapuile muka kutambula lisimu tele kanda Yesu amuleke ngeci apue ndongisi uendi. Naua vamuzivukile na lizina lia Levi. Mateu uapuile umo ua tunganda likumi na vavali kaha naua ua usonekelele kuli vaka kutanda Ciyunda. Eci vanacimuesa mu vitaleso hakupua makumi atanu na limo mu visoneka mu Litavasano Lialaja. Uatondele kumuesa ngue Yesu ikeye vene Kilistu, Muyoyesi uakuhangula ua Njambi, uje ivahandekele vunanguizi vua hali ikeye. Mateu naua uasonekele viavingi via Vumuene vua Njambi. Vayunda vatondele Kilistu kupua muene ua vumuene vua vimpande via mavu. Mateu uahakelele mana mukueseka viyongola vije mukulumbununa Vumuene vua vusunga vua Njambi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Muzimbu Uacili uasonekele Mateu uapua mukanda uacili hakuputukila Litavasano Lialiha muomu lia vitaleso viauo viaku Litavasano Lialaja. Mukanda ou uanungakana Matavasano avali. Vaka kulilongesa naua vasinganieka nguavo Mateu hamo uesekele kutemunuisa cifua ca mikanda ya Mosesa, ije ikeyo yapua mikanda itanu ya kulivanga mu Litavasano Lialaja. Kuambulula ca Yesu ha munkinda (5-7) tuasa kucisetekesa ngue muje Njambi uahanene lishiko kuli Mosesa (Kuhituluka mu Mashiko 19:3; 23:33)</para>
  <para style="iot">Muvana vitumbikilamo</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Mateu aputuka Muzimbu nakuhandeka ha kusemuka ca Yesu Kilistu na maputukilo a vipangi viendi mu kapetulu (1-4)</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Cakuhatako Mateu alumbununa vipangi via Yesu na vilongesa viendi viavingi mu kapetulu (5-25)</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Cakumanusuila mukusoneka ca Mateu cikeco cihandeka ha vipangi via Yesu mu kutsa cendi na kusanguka cendi (26-28)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MAT 1" />
  <para style="s">Vakukuluila va Yesu Kilistu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 3:23-38">Luka 3:23-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 1:1" />Ava vakevo vakukuluila va Yesu Kilistu, muna Ndaviti, muna Avilahama.<verse eid="MAT 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 1:2" />Avilahama uapuile ishe ya Isake, Isake uapuile ishe ya Yakomba, Yakomba uapuile ishe ya Yunda na vamunaina, <verse eid="MAT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 1:3" />Yunda uapuile ishe ya Peleze na Zela vaje vaina vapuile Tamale, Peleze uapuile ishe ya Hezelone, Hezelone uapuile ishe ya Lama, <verse eid="MAT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 1:4" />Lama uapuile ishe ya Aminandave, Aminandave uapuile ishe ya Naheshone, Naheshone uapuile ishe ya Salemone, <verse eid="MAT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 1:5" />Salemone uapuile ishe ya Mbouasi uje vaina vapuile Luhave, Mbouasi uapuile ishe ya Ovende uje vaina vapuile Lute, Ovende uapuile ishe ya Njesi, <verse eid="MAT 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 1:6" />Njesi uapuile ishe ya Muene Ndaviti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 1:6">Kaha Ndaviti uapuile ishe ya Solomoni uje vaina vapuile tele mpuevo ya Uliya, <verse eid="MAT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 1:7" />Solomoni uapuile ishe ya Lehovouame, Lehovouame uapuile ishe ya Aviya, Aviya uapuile ishe ya Asa, <verse eid="MAT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 1:8" />Asa uapuile ishe ya Njosefati, Njosefati uapuile ishe ya Njeholame, Njeholame uapuile ishe ya Uziya, <verse eid="MAT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 1:9" />Uziya uapuile ishe ya Yotame, Yotame uapuile ishe ya Ahaze, Ahaze uapuile ishe ya Hezekiya, <verse eid="MAT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 1:10" />Hezekiya uapuile ishe ya Manase, Manase uapuile ishe ya Amoni, Amoni uapuile ishe ya Yosiya, <verse eid="MAT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 1:11" />Yosiya uapuile ishe ya Yehoyakine na vamunaina, ha ntsimbu ije vavatualele ku vunzinda mu cifuti ca Mbambilone.<verse eid="MAT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 1:12" />Kaha kuhuma hakuvatuala ku Mbambilone, Yehoyakine uapuile ishe ya Sheyaletiyele, Sheyaletiyele uapuile ishe ya Zelumbambele, <verse eid="MAT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 1:13" />Zelumbambele uapuile ishe ya Aviyunde, Aviyunde uapuile ishe ya Eliakime, Eliakime uapuile ishe ya Azole, <verse eid="MAT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 1:14" />Azole uapuile ishe ya Zandoke, Zandoke uapuile ishe ya Akime, Akime uapuile ishe ya Eliunde, <verse eid="MAT 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 1:15" />Eliunde uapuile ishe ya Eliazale, Eliazale uapuile ishe ya Matane, Matane uapuile ishe ya Yakomba, <verse eid="MAT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 1:16" />Yakomba uapuile ishe ya Yosefa uje uapuile yala lia Maliya uje uasemene Yesu, uje ivatumbula Kilistu.<verse eid="MAT 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 1:17" />Kaha honi vikota vioshe kuhuma kuli Avilahama nakutuala kuli Ndaviti viapuile likumi na viuana, kuhuma kuli Ndaviti kutuala noho vavatualele ku Mbambilone viapuile vikota likumi na viuana, kuhuma hakuvatuala ku Mbambilone kuneha noho kuli Kilistu viapuile vikota likumi na viuana.<verse eid="MAT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kusemuka ca Yesu Kilistu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 2:1-7">Luka 2:1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 1:18" />Honi kusemuka ca Yesu Kilistu cezile mucifua eci. Omo vaina Maliya vamulamene kuli Yosefa, tele kanda valimoneho vamumuene nguavo akemita lizimo lia nzili yaku Cimbembesi Uakulela. <verse eid="MAT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 1:19" />Kaha Yosefa uje uamulamene hakupua ua vusunga, katondele kumuvuisa shuamua kaha uasinganiekele kuviana vulo muvushueke. <verse eid="MAT 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 1:20" />Vuno honi tele acili nakusinganieka eci, taleni, kangelo ua Muene uasholokele kuli ikeye mu cilota nakuhandeka nguendi, “Yosefa, muna Ndaviti keti uteue kuambata Maliya mpueyove, muomu eci kuimita cali naco cinapu caku Cimbembesi Uakulela. <verse eid="MAT 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 1:21" />Akasema muana ua yala, kaha ukamuluka lizina liendi Yesu, muomu ikeye akovola vantu vendi ku vipi viavo.”<verse eid="MAT 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 1:22" />Vioshe evi vialingiuile mukushulisisa vije viahandekele Muene kuhitila muli kananguizi nguendi,<verse eid="MAT 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 1:23" />“Taleni, mpuevo uje kanda alimone na yala akemita kaha akasema muana ua yala,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:23">kaha lizina liendi vakamutumbula Manuuele” (kulumbununa Njambi ali netu).<verse eid="MAT 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 1:24" />Omo Yosefa uahindukile mutulo, ualingile ngue muje muamushikile kangelo ua Muene. Uambatele mpueyendi, <verse eid="MAT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 1:25" />vuno honi kalimuene nendi kuvanga noho hasemenene muana ua yala, kaha uamulukile lizina nguendi Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MAT 2" />
  <para style="s">Vaka mana vaje vahumine ku Ngangela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 2:1" />Honi omo Yesu uasemukile mu Mbetelehema ku Yundeya mu matangua a muene Helonde, taleni vaka mana vahumine ku ngangela vezile ku Yelusalema, <verse eid="MAT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 2:2" />vehuile nguavo, “Nkuma ali kuli ou nasemuka muene ua Vayunda? Tunamono ntanga tanga yendi mu ngangela, kaha tuneja nakumulemesa.”<verse eid="MAT 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 2:3" />Omo muene Helonde uevuile eci, ualiniengele cikuma, hamo navoshe vaje vakele nendi mu Yelusalema. <verse eid="MAT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 2:4" />Kaha uakunguluile vakuluntu voshe va vasasendote na valongisi va mezi a lishiko, kaha uavehuile kuje Kilistu napande kusemukila.<verse eid="MAT 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 2:5" />Vamulekele nguavo, “Mu Mbetelehema ku Yundeya,” muomu omu mukemo muvavisonekelele kuli kananguizi,<verse eid="MAT 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 2:6" />‘Nove Mbetelehema, mu nganda ya Yundeya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:6">keti usinganieke nguove u uamundende hakati kavaka kuyula vamu Yundeya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:6">muomu kuli yove kukahuma muka kuyula</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:6">uje akatuamenena vantu vange Vaisaleli.’<verse eid="MAT 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 2:7" />Ambahoni Helonde uasanene vaka mana muvushueke, uavehuisisile ntsimbu muka ije ntanga ntanga yasholokele. <verse eid="MAT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 2:8" />Kaha uavatumine ku Mbetelehema uavalekele nguendi, “Yeni mukatondesese cikuma ha muanike ou, kaha omo muamuuana, muije muakunjileke linga nange naua njije nakumulemesa.”<verse eid="MAT 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 2:9" />Omo vevuile vije via handekele muene kaha vayile, kaha taleni, ntanga ntanga ivamuene mu ngangela yakele kulutue luavo noho yezile nakutulila ha cihela cije hakele muana. <verse eid="MAT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 2:10" />Omo vamuene ije ntanga ntanga, vavuahelelele cikuma na nzolela yakama. <verse eid="MAT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 2:11" />Kaha omo vakovelele mu njivo vamuene muana na vaina Maliya, kaha vatsikamene ha mavuli avo nakumulemesa. Ambahoni vafukuile mu viambatelo viavo via vufuko nakumuhana mavuana a seho a ngolinde na ngongosi ya luengo luacili na miila.<verse eid="MAT 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 2:12" />Kaha hanima yakuvanangula mu cilota linga keti vahiluke kuli Helonde, vahilukile ku cifuti cavo na ngila yeka.<verse eid="MAT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vateuesela Yesu ku Ingito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 2:13" />Honi omo vayile, kaha taleni, kangelo ua Muene uasholokele kuli Yosefa mu cilota kaha uahandekele nguendi, “Hinduka ambata muana na vaina, kaha teuela ku Ingito, kaha yakakale kuje noho njikakuleka, muomu Helonde alinakutonda muana linga a mutsihe.”<verse eid="MAT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 2:14" />Ambahoni uahindukile nakuambata muana na vaina ha vutsiki vuje vene nakuya ku Ingito. <verse eid="MAT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 2:15" />Vakele kuje noho Helonde uatsile. Cije capuile kushulisisa vije viahandekele Muene kuhitila muli kananguizi nguendi, “Njasanene munange uje uakele mu Ingito.”<verse eid="MAT 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vatsiha vanike</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 2:16" />Ambahoni Helonde omo uamuene ngeci vaka mana vanamukuisa, uanienguele cikuma, kaha uashikile linga vatsihe vanike voshe vava mala mu Mbetelehema na mu vihela viakulihatako, voshe vaje vakele na miaka ivali na vaje vakele muintsi lia miaka ivali yakusemuka, kuya ku ntsimbu ije yalilongesele ku vaka mana.<verse eid="MAT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 2:17" />Ambahoni vialishulisile vije viahandekele kananguizi Njelemiya nguendi,<verse eid="MAT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 2:18" />“Vovuile Lizi mu Lama</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:18">lizi lia kulila na kulinienga cikuma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:18">Lakele alila muomu ya vana vendi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:18">katavele kumuzembeleka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:18">muomu voshe vatsile.”<verse eid="MAT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vahuma ku Ingito vaya ku Nazaleta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 2:19" />Vuno honi omo Helonde uatsile, taleni, kangelo ua Muene uasholokele mu cilota kuli Yosefa mu Ingito, uahandekele nguendi, <verse eid="MAT 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 2:20" />“Hinduka ambata muana na vaina linga muye ku cihela ca Isaleli, muomu vaje vasinganiekele kutsiha muana vanatsi.” <verse eid="MAT 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 2:21" />Kaha uahindukile nakuambata muana na vaina nakuya ku cihela ca Isaleli.<verse eid="MAT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 2:22" />Vuno honi omo uevuile ngeci Alekelau nasuana Yundeya mu cihela ca ishe Helonde, kaha uateuele kuya kuje. Kaha honi hakumunangula mu cilota, kaha uayile ku cihela ca Ngalileya. <verse eid="MAT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 2:23" />Kaha uayile nakukala mu nganda ivasana Nazaleta, linga vije vivahandekele tunanguizi vilishulisise nguavio, “Vaka mutumbula Kanazaleta.”<verse eid="MAT 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MAT 3" />
  <para style="s">Kuambulula ca Yiuano muka kumbuitika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mako 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luka 3:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yiuano 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 3:1" />Mu matangua aje kuezile Yiuano muka kumbuitika, uakele nakuambulula mu mpambo ya Yundeya nguendi, <verse eid="MAT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 3:2" />“Tengulukeni, muomu Vumuene vua muilu vuli muyehi.” <verse eid="MAT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 3:3" />Muomu ou ikeye ivahandekele kuli kananguizi Isaya, omo uahandekele nguendi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 3:3">“Lizi lia umo ali nakutambeka mu mpambo ngualio,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 3:3">Vuaheseni ngila ya Muene</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 3:3">kaha sungameseni ngila yendi.”<verse eid="MAT 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 3:4" />Honi Yiuano uazalele vuzalo vuakupanga ha maka a kamelu kaha ualikutile muiva ua cilambu mu mbunda yendi, na viakulia viendi viapuile vambimba na vuci. <verse eid="MAT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 3:5" />Vantu vezile kuli ikeye kuhuma ku Yelusalema na ku Yundeya yoshe, na ku vihela vioshe viakulihata na ndonga ya Yundau. <verse eid="MAT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 3:6" />Valitavelele vipi viavo kaha uavambuitikile mu ndonga ya Yundau.<verse eid="MAT 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 3:7" />Vuno honi omo uamuene Vafaliseho na Vasanduki vavengi valinakuija mukuvambuitika, kaha uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Yeni vana vamanoka iya naminangula linga muteue ku vutenu ovu vuli nakuija? <verse eid="MAT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 3:8" />Imeni vushuka vuje vumuesa ngeci muatenguluka. <verse eid="MAT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 3:9" />Kaha keti musinganieke ngeci muasa kuhandeka kuli yeni vavenia ngueni, ‘Tuli na Avilahama tatetu’, muomu njimileka nguange, Njambi asa kupuisa aua mavue kupua vana va Avilahama. <verse eid="MAT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 3:10" />Cipue hano vene ngimbu inalivuahesela laja kuteta miti kuputukila ku mizi, nankuma muti uoshe uje kuuimi vushuka vuacili vakauteta nakuumbila mu tuhia. <verse eid="MAT 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 3:11" />Yange njimimbuitika na mema linga cipue cimueso ngeci munatenguluka, vuno honi ou eja munima yange anjipulakana ku nzili, kunjafuililile cipue kuambata vinkaku viendi, ikeye akamimbuitika na Cimbembesi Uakulela na tuhia. <verse eid="MAT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 3:12" />Lisehua liendi lili mu livoko liendi, kaha akakomba ku lijunguilo liendi, kaha akakunguluila tiliku mu cishete cendi, vuno honi mujungu akautsimika na tuhia tuakuhona kuhua.”<verse eid="MAT 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kumbuitika ca Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Mako 1:9-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21">Luka 3:21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22">22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 3:13" />Ambahoni Yesu uahumine ku Ngalileya nakuya ku ndonga ya Yundau linga vakamumbuitike kuli Yiuano. <verse eid="MAT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 3:14" />Vuno honi Yiuano uatondele kumuvindika kaha uahandekele nguendi, “Yange capande kunjimbuitika kuli yove, nkuma naua yove uija kuli yange ndi?”<verse eid="MAT 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 3:15" />Vuno honi Yesu uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Cilingiue ngoco vene hano, cacili kuli yetu kushulisisa vije vioshe Njambi atonda kuli yetu.” Ambahoni Yiuano uatavele.<verse eid="MAT 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 3:16" />Hanima yakumbuitika Yesu, kaha hajevene uahumine mu mema, kaha taleni, melu ashokolokele kaha uamuene Cimbembesi ua Njambi ashuluka ngue livembe nakumutonkama. <verse eid="MAT 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 3:17" />Kaha lizi liahumine muilu ngualio, “Ou ikeye Munange injazanga, muli ikeye njivuahelela.”<verse eid="MAT 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MAT 4" />
  <para style="s">Yesu vamueseka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:12">Mako 1:12</ref>;<ref loc="MRK 1:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">Luka 4:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 4:1" />Ambahoni Yesu vamutualele kuli Cimbembesi mu mpambo linga vakamueseke kuli Liyavolo. <verse eid="MAT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 4:2" />Ualiuminine kulia ha matangua makumi auana vutsiki na mutania, kaha hanima yakuliumina kulia uevuile njala. <verse eid="MAT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 4:3" />Kaha muka kumueseka uezile kuli ikeye nakuhandeka nguendi, “Nga u Muna Njambi, shika aua mavue linga ahimpuke mbolo.”<verse eid="MAT 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 4:4" />Vuno honi Yesu uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Vanacisoneka nguavo, ‘Muntu kasa kuyoya na mbolo lika houe, vuno honi na mezi oshe aje Njambi ahandeka.’”<verse eid="MAT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 4:5" />Ambahoni Liyavolo uamutualele mu nganda ya kulela, uamuhakele helu lia kashongua ka Njivo ya Njambi. <verse eid="MAT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 4:6" />Kaha uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Nga u Muna Njambi,” “liumbile ha mavu. Muomu vanacisoneka nguavo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:6">“‘Akashika tungelo vendi hali yove,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:6">kaha vakakukavuila na mavoko avo, linga viliato viove keti vikansunsuke ku mavue.’”<verse eid="MAT 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 4:7" />Yesu uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Vanacisoneka naua nguavo, ‘Keti ueseke Muene Njambi yove.’”<verse eid="MAT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 4:8" />Kaha naua Liyavolo uamutualele ha munkinda ualaha cikuma, uamumuesele vumuene vuoshe vua hano ha mavu na vumpau vuavuo. <verse eid="MAT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 4:9" />Kaha uahandekele kuli Yesu nguendi, “Vioshe evi njikakuhanavio, nga ukatsikama ha mavu na kunjilemesa.”<verse eid="MAT 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 4:10" />Yesu uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Huma kuli yange Satana! Muomu vanacisoneka nguavo, ‘Ukalemesa Muene Njambi yove na kumupangela ikeye lika!’”<verse eid="MAT 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 4:11" />Ambahoni Liyavolo uamusezele, kaha tungelo vezile nakumukuasa.<verse eid="MAT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aputuka vipangi viendi mu Ngalileya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:14">Mako 1:14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15">15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14">Luka 4:14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 15">15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 4:12" />Omo Yesu uevuile nguendi Yiuano vanamukutu, kaha uayile ku Ngalileya. <verse eid="MAT 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 4:13" />Kaha hakuhuma mu Nazaleta uayile nakukakala mu Kapenauma kuyehi na cisali ca Ngalileya, mu nginga ya Zembuloni na Nafetali, <verse eid="MAT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 4:14" />linga cije cahandekele kananguizi Isaya cilishulisise nguendi:<verse eid="MAT 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 4:15" />“Cihela ca Zembuloni na cihela ca Nafetali,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:15">vije viakala mu ngila yakuya ku cisali, kulutue lua Yundau,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:15">Ngalileya, cifuti ca vaje keti Vayunda.<verse eid="MAT 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 4:16" />Vantu vaje vakala mu milima</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:16">vanamono ceke cakama.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:16">Kaha na vaje vakala mu cihela na mu cimbembe ca kutsa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:16">ceke cinavatuila.”<verse eid="MAT 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 4:17" />Kuhuma ha ntsimbu ije Yesu uaputukile kuambulula nguendi, “Tengulukeni ku vipi vieni, muomu Vumuene vua muilu vuli muyehi.”<verse eid="MAT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu asana vandongisi vendi vakulivanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mako 1:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">Luka 5:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 4:18" />Omo Yesu uakele nakuenda kucikulo ca cisali ca Ngalileya, uamuene muntu na munaina, Simoni uje ivatumbula Petulu na munaina Anduleo, vatele manda avo mu cisali, muomu vapuile vakakuta vantsi. <verse eid="MAT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 4:19" />Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Njikaveni, kaha njikamipuisa vakakuta vantu.” <verse eid="MAT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 4:20" />Kaha hajevene vasezele manda avo nakumukava.<verse eid="MAT 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 4:21" />Omo uakele nakutualelelaho kuya kaha naua uamuene muntu na munaina, Yakomba muna Zembendeo na munaina Yiuano mu vuato hamo na ishavo Zembendeo vakele nakutungulula manda avo, kaha uavasanene. <verse eid="MAT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 4:22" />Kaha hajevene vasezele vuato na ishavo, kaha vamukavele.<verse eid="MAT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alongesa na kuambulula na kukanguisa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:17-19">Luka 6:17-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 4:23" />Yesu uahitanganene mu Ngalileya muoshe, nakulongesa mu vinjivo viavo via malombelo, na kuambulula Muzimbu Uacili ua Vumuene nakukanguisa mishongo yoshe ya vantu yakuliseza seza na vakakuvavala. <verse eid="MAT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 4:24" />Kutsimana cendi cevuikile naku Siliya kuoshe, kaha vamunehelele vaka kuvavala voshe, na vaka mishongo yakuli seza seza na kuvua kuvavala, na vaka mahamba, na vaka kushinia, na vaka tulepa, kaha voshe uavakanguisile. <verse eid="MAT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 4:25" />Kaha vivunga viakama via vantu viamukavele kuhuminina mu Ngalileya, namu Ndekapolisi <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">(Ndekapolisi ilumbununa vinganda likumi) </char></note> na ku Yelusalema, na ku Yundeya, na musinia lia ndonga ya Yundau.<verse eid="MAT 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MAT 5" />
  <para style="s">Yesu alongesa ha munkinda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 5:1" />Omo Yesu hakumona vivunga via vantu, kaha ualondele cindende ha munkinda, kaha omo uatumamene ha mavu vandongisi vendi vezile kuli ikeye, <verse eid="MAT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 5:2" />kaha uaputukile kuvalongesa nguendi,<verse eid="MAT 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuvuahelela ca vusunga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:20-23">Luka 6:20-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 5:3" />“Vakukuisula vaje vanapu vihutu mu cimbembesi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:3">muomu Vumuene vua Muilu vunapu vuavo.”<verse eid="MAT 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 5:4" />“Vakukuisula vaje valinakulila,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:4">muomu vaka vazembeleka!”<verse eid="MAT 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 5:5" />“Vakukuisula vaje valikehesa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:5">muomu vakasuana mavu!”<verse eid="MAT 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 5:6" />“Vakukuisula vaje vevua njala na mpuila muomu ya vusunga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:6">muomu vakakuta!”<verse eid="MAT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 5:7" />“Vakukuisula vaje vali na cikeketima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:7">muomu navo vakavevuila cikeketima!”<verse eid="MAT 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 5:8" />“Vakukuisula vaje vanalele mu mitima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:8">muomu vakamona Njambi!”<verse eid="MAT 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 5:9" />“Vakukuisula vaje vaka kulinga ciyulo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:9">muomu vakavasana vana va Njambi!”<verse eid="MAT 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 5:10" />“Vakukuisula vaje va valinakupakesa muomu ya vusunga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:10">muomu Vumuene vua Muilu vunapu vuavo!”<verse eid="MAT 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 5:11" />“Munapu vakukuisula omo vantu vamishaula nakumipakesa nakuhandeka viuma vioshe via vipi via makuli hali yeni muomu yange.” <verse eid="MAT 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 5:12" />Joleleni nakuvuahelela muomu vuana vueni vukapua vuakama cikuma muilu, muomu omu mukemo vantu vayandesele tunanguizi vaje vakeleko tele kanda yeni.<verse eid="MAT 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muongua na ceke</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:50">Mako 9:50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:34">Luka 14:34</ref>;<ref loc="LUK 14:35">35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 5:13" />“Yeni munapu muongua uaha mavu, vuno honi nga muongua unashamuka, kaha vatihoni kutovala cauo cikahiluka? Ku ukapu naseho naua ku cuma coshe kuvanga lika vaumbile kuti kaha na vantu vakauliatangela.” <verse eid="MAT 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 5:14" />“Yeni mu ceke ca vaka mavu. Nganda yakutungila ha munkinda kuyasa kulishueka.” <verse eid="MAT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 5:15" />Nankuma naumo uahi asa kushuameka ndeya naku ihaka muintsi lia muhela, vuno honi aihaka ha citumbiko, kaha ituila ceke kuli voshe vaje vali mu njivo. <verse eid="MAT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 5:16" />Mucifua cimo vene eceleni ceke ceni citue ku vantu, linga vamone vipangi vieni viacili, kaha vakahana vumpau kuli Ishueni uje ali muilu.<verse eid="MAT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vilongesa via ha Lishiko lia Mosesa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 5:17" />Keti musinganieke ngueni njineja nakumanusula Lishiko lia Mosesa, cipue vilongesa via tunanguizi, kunjezile nakuvimanusula vuno honi nakuvishulisisa. <verse eid="MAT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 5:18" />Muavusunga njimileka nguange kuvanga lilu na mavu vinahiti, nacimo cahi cikahita keti cipue cisona, cipue citoma kuhuma ku Lishiko, kuvanga noho viuma vioshe vanavimanusula. <verse eid="MAT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 5:19" />Nankuma uoshe uje kononoka cipue koma kakandende kaku mashiko aua kaha acilongesa na vakuavo naua linga vacilinge kaha vakamutumbula uamundende mu Vumuene vua Muilu, vuno honi uoshe uje aniunga na kulongesa mashiko aua vakamutumbula uakama mu Vumuene vua Muilu. <verse eid="MAT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 5:20" />Nankuma njimileka nguange, nga vusunga vueni kuvupulakana vusunga vua valongisi va mezi a lishiko lia Mosesa na Vafaliseho, kaha kumuka kovela mu Vumuene vua Muilu.<verse eid="MAT 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vilongesa via ha kuniengua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 5:21" />“Muevuile muje muvalekele vantu va kuntsenkulu nguavo, ‘Keti mukatsihe, kaha uoshe uje atsiha mukuavo vaka musompesa.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 5:22" />Vuno honi njimileka nguange uoshe uje anienguela munaina vanapande kumusompa, kaha uoshe uje atuka munaina vaka musompa ku nzango, kaha na uoshe uje ahandeka mukuavo nguendi yove cilema, vakamutuala mu ngehena ya tuhia. <verse eid="MAT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 5:23" />Nankuma nga utonda kulambula vuana vuove ha mutula, kaha nga uvuluka mulonga uje u uapihisilile mukueni, <verse eid="MAT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 5:24" />seza vuana vuove ha mutula kaha yatahi ukalisambuese nendi, kaha kuhuma oho hiluka ukalambuile vuana vuove.<verse eid="MAT 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 5:25" />“Likonekeleni vuasi vuasi nauje unapihisila oku muli nakuya hamo ku nzango, kuteua yunapihisila akakutuala kuli lihako, kaha lihako akakuhana kuli lisualale, kaha lisualale akakuhaka mu kamenga.” <verse eid="MAT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 5:26" />Muavusunga njikuleka nguange, ku ukahumumo kuvanga noho ukamanusula kufueta kambongo ka mamanusuilo ku mulonga uove.<verse eid="MAT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vilongesa via ha vupangala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 5:27" />“Muevuile muje vacihandekele nguavo, ‘Keti mulinge vupangala.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 5:28" />Vuno honi njimileka nguange, uoshe uje atala mpuevo ntooma na lishungu lia lipi na lingi laja nendi vupangala mu mutima uendi. <verse eid="MAT 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 5:29" />Nga lisho liove liaku cilio likusevuisa kulinga vupi, licokovolemo uliumbile kuti! Muomu cacili kuli yove cilio cove cimo ca muvila cinonge kupulakana kumbila muvila uove uoshe mu ngehena. <verse eid="MAT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 5:30" />Kaha nga livoko liove lia cilio likusevuisa kulinga vupi, livatule, kaha liumbile kuti! Muomu cacili kuli yove cilio cove cimo ca muvila cinonge kupulakana kumbila muvila uove uoshe mu ngehena.<verse eid="MAT 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vilongesa via ha kutsiha vulo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:9">Mateu 19:9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11">Mako 10:11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12">12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luka 16:18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 5:31" />“Kaha naua vacihandekele nguavo, ‘Uoshe uje akondola mpueyendi, napande kumuhana mukanda uakutsiha vulo.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 5:32" />Vuno honi yange njimileka nguange, uoshe uje akondola mpueyendi, kuakuhona mulonga ua vupangala, amupuisa ngue nalingi vupangala, kaha na uje uoshe akamuambata alinga vupangala.<verse eid="MAT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vilongesa via ha kulisinga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 5:33" />“Naua muevuile muje valekele vakukuluila kuntsenkulu nguavo, ‘Keti upokole cisingo cove, vuno honi linga vije viualisingile ku mesho a Muene.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 5:34" />Vuno honi njihandeka kuli yeni nguange keti mukalisingeho, cipue na lilu, muomu liapua litanda lia Njambi, <verse eid="MAT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 5:35" />cipue na mavu, muomu apua cituamo ca viliatelo viendi, cipue na Yelusalema, muomu yapua nganda ya Muene uakama. <verse eid="MAT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 5:36" />Kaha naua keti ulisinge na mutue uove, muomu kuuasa kutokesa cinkambu cimo cipue kucizivalesa. <verse eid="MAT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 5:37" />Kuhandeka ceni kupue ‘Eyo’ cipue ‘houe’ muomu coshe cakupulakana eci cihuminina kuli citozi.<verse eid="MAT 5:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vilongesa via ha kuhiluisila vupi ku vupi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:29">Luka 6:29</ref>;<ref loc="LUK 6:30">30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 5:38" />“Muevuile muje vahandekele nguavo, ‘Lisho ku lisho, kaha lizo ku lizo.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 5:39" />Vuno honi njihandeka kuli yeni nguange keti muhiluisile vupi ku muntu uje akupihisila. Vuno honi nga muntu akupupa ku litama liove lia cilio, mutenguluisile naua ku litama likuavo. <verse eid="MAT 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 5:40" />Kaha nga muntu atonda kukusompesa ngeci akunieke cikovelo cove, muhane naua na kazaku kove. <verse eid="MAT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 5:41" />Kaha nga muntu akusindiya ngeci uende nendi vungenzi vua ntunda imo, enda nendi vungenzi vua vintunda vivali. <verse eid="MAT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 5:42" />Uoshe uje akulomba muhane, uoshe uje akulomba mukuli keti umumine.<verse eid="MAT 5:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cizango ku vitozi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:27-28">Luka 6:27-28</ref>;<ref loc="LUK 6:32">32</ref>;<ref loc="LUK 6:36">36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 5:43" />“Munevu muje vahandekele nguavo, ‘Zanga mukueni, kaha zinda citozi cove.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 5:44" />Vuno honi njimileka nguange, zangeni vitozi veni, kaha lombeleleni vaje valina kumipakesa, <verse eid="MAT 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 5:45" />linga mupue vana va Ishueni uje ali muilu. Muomu ikeye akatuisa litangua liendi kuli vaka vupi na kuli vaka vucili, kaha akanokesa kalunga kuli vaka vusunga na kuli vaka kuhona vusunga. <verse eid="MAT 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 5:46" />Muomu nga muzanga lika vaje vamizanga, kaha vuana muka mukauana? Nkuma omu keti mukemo muvakalingila vaka kutambula lisimu ndi? <verse eid="MAT 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 5:47" />Kaha nga mulihinduisa lika na vamuanoko, kaha mualisezela haka na vakueni? Nkuma omu keti mukemo muvakalingila na vaje keti Vayunda ndi? <verse eid="MAT 5:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 5:48" />Nankuma yeni munapande kupua vaka kusungama, ngue muje Ishueni ua muilu uapua uakusungama.”<verse eid="MAT 5:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MAT 6" />
  <para style="s">Vilongesa via ha kukuasa vaka kujeneka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 6:1" />“Zangameni linga keti mulinge vucili vueni ku mesho a vantu, ngeci vamimone, nga mucilinga eci kaha kuvakamihana vuana kuli Ishueni ua muilu.<verse eid="MAT 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 6:2" />“Kaha nga uhana uje najena, keti usike tolombita, ngue muje muvakalingila vaka civembulu mu vinjivo via malombelo na mu vitapalo, linga vavashangazale ku vantu. Muavusunga njimileka nguange, vanatambula laja vuana vuavo. <verse eid="MAT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 6:3" />Vuno honi omo ukuasa vaje vanajena, keti utavese livoko liove lia cimoshue lizivuke vije livoko liove liacilio vililinakulinga, <verse eid="MAT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 6:4" />linga kukuasa ceni kuli vaje vanajena cipue ca vushueke, kaha Ishueni uje amona vije vili mu vushueke akamihana vuana.<verse eid="MAT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vilongesa via ha lilombelo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:2-4">Luka 11:2-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 6:5" />“Kaha omo mulombela, keti mulombele ngue vaka civembulu, muomu vakevo vazanga kuimana nakulombela mu vinjivo via malombelo na mu vitapalo, linga vantu vavamone. Muavusunga njimileka nguange, vanatambula laja vuana vuavo. <verse eid="MAT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 6:6" />Vuno honi omo ulombela, ya mu mulili uove, shoka ku cikolo kaha lombela kuli Isho uje ali mu vushueke. Kaha Isho uje amona via mu vushueke akakuhana vuana.<verse eid="MAT 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 6:7" />“Kaha omo mulombela, keti muhandeke cikuma ngue muje muvakalingila vaje keti Vayunda, muomu vakasinganieka nguavo vakavevua muomu ya mezi avo akuhona seho. <verse eid="MAT 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 6:8" />Keti mupue ngue vakevo, muomu Ishueni azivuka laja vije vimutonda kanda mumulombe. <verse eid="MAT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 6:9" />Lombeleni ngueni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:9">‘Tatetu uli muilu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:9">Valemese lizina liove,<verse eid="MAT 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 6:10" />Vumuene vuove vuije,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:10">Cizango cove vacilinge hano ha mavu, ngue muje vacilinga muilu.<verse eid="MAT 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 6:11" />Tuhane lelo kulia cetu caha litangua na litangua,<verse eid="MAT 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 6:12" />Tukonekele ku milonga yetu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:12">ngue muje yetu tukakonekela vaka kutuvulumuina.<verse eid="MAT 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 6:13" />Keti ututuamenene mu vieseko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:13">vuno honi tuohiele ku citozi!’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu Vimbimbiliya vikuavo vanahakako na mezi aua nguavo, Muomu vumuene vunapu vuove, na nzili na vumpau, ku miaka yoshe ya yaye. Eua.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 6:14" />“Muomu nga mukonekela vantu vaje vanamipihisila, kaha neni naua vakamikonekela kuli Ishueni ua muilu. <verse eid="MAT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 6:15" />Vuno honi nga kumukonekela vantu vaje vamipihisila, neni naua Ishueni kakamikonekela ku vipi vieni.<verse eid="MAT 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vilongesa via ha kuliumina kulia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 6:16" />“Kaha omo muliumina kulia, keti mulimuese ngue muazeye, ngue muje muvakalingila vaka civembulu muje muvaka pihisa ku vihanga viavo, linga ku liumina kulia cavo vacizivuke ku vantu. Muavusunga njimileka nguange vanatambula laja vuana vuavo mukushula. <verse eid="MAT 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 6:17" />Vuno honi omo muliumina kulia, likuiteni mazi ku mitue yeni kaha taneni ku mesho eni, <verse eid="MAT 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 6:18" />linga kuliumina kulia ceni keti vacizivuke ku vantu vuno honi vacizivuke kuli Ishueni uje ali muvushueke, kaha Ishueni uje amona muvushueke akamihana vuana.<verse eid="MAT 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vufuko vua muilu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:33">Luka 12:33</ref>;<ref loc="LUK 12:34">34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 6:19" />“Keti mulitulikile vufuko vua hano ha mavu, vuje tuntembulu na nkalaue vakavupihisa, naua vuje vezi vatuva nakuiva. <verse eid="MAT 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 6:20" />Vuno honi litulikileni vufuko vua muilu, vuje tuntembulu na nkalaue kuvasa kuvupihisa, cipue vezi kuvasa kuvutuva na kuvuiva. <verse eid="MAT 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 6:21" />Muomu kuje kuli vufuko vuove, kukeko naua kukakala mutima uove.<verse eid="MAT 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ceke ca muvila</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:34-36">Luka 11:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 6:22" />“Mesho akeuo ndeya ya muvila. Nankuma nga mesho ove amona muacili, na muvila uove uoshe ushula na ceke. <verse eid="MAT 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 6:23" />Vuno honi nga mesho ove akutsitsivala, muvila uove uoshe ukashula na milima. Nga ceke cije cili muli yove cinapu milima, kaha milima ikapua yaingi cikuma!<verse eid="MAT 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Njambi na vufuko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 16:13">Luka 16:13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:22-31">12:22-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 6:24" />“Naumo uahi asa kupangela vimiene vavali, akazindaho umo nakuzangaho mukuavo, akalihana kuli umo nakusembulula mukuavo. Kuuasa kupangela Njambi na vimbongo ha ntsimbu imo.<verse eid="MAT 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 6:25" />“Nankuma, njimileka nguange, keti mulinienge ha vuyoye vueni, vika mukalia cipue ngueni vika mukanua, cipue ngueni vika tukazala ha mivila yetu. Nkuma miono yeni keti ya seho kupulakana viakulia, cipue mivila yeni kupulakana vuzalo ndi? <verse eid="MAT 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 6:26" />Taleni tuzila va muilu, kuvekukuna cipue kuteja cipue kutulikila mu vishete, vuno honi Ishueni ua muilu alinakuvalisa. Nkuma keti yeni muli na seho yakama kupulakana tuzila ndi? <verse eid="MAT 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 6:27" />Kaha iya hakati keni muomu yakulinienga asa kuvuezelelako ntsimbu imo lika ku muono uendi?<verse eid="MAT 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 6:28" />“Nkuma vika mulinienga ha vuzalo? Taleni vinsani via mu lihia muvikakolo, vikevio ku viekupanga cipue kulitongela vuzalo. <verse eid="MAT 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 6:29" />Vuno honi njimileka nguange, cipue Muene Solomoni mu vumpau vuendi vuoshe, kazaleleho vuzalo vuacili ngue vua vinsani evi. <verse eid="MAT 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 6:30" />Kaha nga Njambi azika muila ua mu lihia uje ukalako lelo lika, imene vaumbila mu tuhia, nkuma kasa kumizika muacili ndi? Yeni vantu va lutsilielo lua lundende!<verse eid="MAT 6:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 6:31" />“Nankuma keti mulinienge ngueni, ‘Tukalia vika?’ Cipue ‘Tukanua vika?’ Cipue ‘Tukazala vika?’ <verse eid="MAT 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 6:32" />Muomu viuma vioshe evi vakavitondo vaje keti Vayunda. Vuno honi yeni Ishueni ua muilu azivuka nguendi muvitonda vioshe. <verse eid="MAT 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 6:33" />Vuno honi tondeni tahi Vumuene vuendi na vusunga vuendi, kaha viuma vioshe evi akamihanavio. <verse eid="MAT 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 6:34" />Nankuma keti mulinienge via imene, muomu imene likalinienga likelio vavenia. Muomu litangua na litangua lili na tuyando tualio tuakupuamo.”<verse eid="MAT 6:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MAT 7" />
  <para style="s">Kusompa vakueni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:37">Luka 6:37</ref>;<ref loc="LUK 6:38">38</ref>;<ref loc="LUK 6:41">41</ref>;<ref loc="LUK 6:42">42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 7:1" />“Keti musompe vakueni, linga neni keti vamisompe. <verse eid="MAT 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 7:2" />Muomu kusompa cije musompa naco vakueni, cikeco civakamisompa naco, kaha seteko ije museteka nayo vakueni, ikeyo ivaka miseteka nayo. <verse eid="MAT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 7:3" />Nkuma vika umuena cishoni cili ha lisho lia muanoko, vuno honi ku umono mukambo uje uli mu lisho liove? <verse eid="MAT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 7:4" />Cipue vika uhandeka kuli muanoko nguove, ‘Teua njikuhumise cishoni cili mu lisho liove,’ vuno honi yove ulina mukambo mu lisho liove? <verse eid="MAT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 7:5" />Yove muka civembulu! Ha kulivanga humisa tahi mukambo uje uli mu lisho liove, ambahoni umone muacili hakuhumisa cishoni cije cili mu lisho lia muanoko.<verse eid="MAT 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 7:6" />“Keti muhane vije via kulela ku tutali, muomu vaka mitengulukila nakumiluisa. Keti mumbile vusanga vueni vuaseho kulutue lia vangulu, muomu vaka vuliatangela na viliato viavo.<verse eid="MAT 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulomba, kutonda na kutota</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:9-13">Luka 11:9-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 7:7" />“Lomba, kaha uka tambula, tonda, kaha ukauana, tota kaha vaka kushokoluela cikolo. <verse eid="MAT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 7:8" />Muomu uoshe uje alomba atambula, kaha uoshe uje atonda auana, na uoshe uje atota vaka mushokoluela cikolo. <verse eid="MAT 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 7:9" />Nkuma iya hakati keni nga munendi amulomba mbolo, kaha ikeye amuhana livue? <verse eid="MAT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 7:10" />Cipue nga amulomba intsi, kaha ikeye amuhana linoka? <verse eid="MAT 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 7:11" />Kaha nga yeni vaka vupi, muzivuka kuhana mavuana acili kuli vana veni, kaha cikafua vati honi kuli Ishueni uje ali muilu uje akahana viuma viacili kuli vaje vamulomba!<verse eid="MAT 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 7:12" />“Kaha vioshe vije mutonda ngueni vakueni vamilingilevio, neni naua valingilenivio, muomu eli likelio Lishiko lia Mosesa na vilongesa via tunanguizi.<verse eid="MAT 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cikolo ca cindende</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:24">Luka 13:24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 7:13" />“Koveleni mu cikolo ca cindende, muomu cikolo cakama na ngila yaco yapua yayasi ije ituala kukunonga, kaha na vaje vakovelamo vapua vavengi. <verse eid="MAT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 7:14" />Vuno honi cikolo ca cindende na ngila yaco yapua ya ikalu, ije ituala ku muono, kaha na vaje vaiuana vapua vavandende.<verse eid="MAT 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muti na vushuka vuauo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:43">Luka 6:43</ref>;<ref loc="LUK 6:44">44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 7:15" />“Zangameni na tunanguizi va makuli, vaje veja kuli yeni mu vuzalo ngue vampanga, vuno honi mukati kavo vanapu tungunga vamu musenge. <verse eid="MAT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 7:16" />Muka vazivukila ku vushuka vuavo. Nkuma vushuka vua viniu vaka vutomona ku muti ua mungonga, cipue vushuka vua mukuyu ku shaku ije ili na mingonga ndi? <verse eid="MAT 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 7:17" />Mucifua cimo vene muti uoshe uacili ukemi vushuka vuacili, vuno honi muti ua upi ukemi vushuka vua vupi. <verse eid="MAT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 7:18" />Muti uacili kuuasa kuima vushuka vua vupi, kaha naua muti ua upi kuuasa kuima vushuka vuacili. <verse eid="MAT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 7:19" />Muti uoshe uje kuuimi vushuka vuacili vaka uteta naku umbila mu tuhia. <verse eid="MAT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 7:20" />Nankuma muka vazivukila ku vushuka vuavo.<verse eid="MAT 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kunjamizivukile</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:25-27">Luka 13:25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 7:21" />“Keti muntu uoshe uje ahandeka kuli yange nguendi, ‘Muene, Muene,’ akakovela mu Vumuene vua muilu, vuno honi kuvanga lika uje alinga cizango ca Tate uje ali muilu. <verse eid="MAT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 7:22" />Ha litangua lije vavengi vakahandeka kuli yange nguavo, ‘Muene, Muene! Nkuma kutuahandekele vunanguizi mu lizina liove, nakuhumisa mahamba mu lizina liove, kaha nkuma kutualingile viuma viavingi viakukomouesa mu lizina liove ndi?’ <verse eid="MAT 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 7:23" />Ambahoni njikahandeka kuli vakevo nguange, ‘Kunjamizuvukile, humeni kuli yange, yeni vaka kulinga via vipi!’<verse eid="MAT 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vaka kutunga njivo vavali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:47-49">Luka 6:47-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 7:24" />“Kaha muntu uoshe uje evua aua mezi ange naku akavangeya napu ngue uje yala uakuzangama uje uatungile njivo yendi ha mavu a mavue. <verse eid="MAT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 7:25" />Kaha kalunga uanokele, na livazi liezile, kaha mpunzi yezile nakuningangesa ije njivo. Vuno honi kuyauile, muomu luvula luayo valutungilile ha mavu a mavue.<verse eid="MAT 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 7:26" />“Vuno honi uoshe uje evua aua mezi ange, kaha ka akavangeya, napu ngue uje yala ua cilema uje uatungilile njivo yendi ha museke seke, <verse eid="MAT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 7:27" />Kaha kalunga uanokele, na livazi liezile, kaha mpunzi yapekumukile nakuningangesa ije njivo, kaha yauile, kaha kuua cayo capuile cacipi cikuma!”<verse eid="MAT 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nzili Yakama ya Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 7:28" />Kaha omo Yesu uamanusuile kuhandeka viuma evi, vivunga via vantu vialikomokelele ha kulongesa cendi. <verse eid="MAT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 7:29" />Muomu uavalongesele ngue uje alina nzili yakama keti ngue valongisi vavo va mezi a mashiko.<verse eid="MAT 7:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MAT 8" />
  <para style="s">Yesu akanguisa yala ua mbumba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Mako 1:40-45</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luka 5:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 8:1" />Omo Yesu uasikumukile kuhuma ha munkinda, vivunga viakama viamukavele, <verse eid="MAT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 8:2" />kaha taleni, muka mbumba uezile kuli ikeye nakumutsikamena nakuhandeka nguendi, “Muene nga utonda uasa kunjilelesa.”<verse eid="MAT 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 8:3" />Kaha Yesu uoluele livoko liendi nakumukuata nakuhandeka nguendi, “Njitonda, lela.” Kaha hajevene uje yala uakangukile ku mbumba yendi. <verse eid="MAT 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 8:4" />Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Keti ukalekeko cipue umo, vuno honi ya ukalimuese kuli kasasendote, kaha ukahane vuana vuje vuashikile Mosesa, linga cipue vukaleho ku vantu.”<verse eid="MAT 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akanguisa ngamba ya mukuluntu ua masualale va Loma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 7:1-10">Luka 7:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 8:5" />Omo Yesu uakovelele mu Kapenauma, mukuluntu ua masualale va Loma uezile kuli ikeye mukumulomba vukuasi, <verse eid="MAT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 8:6" />kaha uahandekele nguendi, “Muene, ngamba yange nakosa mu njivo ali nakuvavala kalepa, kaha alinakuvua cikuma kuvavala.”<verse eid="MAT 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 8:7" />Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Njija nakumukanguisa.”<verse eid="MAT 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 8:8" />Vuno honi uje mukuluntu ua masualale uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Muene, kucanjipandele yove kukovela mu njivo yange, vuno honi handeka lika lizi, kaha ngamba yange akakanguka. <verse eid="MAT 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 8:9" />Muomu nange naua nji lisualale uje ononoka vaje vanjituamenena, kaha nange naua njili na masualale vaje vanjikatuamenena, kaha njihandeka kuli umo nguange, ‘Ya,’ kaha aya, kaha kuli mukuavo naua nguange ‘Ija,’ kaha eja, kuli ndungo yange nguange, ‘Linga eci,’ kaha acilinga.”<verse eid="MAT 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 8:10" />Omo Yesu uevuile vije viahandekele, ualikomokelele cikuma, kaha uahandekele kuli vaje vakele naku mukava nguendi, “Muavusunga njimileka nguange, cipue mu Isaleli kunjauanene lutsilielo luangacije. <verse eid="MAT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 8:11" />Njimileka nguange vavengi vakeja, vakahuma mu ngangela na mu kangombe kayambi, kaha vakatumama ku ciuano hamo na Avilahama, na Isake, na Yakomba, mu Vumuene vua muilu, <verse eid="MAT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 8:12" />vuno honi vana va Vumuene vakavombila mu milima hambanza, kuje kukakala kulila na kulishumanga ku mazo” <verse eid="MAT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 8:13" />Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli uje mukuluntu ua masualale nguendi, “Ya, cilingiue ngoco kuli yove ngue muje munatsiliela.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 8:13">Kaha ngamba yendi uakangukile ha ntsimbu ije vene.<verse eid="MAT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akanguisa vantu vavengi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Mako 1:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luka 4:38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 8:14" />Kaha omo Yesu uakovelele mu njivo ya Petulu, uauanene vainamueno ya Petulu vanakosa vakele nakuvavala lisika sika. <verse eid="MAT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 8:15" />Kaha uamukuatele ku livoko liendi, kaha lisika sika liamuhumine, uahindukile nakuputuka kumupangela.<verse eid="MAT 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 8:16" />Kaha ku cinguezi cije vene vamunehelele vantu vavengi vaje vakele na mahamba, uahumisile vimbembesi na lizi, kaha uakanguisile vaka kuvavala voshe. <verse eid="MAT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 8:17" />Eci capuile linga vilishulisise vije viahandekele kananguizi Isaya nguendi, “Uambatele makalu etu, kaha uambatele mishongo yetu.”<verse eid="MAT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makalu akala hakukava Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:57-62">Luka 9:57-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 8:18" />Omo Yesu uamuene civunga cakama cinamuzengeleka, uashikile vandongisi vendi linga vaye musinia lia cisali. <verse eid="MAT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 8:19" />Kaha mulongisi ua mashiko uezile kuli ikeye nakuhandeka nguendi, “Mulongisi, njikukavangeya kuoshe ku ukaya.”<verse eid="MAT 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 8:20" />Kaha Yesu uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Vambanje valina mena, kaha naua na tuzila va muilu valina mashua, vuno honi Muna Muntu kesi na cihela cakuhuimina.”<verse eid="MAT 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 8:21" />Kaha naua umo ua vandongisi vendi uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Muene, tahi njiye njikatsinde tate.”<verse eid="MAT 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 8:22" />Vuno honi Yesu uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Njikave, kaha seza vatsi vatsinde vatsi vakuavo.”<verse eid="MAT 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aholuesa mankimba akama</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Mako 4:35-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luka 8:22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 8:23" />Kaha omo Yesu uakovelele mu vuato, vandongisi vendi vamukavele. <verse eid="MAT 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 8:24" />Kaha taleni, kuakatukile mankimba akama cikuma ha cisali, kaha vuato vuakele nakuninganga na mankimba, vuno honi Yesu tele nakosa. <verse eid="MAT 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 8:25" />Kaha vayile nakumuhindula nakuhandeka nguavo, “Tuovole Muene, tuli nakunonga.”<verse eid="MAT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 8:26" />Kaha uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Vika muteua, yeni vamala va lutsilielo lualundende?” Ambahoni uakatukile nakutenukila mpunzi na mankimba, kaha aholokele kuluu.<verse eid="MAT 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 8:27" />Kaha vandongisi vendi valikomokelele cikuma nakuhandeka nguavo, “Muntu uacifua muka ou, uje cipue mpunzi na mankimba vimuononoka!”<verse eid="MAT 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akanguisa vamala vavali vaka mahamba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Mako 5:1-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luka 8:26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 8:28" />Omo Yesu uahetele musinia lia cisali ku cihela ca Ngandalena, ualiuanene na vamala vavali vaje vakele na mahamba tele vahuminina ha vihilo. Kaha muomu ya vutenu vuavo naumo uahi uasele kuhita ngila ije. <verse eid="MAT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 8:29" />Kaha vatambekele nguavo, “Utonda kulinga vika netu yove Muna Njambi? Uneja nakutuhana kashitiku oku kanda ntsimbu yetu iheteho ndi?”<verse eid="MAT 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 8:30" />Kuyehi navo kuakele vutanga vua vangulu vavengi vaje vakele nakulia. <verse eid="MAT 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 8:31" />Kaha mahamba amulombele nguauo, “Nga utuhumisa, tutavese linga tukakovele mu vutanga vua vangulu.”<verse eid="MAT 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 8:32" />Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Yeni.” Kaha aje mahamba ahumine nakukakovela mu vutanga vua vangulu. Hajevene vuje vutanga vua vangulu vuoshe vuasikumukile nakushatukila mu cisali. Kaha vuakanongelele mu mema.<verse eid="MAT 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 8:33" />Vaje vantu vaje vakele nakuniunga vangulu vashatukilile mu nganda nakukambulula vije vioshe vamuene navije vialingiuile kuli vaje vamala vaka mahamba. <verse eid="MAT 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 8:34" />Kaha taleni, vantu voshe vahumine mu nganda vezile nakuliuana na Yesu, kaha omo vamumuene, vamulombele ngeci ahume mu cihela cavo.<verse eid="MAT 8:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MAT 9" />
  <para style="s">Yesu akanguisa yala uakalepa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Mako 2:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luka 5:17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 9:1" />Omo Yesu uakovelele mu vuato, uajavukilile musinia, kaha uayile ku nganda yendi. <verse eid="MAT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 9:2" />Kaha hajevene vamunehelelele muka kalepa uakosele ha citala tala cendi. Kaha omo Yesu uamuene lutsilielo luavo, uahandekele kuli uje muka kalepa nguendi, “Simpa, munange, vupi vuove vana vukonekela.”<verse eid="MAT 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 9:3" />Kaha vamo valongisi va Lishiko valihandekesele umo na mukuavo nguavo, “Ou yala alina kushaula Njambi!”<verse eid="MAT 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 9:4" />Vuno honi Yesu hakuzivuka viyongola viavo uahandekele nguendi, “Vika muli nakuyonguela viuma via vipi mu mitima yeni? <verse eid="MAT 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 9:5" />Nkuma cacasi cika kuhandeka nguange, vupi vuove vanavukonekela, cipue kuhandeka nguange katuka uende? <verse eid="MAT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 9:6" />Ngeci muzivuke ngueni Muna Muntu ali na nzili yakama cikuma hano ha mavu yakukonekela vupi.” Kaha uahandekele kuli uje muka kalepa nguendi, “Katuka, ambata citala tala cove, kaha ya kuimbo!”<verse eid="MAT 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 9:7" />Kaha uakatukile, nakuya kuimbo. <verse eid="MAT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 9:8" />Omo civunga vamuene vije vialingiuile, vakele na liova, kaha vashangazalele Njambi, uje uahanene nzili yakama cikuma ku vantu.<verse eid="MAT 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu asana Mateu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Mako 2:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luka 5:27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 9:9" />Omo Yesu uahumine kuje ku cihela, uamuene yala ivatumbula nguavo Mateu uatumamene mu njivo ya kutambuila lisimu. Kaha uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Njikave.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 9:9">Kaha Mateu uakatukile nakumukava.<verse eid="MAT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 9:10" />Omo uatumamene ku mesa mu njivo, kaha vavengi vaka kutambula lisimu na vaka vupi vezile nakutumama hamo na Yesu na vandongisi vendi. <verse eid="MAT 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 9:11" />Kaha omo Vafaliseho vacimuene, vahandekele kuli vandongisi vendi nguavo, “Vika mulongisi ueni alinakulia na vaka kutambula lisimu na vaka vupi?”<verse eid="MAT 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 9:12" />Vuno honi omo uavevuile, uahandekele nguendi, “Vakangule kuvekusetela cimbanda, vuno honi kuvanga lika vaka kuvavala. <verse eid="MAT 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 9:13" />Yemuye mukalilongese vika eci cilumbunuka, ‘Njishunguiya cikeketima, keti nkombelo.’ Muomu kunjezile mukusana vaka vusunga, vuno honi vaka vupi.”<verse eid="MAT 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cihula ca ha kuliumina kulia</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Mako 2:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luka 5:33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 9:14" />Kaha vandongisi va Yiuano muka kumbuitika vezile kuli ikeye nakuhandeka nguavo, “Vika yetu na Vafaliseho tukaliumina kulia, vuno honi vandongisi vove kuvekuliumina kulia?”<verse eid="MAT 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 9:15" />Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Nkuma vangenzi vaje vali ku ciuano ca vulo vanapande kulila oku liavenia vulo acili navo ndi? Matangua akeja omo uje liavenia vulo vakamuambata hali vakevo ambahoni vakaliumine kulia.<verse eid="MAT 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 9:16" />“Naumo uahi asa kutongela citope ca ntanga yaiha ha kazaku kalaja, muomu cije citope caciha cikatavula kaje kazaku kaha mukasala mbengua yakama kupulakana muje yakele. <verse eid="MAT 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 9:17" />Naumo uahi asa kuhaka viniu via viha mu vinjenge via vilambu via laja, nga mulinga ngoco kaha vije vinjeke via vilambu vikatavuka, kaha vije viniu vikahitila muangoco na vije vilambu kaha vikapihia, vuno honi viniu via viha vaka vihaka mu vinjeke via vilambu via viha kaha mukulinga ngoco vioshe vivali vikakala muacili.”<verse eid="MAT 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muna Njailosi ua mumbanda na mpuevo uje uakuatele ku kazaku ka Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Mako 5:21-43</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luka 8:40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 9:18" />Tele Yesu acilinakuhandeka navo, taleni muka kuyula ua Vayunda uezile kuli ikeye nakumutsikamena, uahandekele nguendi, “Munange ua mumbanda natsi hano vene, vuno honi ija nakumusaleka livoko liove, kaha akayoya.”<verse eid="MAT 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 9:19" />Kaha Yesu uakatukile nakumukava hamo na vandongisi vendi.<verse eid="MAT 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 9:20" />Kaha taleni, mpuevo uje uayandele ku mushongo ua kuhita maninga ha miaka yakupua likumi na ivali uezile munima yendi kaha uamukuatele ku mukunduilo ua kazaku kendi, <verse eid="MAT 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 9:21" />muomu uahandekele kuli ikeye vavenia nguendi, “Nga njikuata lika ku kazaku kendi kaha njikanguka.”<verse eid="MAT 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 9:22" />Omo Yesu uatengulukile uamumuene kaha uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Simpa, munange ua mpuevo, lutsilielo luove luakukanguisa.” Kaha hajevene uje mpuevo uakangukile.<verse eid="MAT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 9:23" />Kaha omo Yesu uakovelele mu njivo ya uje mukuluntu ua masualale, uamuene vaje vakakuimba miaso yaha viakutsa na civunga cakele nakulila,<verse eid="MAT 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 9:24" />Kaha uahandekele nguendi, “Tuhukeni! Muomu ou muanike uampuevo katsile vuno honi nakosa lika.” Kaha vamujolele. <verse eid="MAT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 9:25" />Vuno honi omo civunga catuhukile hambanza, uakovelele mukati kaha uakuatele uje muanike uampuevo ku livoko nakumuhindula, kaha uje muanike uahindukile. <verse eid="MAT 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 9:26" />Kaha muzimbu ou ualishanduokelele mu nganda yoshe ije.<verse eid="MAT 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akanguisa tupuputua vavali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 9:27" />Kaha omo Yesu uahumine kuje, tupuputua vavali vamukavele, vatambekele nguavo, “Tuivuileko cikeketima Muna Ndaviti,”<verse eid="MAT 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 9:28" />Omo uakovelele mu njivo, vaje tupuputua vavali vezile kuli ikeye, kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Mutsiliela ngueni njasa kucilinga eci ndi?” Kaha vamukumbuluile nguavo,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 9:28">“Eyo Muene.”<verse eid="MAT 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 9:29" />Ambahoni uakuatele ha mesho avo nakuhandeka nguendi, “Kuya ku lutsilielo lueni cilingiue ngocovene kuli yeni.” <verse eid="MAT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 9:30" />Kaha mesho avo emukile, kaha Yesu uavashikile nguendi, “Keti mukalekeko muntu cipue umo.”<verse eid="MAT 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 9:31" />Vuno honi vayile nakushanduola lutsimo luendi mu nganda muoshe muje.<verse eid="MAT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akanguisa yala ua kaveveve</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 9:32" />Omo vaje vamala vakele nakuya, kaha kuakele vamo vantu vanehelelele Yesu yala ua kaveveve uje uakele na lihamba. <verse eid="MAT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 9:33" />Kaha omo lije lihamba valihumisile, uje yala ua kaveveve uaputukile kuhandeka, kaha vivunga vialikomokelele cikuma nakuhandeka nguavio, “Nacimo cahi cakufua ngue eci cituamona muno mu Isaleli.”<verse eid="MAT 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 9:34" />Vuno honi Vafaliseho vahandekele nguavo, “Akahumisa mahamba na nzili ya muene ua mahamba.”<verse eid="MAT 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ovuila vantu cikeketima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 9:35" />Kaha Yesu uendanganene mu vinganda vioshe na mu membo oshe, uakele nakulongesa mu vinjivo viavo via malombelo nakuambulula Muzimbu Uacili ua Vumuene, uakanguisile mishongo yoshe na mavezi oshe. <verse eid="MAT 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 9:36" />Omo uamuene vivunga via vantu kaha uavivuililile ngozi, muomu vakele nakulinienga nakuhona viakulinga ngue vampanga vaje vakuhona kaniungi. <verse eid="MAT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 9:37" />Kaha uahandekele kuli vandongisi vendi nguendi, “Viakuteja vinapu viavingi vuno honi vaka kupanga vavandende. <verse eid="MAT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 9:38" />Nankuma lombeleni kuli Muene ua vaka kuteja linga atume vaka kupanga kuviakuteja viendi.”<verse eid="MAT 9:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MAT 10" />
  <para style="s">Tunganda likumi na vavali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mako 3:13-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luka 6:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 10:1" />Kaha Yesu uasanene vandongisi vendi likumi na vavali, kaha uavahanene nzili yakama ha vimbembesi via vipi, nakuvihumisa, nakukanguisa mishongo yoshe na vaka kuvavala. <verse eid="MAT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 10:2" />Mazina a tunganda likumi na vavali aua, uakulivanga Simoni uje ivatumbula nguavo Petulu, na munaina Anduleo, na Yakomba muna Zembendeo, na munaina Yiuano. <verse eid="MAT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 10:3" />Filipu na Mbatolomeo, Tomasi na Mateu muka kutambula lisimu, na Yakomba muna Alufeya, na Tandeo, <verse eid="MAT 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 10:4" />Simoni uaku Kanana, na Yunda Sakaliote uje uendele Yesu vungungu.<verse eid="MAT 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vipangi via vaje tunganda likumi na vavali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Mako 6:7-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luka 9:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 10:5" />Kaha Yesu uatumine likumi na vavali, uavashikile nguendi, “Keti muye kuli vaje keti Vayunda, kaha keti mukovele mu nganda ya Samaliya. <verse eid="MAT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 10:6" />Vuno honi yeni ku vampanga vaje vazimbala va mu njivo ya Isaleli. <verse eid="MAT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 10:7" />Kaha oku muli nakuya ambululeni ngueni, ‘Vumuene vua muilu vuli muyehi.’ <verse eid="MAT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 10:8" />Kanguiseni vaka kuvavala, hinduleni vaka kutsa, kanguiseni vaka mbumba, muhumise mahamba. Muatambuile kuakuhona kufueta, kaha haneni kuakuhona kufuetesa. <verse eid="MAT 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 10:9" />Keti muambate Ngolinde cipue Siliva cipue vunengu mu vinkombe vieni, <verse eid="MAT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 10:10" />keti muambate cola ha vungezi vueni cipue vikovelo vivali cipue vinkaku, cipue mbueti, omo muka kupanga napande kutambula vije viatonda.<verse eid="MAT 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 10:11" />“Kaha nganda cipue limbo lioshe mukovela, tondeni muntu iya uje napande ku mitambula muacili, kaha tumameni nendi noho mukahumamo. <verse eid="MAT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 10:12" />Omo mukovela mu njivo, menekeni vaje muuanamo. <verse eid="MAT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 10:13" />Kaha nga muje mu njivo vanamitambula muacili, ciyulo ceni cikale navo, vuno honi nga kuvamitambuile muacili, kaha ciyulo ceni cimihilukile. <verse eid="MAT 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 10:14" />Kaha nga kuli umo uje kamitambula cipue kuvuilila ku mezi eni, kaha totomoneni likungu ku viliato vieni, omo muhuma muje mu njivo cipue muje mu nganda. <verse eid="MAT 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 10:15" />Muavusunga njimileka nguange, ha litangua lia kusompa Njambi akahana kashitiko cikuma ku cihela cije kupulakana Sondoma na Ngomola.<verse eid="MAT 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mapakeso aje ali nakuija</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:9-13">Mako 13:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:12-17">Luka 21:12-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 10:16" />“Taleni, njimituma ngue vampanga hakati ka tungunga, kaha zangameni ngue manoka kaha ononokeni ngue mavembe. <verse eid="MAT 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 10:17" />Zangameni ku vantu, muomu vakamituala ku vinzango, na kumipupanga mu vinjivo viavo via malombelo. <verse eid="MAT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 10:18" />Kaha vakamituala ku vanguvulu na kuli vimiene muomu yange, linga cikapue vukaleho kuli vakevo na kuli vaje keti Vayunda. <verse eid="MAT 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 10:19" />Omo vamituala, keti mulishoshomuene mumuka handekela cipue vimukahandeka, muomu vije vimukahandeka vakamihanavio ha ntsimbu ije. <verse eid="MAT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 10:20" />Muomu keti yeni mukahandeka, vuno honi Cimbembesi ca Ishueni cikahandeka muli yeni.<verse eid="MAT 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 10:21" />“Muntu akatuala munaina mukutsa, kaha ishe akatuala munendi, kaha vana vakaluisa visemi vavo na kuvatsihisa. <verse eid="MAT 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 10:22" />Kaha vakamizinda voshe muomu ya lizina liange. Vuno honi uje akakateya na kumamanusuilo akovoka. <verse eid="MAT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 10:23" />Omo vamiyandesa mu nganda imo, teueleni mukuavo, muavusunga njimileka nguange kumukendangana mu vinganda vioshe via Isaleli ntsimbu kanda Muna Muntu eje.<verse eid="MAT 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 10:24" />“Ndongisi kasa kupulakana mulongisi uendi, cipue ngamba kupulakana muene uendi. <verse eid="MAT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 10:25" />Capande ngeci ndongisi kupua ngue mulongisi uendi, na ngamba kupua ngue muene uendi. Nga vanatumbula muene ua njivo nguavo Mbelezembulu, kaha cikapua vati ku vaka njivo yendi.<verse eid="MAT 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uje itunapande kuvuila liova</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:2-7">Luka 12:2-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 10:26" />“Nankuma keti mukale na liova navo, muomu kukuesi civanafuiki civakahona kufukula, cipue cakushueka civakahona kuzivuka. <verse eid="MAT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 10:27" />Vinjimileka mu milima mu vihandeke mu ceke, kaha vije vimuvua vayeveta vihandekeleni helu lia njivo. <verse eid="MAT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 10:28" />Kaha keti muivuile liova vaje vatsiha lika muvila vuno honi kuvasa kutsiha muono, vuno honi ivuileni liova uje asa kunongesa muono na muvila mu ngehena. <verse eid="MAT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 10:29" />Nkuma keti tumpiasa vavali vakavalandesa ha muuaya uaya umo ndi? Vuno honi naumo uavo uahi akau ha mavu kuakuhona cizango ca Ishueni. <verse eid="MAT 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 10:30" />Vuno honi yeni cipue vinkambu via ku mitue yeni vanavitanda. <verse eid="MAT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 10:31" />Keti muvue liova, nankuma yeni muli naseho yakama kupulakana tumpiasa vavengi.<verse eid="MAT 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutava Yesu cipue kumuviana ku mesho a vantu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:8-9">Luka 12:8-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 10:32" />“Uoshe uje anjitava hakati ka vantu, nange naua njikamutava kuli Tate uje ali muilu, <verse eid="MAT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 10:33" />vuno honi uoshe uje akanjiviana ku mesho a vantu, nange naua njikamuviana ku mesho a Tate uje ali muilu.<verse eid="MAT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Keti ciyulo vuno honi nzita</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:51-53">Luka 12:51-53</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:26-27">14:26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 10:34" />“Keti musinganieke ngueni njinanehe ciyulo ha mavu, kunjezile nakuneha ciyulo, vuno honi nzita. <verse eid="MAT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 10:35" />Njineja nakulinga muana aluise ishe, kaha muana uampuevo aluisa vaina, vainamueno aluise vanayemueno, <verse eid="MAT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 10:36" />Kaha vitozi va muntu vakapua vavushoko vendi.<verse eid="MAT 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 10:37" />“Uoshe uje azanga ishe cipue ina cikuma kupulakana yange kaha kanjipandele, kaha uoshe uje azanga munendi ua yala cipue uampuevo cikuma kupulakana yange kaha kanjipandele, <verse eid="MAT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 10:38" />kaha uoshe uje kambata cilindakano cendi nakuhona kunjikava kaha kanjipandele. <verse eid="MAT 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 10:39" />Kaha uoshe uje atonda muono uendi akauzimbalesa, kaha na uoshe uje a zimbalesa muono uendi muomu yange akau uana.<verse eid="MAT 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mavuana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:41">Mako 9:41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 10:40" />“Uoshe uje amitambula natambula yange, kaha uoshe uje anjitambula natambula uje uanjitumine. <verse eid="MAT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 10:41" />Kaha uoshe uje akatambula kananguizi muomu napu kananguizi akatambula vuana vua kananguizi, kaha uoshe uje akatambula yala ua vusunga muomu ikeye napu yala ua vusunga akatambula vuana vua yala ua vusunga. <verse eid="MAT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 10:42" />Kaha uoshe uje ahana kuli umo uava vanike vavandende cipue lika nganja ya mema akutontola muomu napu ndongisi, muavusunga njimileka nguange kakazimbalesaho vuana vuendi.”<verse eid="MAT 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MAT 11" />
  <para style="s">Tunganda vaje vatumine Yiuano muka kumbuitika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 7:18-35">Luka 7:18-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 11:1" />Omo Yesu uamanusuile kushika vandongisi vendi likumi na vavali, uahumine kuje kaha uayile nakulongesa nakuambulula mu vinganda viavo.<verse eid="MAT 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 11:2" />Honi omo Yiuano tele ali mu kamenga uevuile vije vialingile Kilistu, kaha uatumine vandongisi vendi na mezi aua nguendi, <verse eid="MAT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 11:3" />yemuye mukahandeke kuli ikeye ngueni, “Yove uje ali nakuija indi tuvandamene mukuavo naua?”<verse eid="MAT 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 11:4" />Kaha Yesu uavakumbuluile nguendi, “Yemuye mukaleke Yiuano vije munevu navije munamono, <verse eid="MAT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 11:5" />tupuputua vamona na vilema venda, vaka mbumba vanajele na tuveveve vevua, vatsi vasanguka, kaha na vihutu vali nakuvambuluila Muzimbu Uacili. <verse eid="MAT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 11:6" />Uakukuisula uje kesi na vimpata hali yange.”<verse eid="MAT 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 11:7" />Omo vakele nakuya, Yesu uaputukile kuhandeka ku civunga via Yiuano nguendi, “Nkuma vika muayile mukumona mu mpambo? Muayile mukumona lihongo litepuzoka na mpunzi ndi? <verse eid="MAT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 11:8" />Indi vika honi muaililile kuje? Muayile mukumona muntu nazala vuzalo vuasenga ndi? Taleni, vaje vazala vuzalo vuasenga vakala mu mapela a muene. <verse eid="MAT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 11:9" />Vika muaililile kuje? Muayile mukumona kananguizi ndi? Eyo, njimileka nguange muakamuene viavingi kupulakana kananguizi. <verse eid="MAT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 11:10" />Ou ikeye vene uje ivasonekele nguavo, ‘Tala njikatuma kanganda kange kulutue luove, uje akavuahesa ngila yove. <verse eid="MAT 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 11:11" />Muavusunga njimileka nguange, hakati ka vaje vanasemuka ku mpuevo naumo uahi uakama nahumuho kupulakana Yiuano muka kumbuitika, vuno honi uoshe uje alikehesa mu Vumuene vua muilu napu uakama kupulakana ikeye. <verse eid="MAT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 11:12" />Kuhuma ku matangua a Yiuano muka kumbuitika kuheta kulelo lino, Vumuene vua muilu vunayanda cikuma kaha vantu vakukaluua mitima vanavuambata nampindangano. <verse eid="MAT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 11:13" />Muomu voshe tunanguizi na valongisi va mashiko vahandekele vunanguizi noho Yiuano, <verse eid="MAT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 11:14" />kaha nga mutonda kucitava, Yiuano ikeye Eliya uje akeja. <verse eid="MAT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 11:15" />Uoshe uje ali na matuitui ovue.<verse eid="MAT 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 11:16" />“Vuno honi vika njasa kusetekesa na vantu valelo? Njivasetekesa ngue vanike vaje vanatumama ku cihela ca kulandesela oku valisana muvakehela nguavo, <verse eid="MAT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 11:17" />‘Tuamiohieselele miaso, vuno honi kumuakinine, tuamimbilile miaso ya ha kutsa vuno honi kumualilile.’ <verse eid="MAT 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 11:18" />Muomu Yiuano uezile kuakuhona kulia cipue kunua, kaha vahandekele nguavo, ‘Ali na lihamba!’ <verse eid="MAT 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 11:19" />Kaha omo Muna Muntu uezile oku alia na kunua, kaha vahandeka nguavo, ‘Mutaleni uamutupu na cipenda, kavusamba ua vaka kutambula lisimu na vaka vupi!’ Vuno honi mana a Njambi vana ashulisisa na vilinga viendi.”<verse eid="MAT 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mu vinganda muje muakele vantu vakuhona kutsiliela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 10:13-15">Luka 10:13-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 11:20" />Kaha Yesu uaputukile kutenuka mu vinganda muje mualingile cikuma vikomoueso viendi, muomu kuvatengulukile. <verse eid="MAT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 11:21" />“Cisingo kuli yove Kolazini! Cisingo kuli yove Mbetesainda! Muomu nga vije vikomoueso vialingiuile muli yeni, ngue vialingiuililile mu Tile na Sindone ngue vatengulukile laja mukuzala vinjeke naku likuita muto. <verse eid="MAT 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 11:22" />Vuno honi njimileka nguange, ha litangua lia kusompa Njambi akevuila cikeketima Tile na Sindone kupulakana yeni. <verse eid="MAT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 11:23" />Kaha yove Kapenauma, nkuma uatondele kulijundula yove vavenia muilu ndi? Houe, vakakuneha ha mavu mu ngehena. Muomu nga vikomoueso vije vialingiuile kuli yove ngue vialingiuililile mu Sondoma, ngue nganda ije hanga kuicili na lelo lino. <verse eid="MAT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 11:24" />Vuno honi njimileka nguange, ha litangua lia kusompa Njambi akevuila cikeketima Sondoma kupulakana yove.”<verse eid="MAT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ijeni kuli yange muuane kuhuima</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 10:21-22">Luka 10:21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 11:25" />Kaha ha ntsimbu ije Yesu uahandekele nguendi, “Njitsantsela kuli yove Tate, Muene ua melu na mavu, muomu unashueke evi viuma kuli vaka mana na vaka kulilongesa, kaha unavisholola ku vanike vavandende. <verse eid="MAT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 11:26" />Eyo Tate, muomu mukemo muuatondele linga cilingiue.<verse eid="MAT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 11:27" />“Viuma vioshe Tate nanjihanavio, kaha naumo uahi azivuka Muana kuvanga lika Ishe, kaha naua naumo uahi azivuka Ishe kuvanga lika Muana na kuli vaje Muana ahangula linga avashololueye.<verse eid="MAT 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 11:28" />“Ijeni kuli yange yeni voshe vaje vanahono nakuambata viteli viakulema, kaha njikamihana kuhuima. <verse eid="MAT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 11:29" />Lituikeni mukambo uange, kaha lilongeseni kuli yange muomu yange njapua uakulikehesa nakulihana, kaha mukauana kuhuima mu miono yeni. <verse eid="MAT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 11:30" />Muomu mukambo uange uapua ua uasi, kaha na citeli cange capua ca cehu.”<verse eid="MAT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MAT 12" />
  <para style="s">Cihula ca ha litangua lia Sapalalo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mako 2:23-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luka 6:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 12:1" />Ha ntsimbu ije Yesu uahitile mu mehia a tiliku ha litangua lia Sapalalo. Vandongisi vendi vatsile njala, kaha vaputukile kutomona mitue ya tiliku nakulia. <verse eid="MAT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 12:2" />Vuno honi omo Vafaliseho vacimuene vahandekele kuli Yesu nguavo, “Tala vandongisi vove valinakulinga vije lishiko kulitavesa kulinga ha litangua lia Sapalalo.”<verse eid="MAT 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 12:3" />Kaha Yesu uavakumbuluile nguendi, “Nkuma kumuatandele vije Ndaviti ualingile na vaje vakele navo omo vatsile njala, <verse eid="MAT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 12:4" />muje muakovelele mu njivo ya Njambi nakulia mbolo ije ivalambuile kuli Njambi, cije kucapuile lishiko kuli ikeye ku ilia cipue vaje vakele navo, vuno honi kuvanga lika vasasendote ndi? <verse eid="MAT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 12:5" />Cipue nkuma kumuatandele mu lishiko vati muje ha litangua lia Sapalalo vasasendote mu Njivo ya Njambi muvapokuele mashiko a ha litangua lia Sapalalo, vuno honi kuvakele na mulonga ndi? <verse eid="MAT 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 12:6" />Njimileka nguange, cuma cakama kupulakana njivo ya Njambi cino cili hano. <verse eid="MAT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 12:7" />Kaha nga muazivuka vika evi vilumbununa, ‘Njatonda cikeketima, keti nkombelo,’ ngue kumuahisile vaje kuvesi na mulonga. <verse eid="MAT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 12:8" />Muomu Muna Muntu ikeye Muene ua litangua lia Sapalalo.”<verse eid="MAT 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akanguisa yala ua kusekua livoko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Mako 3:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luka 6:6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 12:9" />Yesu uahumine ku cihela cije kaha uayile nakukakovela mu njivo yavo ya malombelo. <verse eid="MAT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 12:10" />Kaha taleni, kuje vene kuakele yala uakusekua livoko, kaha vehuile Yesu nguavo, “Nkuma lishiko litavesa kukanguisa ha litangua lia Sapalalo ndi?” Vatondele linga vamuvangeyeleho.<verse eid="MAT 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 12:11" />Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Nga umo haliyeni ali na mpanga kaha auila mu cina ha litangua lia Sapalalo, nkuma kumuasa kumuhumisamo ndi? <verse eid="MAT 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 12:12" />Nkuma muntu kapuile uaseho cikuma kupulakana mpanga! Nankuma, cinapande kuya ku lishiko kulinga cacili ha litangua lia Sapalalo.” <verse eid="MAT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 12:13" />Ambahoni uahandekele kuli uje yala nguendi, “Olola livoko liove.” Kaha uje yala uoluele livoko liendi, kaha liolokele kupua hamo nalikuavo.<verse eid="MAT 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 12:14" />Vuno honi Vafaliseho vatuhukilemo kaha vakatumbile vutumbe muje vati vasa kutsihila Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngamba uakuhangula kuli Njambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 12:15" />Vuno honi Yesu uazivukile vutumbe vuavo, kaha uahumineko. Kaha vavengi vamukavele, kaha voshe uavakanguisile. <verse eid="MAT 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 12:16" />Kaha uavashikile nguendi keti vamutsimanese. <verse eid="MAT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 12:17" />Eci capuile linga vilishulisise vije viahandekele kananguizi Isaya nguendi,<verse eid="MAT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 12:18" />“Taleni ngamba yange injinahangula,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:18">uje injazanga kaha muli ikeye muono uange uvuahelela.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:18">Njikahaka Cimbembesi cange hali ikeye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:18">Kaha akahandeka vusunga kuli vaje keti Vayunda.<verse eid="MAT 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 12:19" />Kakakalaho na vimpata cipue kulila,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:19">kaha na umo uahi akevua lizi liendi mu vitapalo.<verse eid="MAT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 12:20" />Kakapokolaho lihongo liakuhenga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:20">Kakazimiho tuhia tuje tucili nakutuhuisa vuisi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:20">Kuvanga noho nanehe vusunga ku kuhiana.”<verse eid="MAT 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 12:21" />Kaha mu lizina liendi mukemo vakatsiliela vaje keti Vayunda.<verse eid="MAT 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu vamutumbula nguavo Mbelezembulu muene ua mahamba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:20-30">Mako 3:20-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luka 11:14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 12:22" />Ambahoni vantu vamo vanehelele Yesu yala uje ua kapuputua nakuhona kuhandeka uje uakele na lihamba kaha uamukanguisile, kaha uje yala ua kaveveve uaputukile kuhandeka nakumona. <verse eid="MAT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 12:23" />Kaha vantu voshe valikomokelele cikuma nakuhandeka nguavo, “Nkuma ou keti ikeye muna Ndaviti ndi?”<verse eid="MAT 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 12:24" />Vuno honi omo Vafaliseho vaviuvuile vahandekele nguavo, “Kuvanga lika na nzili ya Mbelezembulu muene ua mahamba, ikeyo ou yala yalinakuhumisa nayo mahamba.”<verse eid="MAT 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 12:25" />Yesu ha kuzivuka visinganieka viavo kaha uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Vumuene vuoshe vuje vukalitepe hakati nakuliluisa vukalipihisa, naimo yahi nganda yakama cipue njivo ije ililuisa ikeyo vavenia ikemana. <verse eid="MAT 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 12:26" />Kaha nga satana ahumisa mukuavo satana, kaha nalitepe hakati ikeye vavenia, kaha vatihoni vumuene vuendi vukakola? <verse eid="MAT 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 12:27" />Kaha nga njikahumisa mahamba na nzili ya Mbelezembulu, nkuma na nzili yeya vana veni vaka humisa? Nankuma vakevo vakamisompa. <verse eid="MAT 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 12:28" />Vuno honi nga njikalikuasesa Cimbembesi ua Njambi mukuhumisa mahamba, kaha Vumuene vua Njambi vuneja hali yeni.<verse eid="MAT 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 12:29" />“Cipue vatihoni muntu asa kukovela mu njivo ya yala uanzili nakuambata viuma viendi, nkuma keti tahi akuta uje yala uanzili ndi? Ambahoni apukule njivo yendi.<verse eid="MAT 12:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 12:30" />“Uje kesi nange anjiluisa, uje kalipandakana nange ashandola. <verse eid="MAT 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 12:31" />Nankuma njimileka nguange, vupi vuoshe nakushaula coshe ca vantu vakavikonekela, vuno honi kushaula Cimbembesi Uakulela kuvaka cikonekela. <verse eid="MAT 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 12:32" />Kaha uje uoshe ahandeka lizi lia kuluisa Muna Muntu vakamukonekela, Vuno honi uje uoshe ahandeka viakuluisa Cimbembesi Uakulela kuvaka mukonekela cipue mu miaka ino cipue mu miaka ije ilinakuija.<verse eid="MAT 12:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muti na vushuka vuauo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:43-45">Luka 6:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 12:33" />“Kukala na vushuka vuacili kuvanga muti uauo upue uacili, cipue kukala na muti ua upi na vushuka vuauo vupua vua vupi, muomu muti vakauzivukula ku vushuka vuauo. <verse eid="MAT 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 12:34" />Yeni vana vamanoka, muasa kuhandeka vati viacili omo yeni muapua mu vaka vupi? Muomu vije viashula ku mutima vikevio kanua kakahandeka. <verse eid="MAT 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 12:35" />Yala uacili akahumisa viuma viacili vije viakatulika mu citulikilo cendi ca cili, kaha yala ua mupi akahumisa viuma via vipi mu citulikilo cendi ca cipi.<verse eid="MAT 12:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 12:36" />“Njimileka nguange, ha litangua lia kusompa vantu vaka vasompa kuya ku mezi avo aje avakahandeka akuhona seho, <verse eid="MAT 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 12:37" />muomu kuya ku mezi ove mukemo muvaka kusompa kaha kuya ku mezi ove akeuo avakakuhisa nauo.”<verse eid="MAT 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Valomba Yesu cimueso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:11-12">Mako 8:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:29-32">Luka 11:29-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 12:38" />Ambahoni vamo valongisi va mezi na Vafaliseho vahandekele kuli Yesu nguavo, “Mulongisi tutonda yove linga utulingileko cimueso.”<verse eid="MAT 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 12:39" />Vuno honi uavakumbuluile nguendi, “Vantu vavupi na vupangala vantsimbu ino vakevo vatonda cimueso, vuno honi nacimo cahi cimueso civakavahana kuvanga lika cimueso ca kananguizi Yona. <verse eid="MAT 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 12:40" />Muomu Yona uakele muzimo lia intsi ha matangua na matsiki atatu, mucifua cimo vene na Muna Muntu akakala mu vukalo vua vatsi ha matangua na matsiki atatu. <verse eid="MAT 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 12:41" />Vantu vaku Ninive vakemana ha litangua lia kusompa na vantu vantsimbu ino kaha vaka vahisa, muomu vatengulukile ku vipi viavo ha kuambulula ca Yona, kaha taleni cuma cakama cikuma kupulakana Yona cino cili hano. <verse eid="MAT 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 12:42" />Lisano uaku Shemba akemana ha litangua lia kusompa na vantu vantsimbu ino nakuvahisa, muomu uahumine kuntsongo ya cifuti kuija nakuvuilila mana a Solomoni, kaha taleni umo uakama kupulakana Solomoni uno ali hano.<verse eid="MAT 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhiluka ca cimbembesi cacipi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:24-26">Luka 11:24-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 12:43" />“Omo cimbembesi cacipi cihuma muli muntu, cikahiti mu vindinda kutonda kuakuhuimina, vuno honi kucekuuana cipue hamo. <verse eid="MAT 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 12:44" />Ambahoni cihandeka nguaco ‘Njihilukila ku njivo yange kuje njahuminine.’ Kaha omo cihiluka ciuana ije njivo mupulungua, muakukomba nakuivuahesa muje muinapande kukelamo. <verse eid="MAT 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 12:45" />Ambahoni ciya nakuambata vikuavo vimbembsi vitanu na vivali vije via vipi cikuma kupulakana cikeco, kaha vakovelamo nakukakalamo, kaha cifua ca uje yala ca mamanusuilo cikapua cacipi kupulakana caha kulivanga. Omu mukemo vene mu vakafua na vantu vantsimbu ino.”<verse eid="MAT 12:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vaina na vamunaina ya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mako 3:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luka 8:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 12:46" />Tele Yesu acili nakuhandeka ku vantu, taleni vaina na vamunaina vemanene hambanza, vatondele linga vahandeka nendi. <verse eid="MAT 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 12:47" />Kaha umo ua vantu vaje kuje uamulekele nguendi, “Tala, vanoko na vamuanoko vanemana hambanza vatonda kuhandeka nove.”<verse eid="MAT 12:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 12:48" />Vuno honi Yesu uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Iya vanana, kaha iya naua vamuanetu?” <verse eid="MAT 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 12:49" />Kaha uoluele livoko liendi kuli vandongisi vendi nakuhandeka nguendi, “Ava vakevo vanana na vamuanetu! <verse eid="MAT 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 12:50" />Muomu uoshe uje alinga cizango ca Tate ua muilu ikeye napu muanetu ua yala na uampuevo na nana.”<verse eid="MAT 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MAT 13" />
  <para style="s">Cisimo ca muka kukuva vimbuto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Mako 4:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luka 8:4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 13:1" />Ha Litangua lije vene, Yesu uahumine mu njivo kaha uayile nakukatumama ku mukulo ua cisali. <verse eid="MAT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 13:2" />Kaha vivunga viakama viezile kuli ikeye nakumuzengeleka, nankuma uakovelele mu vuato nakukatumama, kaha civunga coshe cemanene ku cikuma ca cisali. <verse eid="MAT 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 13:3" />Kaha uavalekele viuma viavingi mukulikuasesa visimo nguendi,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:3">“Muka kukuva uayile nakukuva. <verse eid="MAT 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 13:4" />Kaha omo uakele nakukuva vimbuto vimo viauililile ku mukulo ua ngila, kaha tuzila vezile nakuvilia. <verse eid="MAT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 13:5" />Kaha vimbuto vikuavo viauililile ha mavue aje kuhakele livu lialingi, kaha hajevene viasokele, muomu kuhakele livu lia lingi. <verse eid="MAT 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 13:6" />Vuno honi omo litangua liatuhukile kaha vije vimbuto viajujuamene, muomu mizi yavio kuyakovelele cikuma mu livu, kaha vije vimbuto viomine. <verse eid="MAT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 13:7" />Vimbuto vikuavo viauililile hakati ka mingonga, kaha ije mingonga yakolele nakuvituva. <verse eid="MAT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 13:8" />Vimbuto vikuavo viauililile ha mavu acili kaha viemine muacili, vimo vimbuto vihita, vimo viemine vimbuto makumi atanu na limo, kaha vikuavo naua viemine vimbuto makumi atatu kupulakana vije vivakunine. <verse eid="MAT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 13:9" />Uoshe uje hali na matuitui ovue.”<verse eid="MAT 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vutumbe vua visimo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Mako 4:10-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Luka 8:9-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 13:10" />Ambahoni vandongisi vezile kuli Yesu nakuhandeka nguavo, “Vika honi ukahandekela navo mu visimo?”<verse eid="MAT 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 13:11" />Kaha uavakumbuluile nguendi, “Yeni vanamihana kuzivuka vushueke vua vumuene vua muilu, vuno honi kuli vakevo kuva vahanenevuo. <verse eid="MAT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 13:12" />Muomu uoshe uje alinavio vakamuvuezelako vikuavo naua, kaha akakala na viavingi, vuno honi uje kesi cipue nacimo, cipue cije cali naco vakamuniekaco. <verse eid="MAT 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 13:13" />Eci cikeco canehesa linga njihandeke navo mu visimo muomu vakevo vamona, vuno honi kuvamonesesa, kaha vovua, vuno honi kuvevuisisa. <verse eid="MAT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 13:14" />Cilivene kuli vakevo vinalishulisisa vije viahandekele kananguizi Isaya nguendi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:14">“‘Cilivene mukevua vuno honi kumukevuisisa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:14">kaha cilivene mukamona vuno honi kumukamonesesa.<verse eid="MAT 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 13:15" />Muomu mitima yava vantu inahono mana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">kaha na matuitui avo anaziki,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">kaha na mesho avo vana afuiki,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">keti ngoconi mesho avo akamona</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">kaha na matuitui avo akevua,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">kaha na mitima yavo ikevuisisa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">nakutengulukila kuli yange, muanahandeka Njambi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">linga njivakanguise.’<verse eid="MAT 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 13:16" />“Vuno honi akukuisula mesho eni muomu amona, na matuitui eni, muomu ovua. <verse eid="MAT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 13:17" />Muavusunga njihandeka kuli yeni nguange, tunanguizi vavengi na vantu va vusunga vatondele kumona cikuma evi vimuli nakumona, vuno honi kuvavimuene, nakuivua vije vimulinakuvua, vuno honi kuvaviuvuile.<verse eid="MAT 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alumbununa cisimo ca muka kukuva mbuto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Mako 4:13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luka 8:11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 13:18" />“Ambahoni ivuilileni cisimo ca uje muka kukuva. <verse eid="MAT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 13:19" />Omo uoshe uje ovua lizi lia Vumuene kaha kaliuvuisisa, kaha uje muka vupi eja nakuambata vije vivanakuvu mu mutima uendi, eyi ikeyo mbuto ije ivakuvile ku mukulo uangila. <verse eid="MAT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 13:20" />Kaha mbuto ije ivakuvile ha mavu a mavue, ava vakevo vaje vovua lizi kaha hajevene valitambula nanzolela, <verse eid="MAT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 13:21" />vuno honi kuliesi na mizi muli vakevo, kaha likala lika muka ntsimbu kandende. Kaha omo tuyando cipue mapakeso vija muomu ya lizi, kaha hajevene ku valikavangeya. <verse eid="MAT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 13:22" />Kaha vimbuto vije vivakuvile ha mingonga, ava vakevo vovua lizi, vuno honi omo ha kuzanga via ha mavu nakuzanga vufuko vua mavu kaha vikatuva lije lizi, kaha kulikemi vushuka. <verse eid="MAT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 13:23" />Kaha ije mbuto ivakuvile ha mavu acili, ava vakevo vaje vovua lizi nakulivuisisa, vakevo cilivene vakema vushuka vuavuingi vuakupua vimo vimbuto vihita, vimo vikuavo viemine makumi atanu na limo, kaha vikuavo naua viemine makumi atatu kupulakana vije vivakuvile.”<verse eid="MAT 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cisimo ca shaku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 13:24" />Kaha Yesu uavatelele cisimo cikuavo naua nguendi, “Vumuene vua muilu tuasa kuvusetekesa ngue yala uje uakuvile mbuto yacili mu lihia liendi, <verse eid="MAT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 13:25" />vuno honi tele vantu vanakosa, citozi cendi uezile nakukuva shaku muje mu lihia lia tiliku, kaha uayile. <verse eid="MAT 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 13:26" />Omo ije tiliku yakolele nakuhaka vinona ambahoni naikeyo ije shaku yasholokele. <verse eid="MAT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 13:27" />Kaha vaje vangamba vendi vezile kuli ikeye nakumuleka nguavo, ‘Muene nkuma ku uakunine lika mbuto yacili mu lihia liove ndi? Kaha cineja vati honi linga mukale naua na shaku?’ <verse eid="MAT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 13:28" />Kaha uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, ‘Kuli citozi uje nalingi eci.’ Kaha vaje vangamba vendi vahandekele kuli ikeye nguavo, ‘Nkuma utonda linga tuye tukaitukulemo ndi?’ <verse eid="MAT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 13:29" />Vuno honi uavakumbuluile nguendi, ‘Houe!’ Muomu muje mu mukaitukulamo ije shaku hamo mukatukuila kumo na tiliku. <verse eid="MAT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 13:30" />Vieceleni vioshe linga vikole kuvanga noho ha ntsimbu yakuteja, kaha ha ntsimbu yakuteja njikaleka vaka kuteja nguange, ‘Tukulenimo tahi shaku muikute mikuta, kaha itsimikeni, vuno honi kungululeni tiliku nakuihaka mu cishete cange.’”<verse eid="MAT 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cisimo ca mbuto ya musalata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Mako 4:30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luka 13:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 13:31" />Kaha Yesu uavatelele cisimo cikuavo naua nguendi, “Vumuene vua muilu vunapu ngue nona ya mbuto ya musalata ije muntu uambatele nakukuna mu lihia liendi. <verse eid="MAT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 13:32" />Yapua yaindende cikuma ku vimbuto vioshe, vuno honi omo ikola ikapu ciputa cakama na kukola kupua muti, nankuma tuzila va muilu vakeja nakutungila mashua ha mintango yauo.”<verse eid="MAT 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cisimo ca cimbaluila</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:20-21">Luka 13:20-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 13:33" />Kaha Yesu uavatelele naua cisimo cikuavo nguendi, “Vumuene vua muilu vuapua ngue cimbaluila cije mpuevo uambatele nakucishingasanena ha lilonga haje hakele vinganja vitatu via vunga vua tiliku kuvanga noho vioshe viafutunukile.”<verse eid="MAT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vika Yesu akalikuasesela visimo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:33-34">Mako 4:33-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 13:34" />Vioshe evi Yesu uavihandekele ku vivunga mu visimo, cilivene nacimo cahi cahandekele kuli vakevo kuakuhona kulikuasesa cisimo. <verse eid="MAT 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 13:35" />Eci capuile kushulisisa vije viahandekele kananguizi nguendi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:35">“Njikafukula kanua kange mu visimo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:35">Njikahandeka vioshe vije vialishueka hume ha luvula lua mavu.”<verse eid="MAT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alumbununa cisimo ca shaku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 13:36" />Ambahoni Yesu uasezele civunga nakuya mu njivo kaha vandongisi vendi vezile kuli ikeye nakuhandeka nguavo, “Tulumbunuine cisimo ca shaku ya mu lihia.”<verse eid="MAT 13:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 13:37" />Kaha uavakumbuluile nguendi, “Uoshe uje akuna mbuto yacili napu Muna Muntu. <verse eid="MAT 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 13:38" />Lihia likelio mavu, kaha mbuto ije yacili ilumbununa vana va Vumuene, kaha naije shaku inapu vana va muka vupi, <verse eid="MAT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 13:39" />kaha uje citozi uje ua ikuninemo ikeye napu Satana. Kaha kuteja cikeco kuhua ca mavu, kaha vaka kuteja vakevo tungelo. <verse eid="MAT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 13:40" />Ngue mujevene muvaka kungungulula shaku nakuitsimika na tuhia, mukemovene mu cikafua naku mamanusuilo a mavu. <verse eid="MAT 13:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 13:41" />Muna Muntu akatuma tungelo vendi, kaha vaka kunguluila hamo vije vikanehesa vupi navaje vakalingi vupi mu Vumuene vuendi, <verse eid="MAT 13:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 13:42" />nakuvombila mu litende lia tuhia, kuje vantu vaka lila nakulishumanga ku mazo <verse eid="MAT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 13:43" />Ambahoni vaka vusunga vaka viakuma ngue litangua mu vumuene vua Ishavo, uoshe uje ali na matuitui ovue.<verse eid="MAT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cisimo ca vufuko vuakushueka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 13:44" />“Vumuene vua muilu vunapu ngue vufuko vuakushueka mu lihia, vuje omo muntu avuuana kaha avushueka naua ambahoni hakuvuahelela cendi aya nakukalandesa vioshe vije alinavio kaha alanda lije lihia.<verse eid="MAT 13:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cisimo ca vusanga vua seho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 13:45" />“Naua Vumuene vua muilu vunapu ngue muntu uje muka kulandesa uje atonda vusanga vuaseho, <verse eid="MAT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 13:46" />uje omo auana vusanga vumo vua seho yakama, kaha aya nakukalandesa vioshe vije alinavio kaha akavulanda.<verse eid="MAT 13:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cisimo ca vuanda vuakuta vantsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 13:47" />“Naua Vumuene vua muilu vunapu ngue vuanda vua kuta vantsi vuje vuvanate mu cisali kaha vutsiha muyati uoshe ua vantsi, <verse eid="MAT 13:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 13:48" />omo vuashulile vamala vavukokelele ha ntunda kaha vatumamene nakuhangulamo vantsi vacili nakuvahaka mu mitonga yavo vuno honi vombilile vaje vakupihia. <verse eid="MAT 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 13:49" />Nankuma omu mukemo mucikafua naku mamanusuilo a mavu. Tungelo vakeja nakutepesa vaka vupi ku vaka vusunga, <verse eid="MAT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 13:50" />nakuvombila mu litende lia tuhia, kuje vantu vakalila nakulishumanga ku mazo<verse eid="MAT 13:50" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vusunga vua vuha novu vua laja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 13:51" />“Yesu uavehuile nguendi, nkuma munovuisisa viuma vioshe evi ndi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:51">Kaha vamukumbuluile nguavo, “Eyo.”<verse eid="MAT 13:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 13:52" />Kaha uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Nankuma uoshe mulongisi ua mashiko uje ivalongesele via Vumuene vua muilu napu ngue uje vavenia njivo, uje ahumisa vufuko vuendi vua laja novu vua vuha mu citulikilo cendi.”<verse eid="MAT 13:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu vamuviana ku Nazaleta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Mako 6:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luka 4:16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 13:53" />Kaha omo Yesu uamanusuile kuta vije visimo, uahumineko kuje, <verse eid="MAT 13:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 13:54" />nakuya ku cifuti cendi nakukavalongesa mu njivo yavo ya malombelo, kaha vaje voshe vamuvuile vali komokelele cikuma nakuhandeka nguavo, “Nkuma kuli ou yala kuanauana mana aua na vikomoueso evi? <verse eid="MAT 13:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 13:55" />Nkuma ou keti ikeye muna uje muka kushonga ndi? Nkuma vaina keti Maliya? Nkuma vamunaina keti Yakomba, na Yosefa, na Simoni na Yunda ndi? <verse eid="MAT 13:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 13:56" />Nkuma vashongo vendi voshe va vampuevo keti ava tuli hamo navo ndi? Nkuma kuli honi ou yala nauana vioshe evi?” <verse eid="MAT 13:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 13:57" />Kaha vamuvianene.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:57">Vuno honi Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Kananguizi kuveku musingimika mu cifuti cendi cipue muimbo liendi kuvanga lika kueka.” <verse eid="MAT 13:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 13:58" />Kaha kalingilileko vikomoueso kuje muomu ya kuhona kutsiliela cavo.<verse eid="MAT 13:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MAT 14" />
  <para style="s">Kutsa ca Yiuano muka kumbuitika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Mako 6:14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luka 9:7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 14:1" />Ha ntsimbu ije muene Helonde omo uevuile lutsimo lua Yesu, <verse eid="MAT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 14:2" />kaha uahandekele kuli vangamba vendi nguendi, “Ou ikeye Yiuano muka kumbuitika, vanamusangula ku vatsi, mukemo evi vinzili vili nakupanga muli ikeye.”<verse eid="MAT 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 14:3" />Muomu Helonde uakuatele Yiuano nakumukuta nakumuhaka mu kamenga, muomu ya mulonga ua Helondiya mpuevo ya munaina Filipu, <verse eid="MAT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 14:4" />muomu Yiuano uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Kuya ku lishiko yove ku uapandele kumuambata.” <verse eid="MAT 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 14:5" />Cipue vene uatondele kumutsiha, vuno honi kamutsihile uateuele vantu, muomu vamuvuile nguavo uapuile kananguizi.<verse eid="MAT 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 14:6" />Vuno honi omo litangua lia kuvuluka kusemuka ca Helonde liahetele, muna Helondiya uampuevo uakinine hakati ka civunga ca vantu kaha uavuahelesele Helonde, <verse eid="MAT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 14:7" />nankuma uamukulahesele nakulisinga kumuhana vioshe viatondele kulomba.<verse eid="MAT 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 14:8" />Muomu vaina vamusindiyile, kaha ualombele nguendi, “Njihane mutue ua Yiuano muka kumbuitika ha lilonga.”<verse eid="MAT 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 14:9" />Vuno honi muene uovuile vusiua, muomu yakulisinga cendi na vangenzi vendi vaje vakele navo, kaha uashikile linga vamuhane vije vialombele, <verse eid="MAT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 14:10" />nankuma vayile nakukateta mutue ua Yiuano mu kamenga. <verse eid="MAT 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 14:11" />Kaha mutue uendi vaunehele ha lilonga naku uhana kuli muana mpuevo, kaha ua uhanene vaina. <verse eid="MAT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 14:12" />Kaha vandongisi va Yiuano vezile nakuambata muvila uendi naku utsinda, kaha vayile nakukalekesa Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahana viakulia makulukazi atanu a vantu (5, 0 0 0)</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mako 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luka 9:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yiuano 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 14:13" />Honi omo Yesu uovuile eci, uahumine kuje mu vuato kaha uayile kumutambela ua likaliendi. Vuno honi omo vivunga viovuile eci, viamukavele ha mavu kuhuma ku vinganda. <verse eid="MAT 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 14:14" />Omo Yesu uayile ha ntunda uamuene civunga cakama, kaha uavovuililile ngozi, kaha uavakanguisile ku mishongo yavo.<verse eid="MAT 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 14:15" />Omo capuile cinguezi, vandongisi va Yesu vezile kuli ikeye nakuhandeka nguavo, “Cino cinapu cihela ca kuholoka, kaha litangua honi liatoko, kaha leka vivunga linga vaye ku membo vakalilandele viakulia vakevo vavenia.”<verse eid="MAT 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 14:16" />Kaha Yesu uahandekele nguendi, “Kuvapandele kuya, vahaneniko vimo valie.”<verse eid="MAT 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 14:17" />Kaha vahandekele kuli ikeye nguavo, “Tuli lika na vimbolo vitanu na vantsi vavali.”<verse eid="MAT 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 14:18" />Kaha Yesu uahandekele nguendi, “Vineheni kuno kuli yange.” <verse eid="MAT 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 14:19" />Kaha uashikile vivunga ngeci vatumame ha muila, kaha uambatele vimbolo vitanu na vantsi vavali kaha uatalele muilu, kaha uavikuisuile, nakutavuozola vimbolo nakuvihana kuli vandongisi vendi, kaha vandongisi vendi vavihanene ku vivunga. <verse eid="MAT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 14:20" />Kaha voshe valile nakukuta. Kaha vakunguluile mitonga ya vimbazuvuila ya kushula ya kupua likumi na ivali. <verse eid="MAT 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 14:21" />Kaha vaje valile vapuile ngue makulukazi atanu a vamala, kuhumisako vampuevo na vanike.<verse eid="MAT 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu enda ha mema</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Mako 6:45-52</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Yiuano 6:15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 14:22" />Hajevene Yesu ualekele vandongisi vendi linga vakovele mu vuato vaye kulutue luendi musinia tele ikeye acili na kuleka vivunga linga vaye. <verse eid="MAT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 14:23" />Kaha hanima ya kuleka vivunga linga vaye, uaile helu lia munkinda lika liendi mukulombela. Uakele kuje likaliendi noho cinguezi, <verse eid="MAT 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 14:24" />vuno honi ha ntsimbu ije vuato vuakele hakati ka cisali kaha vuakele nakulininganga na mankimba muomu mpunzi yakele nakuvuluisa.<verse eid="MAT 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 14:25" />Kaha ku vandemba Yesu uezile kuli vakevo, oku alinakuenda helu lia mema. <verse eid="MAT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 14:26" />Vuno honi omo vandongisi vendi vamumuene ali nakuenda ha mema, vovuile liova cikuma kaha vahandekele nguavo, “Ndumba ya muntu!” Kaha vatambekele naliova.<verse eid="MAT 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 14:27" />Kaha hajevene Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Simpeni, keti muteue yange vene.”<verse eid="MAT 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 14:28" />Kaha Petulu uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Muene, nga yove, njileke njije kuli yove nange njende ha mema.”<verse eid="MAT 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 14:29" />Kaha Yesu uahandekele nguendi, “Ija.” Kaha Petulu uahumine mu vuato nakuenda ha mema kuya kuli Yesu, <verse eid="MAT 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 14:30" />vuno honi omo uamuene mpunzi uateuele, kaha uaputukile kuvombela kaha uatambekele nguendi, “Muene njovole.”<verse eid="MAT 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 14:31" />Hajevene Yesu uoluele livoko liendi, nakumukuata kaha uahandekele nguendi, “Yove muntu ua lutsilielo lua lundende, Nkuma vika uli nakulikanouela?” <verse eid="MAT 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 14:32" />Kaha omo vakovelele mu vuato mpunzi yahuile. <verse eid="MAT 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 14:33" />Kaha vaje vakele mu vuato vamulemesele nguavo, “Muavusunga u Muna Njambi.”<verse eid="MAT 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akanguisa vaka kuvavala mu Ngenesaleta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:53-56">Mako 6:53-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 14:34" />Kaha omo Yesu na vandongisi vendi vajavukilile musinia, vezile ku cihela ca Ngenesaleta. <verse eid="MAT 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 14:35" />Kaha omo vantu vakumutambela uje vamuzivukile, vatumine voshe vaku cihela cije nakumunehela voshe vaje vakele na kuvavala. <verse eid="MAT 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 14:36" />Vamulombele linga vakuate cipue ku mukunduilo ua kazaku kendi, kaha voshe vaje vakuateleko vakangukile.<verse eid="MAT 14:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MAT 15" />
  <para style="s">Vilongesa via vakukuluila</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:1-13">Mako 7:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 15:1" />Ambahoni Vafaliseho vamo na valongisi va lishiko vezile kuli Yesu kuhuminina ku Yelusalema kaha vahandekele nguavo, <verse eid="MAT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 15:2" />“Vikahoni vandongisi vove kuve kuononoka cisemua ca vakukuluila? Muomu kuvekutana ku mavoko avo omo valia.”<verse eid="MAT 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 15:3" />Kaha Yesu uavakumbuluile nguendi, “Nkuma neni kumue kuononoka lishiko lia Njambi muomu ya cisemua ceni ndi? <verse eid="MAT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 15:4" />Muomu Njambi uashikile nguendi, ‘Singimika isho na noko,’ kaha ‘uoshe uje ashaula ishe cipue ina, cilivene atse.’ <verse eid="MAT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 15:5" />Vuno honi yeni mukahandeka ngueni nga uoshe uje aleka ishe cipue ina nguendi, ‘Vije vimunapandele ku uana kuli yange vanavihana Njambi,’ <verse eid="MAT 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 15:6" />kaha muntu ou kononokele ishe. Nankuma, muomu ya cisemua ceni, munaseze lizi lia Njambi. <verse eid="MAT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 15:7" />Yeni vaka civembulu! Nkuma Isaya uahandekele via vusunga hali yeni, omo uahandekele vunanguizi nguendi,<verse eid="MAT 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 15:8" />‘Ava vantu vanjisingimika na tunua tuavo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 15:8">vuno honi mitima yavo ili kulahako nange.<verse eid="MAT 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 15:9" />Vakanjilemesa lika muangoco,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 15:9">vakalongesa mashiko a vantu lika!’”<verse eid="MAT 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Viuma vije vilingisa muntu kupua uakuhona kulela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:14-23">Mako 7:14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 15:10" />Kaha Yesu uasanene vantu linga veje kuli ikeye kaha uavalekele nguendi, “Ivueni kaha ivuisiseni. <verse eid="MAT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 15:11" />Keti coshe cije cikakovela mu kanua ka muntu cikalingisa muntu linga keti apue uakulela, vuno honi vije vikahumu mu kanua ka muntu vikevio vikalingisa muntu linga apue uakuhona kulela.”<verse eid="MAT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 15:12" />Ambahoni vandongisi vezile kuli Yesu nakuhandeka nguavo, “Nkuma uazivuka nguove Vafaliseho vapihilile ku mitima omo vevuile mezi aua ndi?” <verse eid="MAT 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 15:13" />Kaha Yesu uavakumbuluile nguendi, “Muti uoshe uje Tate ua muilu kakunine vakau tukula. <verse eid="MAT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 15:14" />Veceleni lika, vanapu vantuamena va tupuputua, kaha nga kapuputua atuamenena kapuputua mukuavo, voshe vakauila mu cina.”<verse eid="MAT 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 15:15" />Vuno honi Petulu uahandekele kuli Yesu nguendi, “Tulumbunuine eci cisimo.”<verse eid="MAT 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 15:16" />Kaha uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Nkuma nove naua hanga kanda ucinongonone eci ndi? <verse eid="MAT 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 15:17" />Nkuma ku umono nguove coshe cije cikovela mu kanua cikahiti muzimo nakuhitilila ndi? <verse eid="MAT 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 15:18" />Vuno honi vije vioshe vikahumu mu kanua vikahumu ku mutima, kaha evi vikevio vikalingisa muntu kupua uakuhona kulela. <verse eid="MAT 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 15:19" />Muomu ku mutima kukeko kukahuminina visinganieka via vipi via kutsiha, vupangala, vukoyi, kuiva, vukaleho vua makuli, na vungumba. <verse eid="MAT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 15:20" />Evi vikevio vikalingisa muntu linga apue uakuhona kulela, vuno honi kulia cakuhona kutana ku mavoko kucekulingisa muntu linga apue uakuhona kulela.”<verse eid="MAT 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lutsilielo lua mpuevo uaku Kanana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:24-30">Mako 7:24-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 15:21" />Kaha Yesu uahumine kuje nakuya ku cihela ca Tile na ku Sindone. <verse eid="MAT 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 15:22" />Kaha taleni, mpuevo ua ku Kanana uje uahuminine ku cihela kuje vene ualilile nguendi, “Njivuileko cikeketima Muene, Muna Ndaviti, munange uampuevo ali na lihamba lia lipi cikuma.”<verse eid="MAT 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 15:23" />Vuno honi Yesu kamukumbuluile cipue lizi limo, kaha vandongisi vendi vezile nakumulambelela nguavo, “Mulekese linga aye muomu ali nakutupangela kalua.”<verse eid="MAT 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 15:24" />Kaha Yesu uavakumbuluile nguendi, “Vanjitumine lika ku vampanga vakuzimbala vaku njivo ya Isaleli.”<verse eid="MAT 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 15:25" />Vuno honi uje mpuevo uezile nakutsikama kuli ikeye nguendi, “Muene njikuase.”<verse eid="MAT 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 15:26" />Kaha Yesu uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Keti cacili kumbila mbolo ya vanike ku tutali.”<verse eid="MAT 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 15:27" />Kaha uje mpuevo uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Eyo Muene, vuno honi cipue vene tutali vakali vishaniu vije vikau ku mesa ya muene uavo.” <verse eid="MAT 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 15:28" />Ambahoni Yesu uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Naana ove mpuevo, lutsilielo liove luakama cikuma. Cilingiue kuya muje mu utondela.” Kaha hajevene munendi uampuevo uakangukile.<verse eid="MAT 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akangula vantu vavengi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 15:29" />Kaha Yesu uahumine kuje kaha uahitile kuyehi na cisali ca Ngalileya. Uayile kumukulo ua munkinda nakukatumama. <verse eid="MAT 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 15:30" />Kaha civunga cakama cezile kuli ikeye, vamunehelele vilema, visualonda, tupuputua na tuveveve, na vakuavo veka naua, kaha vavanehele ku viliato viendi, kaha uavakanguisile. <verse eid="MAT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 15:31" />Nankuma cije civunga calikomokelele cikuma, omo vamuene vaje tuveveve vahandeka, na visualonda vanapu vamutuntu, na vilema venda, na tupuputua vamona, kaha vahanene vumpau kuli Njambi ua Isaleli.<verse eid="MAT 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahana viakulia makulukazi auana a vantu (4, 0 0 0)</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:1-10">Mako 8:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 15:32" />Ambahoni Yesu uasanene vandongisi vendi nakuvaleka nguendi, “Njilina kuvuila ngozi eci civunga, muomu vanakala nange ha matangua atatu, kaha kuvalileho cipue cimo, kaha kunjitondo linga njivecele vaye na njala, hamo valezumukila mu ngila.”<verse eid="MAT 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 15:33" />Kaha vandongisi vahandekele kuli ikeye nguavo, “Kuli honi tuasa kuuana mbolo muno mu ndinda ya kulisa civunga cakama eci?”<verse eid="MAT 15:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 15:34" />Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Muli na mikasha ingahi?” Vamukumbuluile nguavo, “Itanu na ivali, na vantsi vavandende.”<verse eid="MAT 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 15:35" />Kaha Yesu uashikile cije civunga linga vatumame ha mavu, <verse eid="MAT 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 15:36" />kaha uambatele ije mikasha itanu na ivali na vantsi, kaha hanima yakuhana citsantsela, uavipazuile nakuvihana kuli vandongisi, kaha vandongisi vavihanene kuli vije vivunga. <verse eid="MAT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 15:37" />Kaha voshe valile nakukuta. Kaha vandongisi vakunguluile mitonga ya kushula ya kupua itanu na ivali ya vije vimbazuvuila viasaleleho. <verse eid="MAT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 15:38" />Kaha vaje valile vapuile makulukazi auana a vamala (4, 0 0 0), kuakuhona vampuevo na vanike.<verse eid="MAT 15:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 15:39" />Kaha uecelele cije civunga linga vaye, kaha uakovelele mu vuato nakuya ku cihela ca Mangandane.<verse eid="MAT 15:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MAT 16" />
  <para style="s">Vafaliseho valomba cimueso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:11-13">Mako 8:11-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:54-56">Luka 12:54-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 16:1" />Kaha Vafaliseho na Vasanduki vezile kuli Yesu nakumueseka, vamuihuile linga avamuese cimueso cakuhuminina muilu. <verse eid="MAT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 16:2" />Kaha uavakumbuluile nguendi, “Omo nga cinguezi, mukahandeka ngueni, ‘Kukaca vuino, muomu lilu livenga.’ <verse eid="MAT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 16:3" />Kaha kucimene muhandeka ngueni, ‘Lelo kukakala mashelua, muomu lilu livenga na kuteuesa.’ Muazivuka kulumbununa cifua ca lilu, vuno honi kumuasa kulumbununa cimueso via vintsimbu. <verse eid="MAT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 16:4" />Vantu vantsimbu ino va vupi na vupangala vatonda cimueso, vuno honi kukuesi cimueso civakavahana kuvanga lika cimueso ca Yona.” kaha uavasezele nakuya.<verse eid="MAT 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zangameni ku vilinga via Vafaliseho na Vasanduki vije viafua ngue cimbaluila</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:14-21">Mako 8:14-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 16:5" />Omo vandongisi vahetele musinia, vasuvile kuambata mbolo. <verse eid="MAT 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 16:6" />Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Liniungeni kaha zangameni ku cimbaluila ca Vafaliseho na Vasanduki.”<verse eid="MAT 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 16:7" />Kaha vakele nakuhandeka hakati kavo vavenia nguavo, “Kutuezile na mbolo.”<verse eid="MAT 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 16:8" />Kaha Yesu hakuzivuka eci, uahandekele nguendi, “Yeni valutsilielo lualundende, vika muli nakuhandeka hakati keni vavenia ngueni kumuesi na mbolo? <verse eid="MAT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 16:9" />Nkuma kanda muvuisise ndi? Nkuma kumuvuluka mikasha itanu ya vimbolo ije ivalile vantu makulukazi atanu, kaha mitonga ingahi muakunguluile? <verse eid="MAT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 16:10" />Cipue mikasha itanu na ivali ya vimbolo ije ivalile vantu makulukazi auana, nkuma mitonga ingahi muakunguluile? <verse eid="MAT 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 16:11" />Nkuma vika kumuvuisisa ngueni kunjahandekele neni via mbolo? Zangameni ku cimbaluila ca Vafaliseho na Vasanduki.”<verse eid="MAT 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 16:12" />Ambahoni vevuisisile nguavo nkuma kavalekele kuzangama ku cimbaluila cakupangesa mbolo, vuno honi ha vilongesa via Vafaliseho na Vasanduki.<verse eid="MAT 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petulu atava ngeci Yesu ikeye Kilistu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:27-30">Mako 8:27-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luka 9:18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 16:13" />Honi omo Yesu uahetele ku nganda ya Sesaliya Filipu, kaha uehuile vandongisi vendi nguendi, “Vantu vahandeka nguavo Muna Muntu ikeye iya?”<verse eid="MAT 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 16:14" />Vamukumbuluile nguavo, “Vamo nguavo Yiuano muka kumbuitika, vamo nguavo Eliya, vamo nguavo Njelemiya cipue umo ua tunanguizi.”<verse eid="MAT 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 16:15" />Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Vuno honi yeni ngueni Yange iya?”<verse eid="MAT 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 16:16" />Simoni Petulu uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Yove Kilistu, Muna Njambi uakuyoya.”<verse eid="MAT 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 16:17" />Yesu uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Uakukuisula Simoni muna Yona! Muomu keti vuntu vuasholuele evi kuli yove, vuno honi Tate uje ali muilu. <verse eid="MAT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 16:18" />Kaha njikuleka nguange yove vene Petulu, ha livue eli njikatunga cikungulukilo cange, kaha nzili ya kutsa ku ikacihiana<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu Cingelengu vanaisoneka nguavo Hendisi, kulumbununa Cikolo ca vaka kutsa.</char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 16:19" />Njikakuhana masapi a Vumuene vua muilu, kaha coshe cije ci ukavindika hano ha mavu na muilu vakacivindika, kaha naua coshe cije ci ukatavesa hano ha mavu na muilu vakacitavesa.”<verse eid="MAT 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 16:20" />Ambahoni uashikile vandongisi vendi linga keti valekeko muntu umo nguavo ikeye Kilistu.<verse eid="MAT 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahandeka viakulutue via tuyando tuendi na kutsa cendi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:31">Mako 8:31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:1">9:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luka 9:22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 16:21" />Kuhuma ha ntsimbu ije Yesu uaputukile kulumbunuina vandongisi vendi nguendi, “Njapande kuya ku Yelusalema naku kayanda ha viuma viavingi ku vakuluntu na ku vakuluntu va vasasendote na kuli valongisi va mashiko, kaha vakanjitsiha, vuno honi hanima ya matangua atatu vakanjisangula.”<verse eid="MAT 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 16:22" />Kaha Petulu uamuambatele nakumutuala kuali kaliavo nakuputuka kumutenukila nguendi, “Njambi vindika, Muene! Eci kucikalingiua kuli yove!”<verse eid="MAT 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 16:23" />Vuno honi Yesu uatengulukile nakuhandeka kuli Petulu nguendi, “Huma kuli yange yove Satana! Yove unapu citsuntsuiso kuli yange, muomu ku ukundama kuli Njambi, vuno honi ku vantu.”<verse eid="MAT 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 16:24" />Ambahoni Yesu ualekele vandongisi vendi nguendi, “Nga uoshe uje atonda kunjikava, napande kuliviana ikeye vavenia nakuambata cilindakano cendi na kunjikava. <verse eid="MAT 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 16:25" />Muomu uoshe uje atonda kuniunga muono uendi aka uzimbalesa, vuno honi uoshe uje azimbalesa muono uendi omo yange aka uuana. <verse eid="MAT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 16:26" />Kaha cikakuasa vika kuli muntu, nga alikunguluila viuma via ha mavu vioshe nakuzimbalesa muono uendi? Cipue vika muntu viakahana linga ahingisemo muono uendi? <verse eid="MAT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 16:27" />Muomu Muna Muntu akeja na tungelo vendi mu vumpau vua Ishe, ambahoni akafueta muntu na muntu uoshe kuya ku vilinga viendi. <verse eid="MAT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 16:28" />Muavusunga njimileka nguange kuli vamo hano vaje ku vakatsi kuvanga noho vanamono Muna Muntu neja mu Vumuene vuendi.”<verse eid="MAT 16:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="MAT 17" />
  <para style="s">Kuhimpuka ca Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:2-13">Mako 9:2-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luka 9:28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 17:1" />Hanima ya matangua atanu na limo Yesu uambatele Petulu na Yakomba na munaina Yiuano, kaha vayile hamo ku munkinda ualaha kua likaliavo lika. <verse eid="MAT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 17:2" />Kaha Yesu ualihimpuile ha mesho avo, kaha na cihanga cendi caviakumine ngue litangua kaha na vuzalo vuendi vuatokele too ngue ceke. <verse eid="MAT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 17:3" />Kaha taleni, ambahoni kuasholokele Mosesa na Eliya vaje vakele na kuhandeka nendi. <verse eid="MAT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 17:4" />Kaha Petulu uahandekele kuli Yesu nguendi, “Muene, cacili yetu kukala kuno, nga utonda njikatunga vintsingi vitatu kuno, imo yove kaha ikuavo ya Mosesa na ikuavo ya Eliya.”<verse eid="MAT 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 17:5" />Tele acili nakuhandeka, kaha hajevene lishelua liaku viakuma liavafuikile, kaha muje mulishelua muahumine lizi ngualio, “Ou ikeye munange injazanga, uje muli ikeye njivuahelela, muivuilileni.”<verse eid="MAT 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 17:6" />Omo vandongisi vevuile evi, vavulumanene ha mavu, kaha vovuile liova cikuma. <verse eid="MAT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 17:7" />Vuno honi Yesu uezile nakuvakuata kaha uahandekele nguendi, “Katukeni keti muteue.” <verse eid="MAT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 17:8" />Kaha omo vemukile mesho avo, kuvamuene ueka vuno honi Yesu lika.<verse eid="MAT 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 17:9" />Kaha omo vasikumukile kuhuma ha munkinda, Yesu uavashikile nguendi, “Keti valekeko muntu uoshe cije cimona, kuvanga noho Muna Muntu vanamusangula ku vatsi.”<verse eid="MAT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 17:10" />Vandongisi vamuihuile nguavo, “Nkuma vika valongisi va lishiko vahandeka nguavo Eliya ikeye eje tahi?”<verse eid="MAT 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 17:11" />Yesu uavakumbuluile nguendi, “Eliya akeja, kaha akahiluisa naua viuma vioshe, <verse eid="MAT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 17:12" />vuno honi njimileka nguange Eliya neja laja, kaha kuvamuzivukile, vuno honi vamulingile muoshe muje muvatondelelemo, omu mukemo vene na Muna Muntu vakamuyandesela.”<verse eid="MAT 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 17:13" />Ambahoni vandongisi vevuisisile nguavo alina kuhandeka kuli vakevo via Yiuano muka kumbuitika.<verse eid="MAT 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akanguisa muanike ua yala uje uakele na lihamba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:14-29">Mako 9:14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43a">Luka 9:37-43a</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 17:14" />Kaha omo vezile ku civunga, yala umo uezile kuli Yesu nakutsikama nakuhandeka nguendi, <verse eid="MAT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 17:15" />“Muene ivuila cikeketima munange, muomu ali na mushongo uakushinia kaha ukamuyandesa cikuma, muomu ha vintsimbu viavingi akauila mu tuhia na mu mema. <verse eid="MAT 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 17:16" />Kaha njamunehele kuli vandongisi vove, vuno honi kuvasele kumukanguisa.”<verse eid="MAT 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 17:17" />Kaha Yesu uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Yeni vantu va ntsimbu ino vakuhona lutsilielo na vupi, njikakala neni lungahi? Njikamileka lungahi? Muneheni kuno kuli yange.” <verse eid="MAT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 17:18" />Kaha Yesu uatenukilile lije lihamba, kaha lije lihamba liahumine muli uje muanike, kaha hajevene uakangukile.<verse eid="MAT 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 17:19" />Ambahoni vandongisi vezile kuli Yesu muvushueke nakuhandeka nguavo, “Vika honi yetu kutuasele kuhumisa lije lihamba?”<verse eid="MAT 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 17:20" />Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Muomu ya lutsilielo lueni lualundende. Muavusunga njimileka nguange nga muli na lutsilielo ngue nona ya mbuto ya musalata, ngue muasa kuhandeka ku munkinda ou ngueni, ‘Huma hano ya kuje kaha ukaya, kaha na cimo cahi cimukahonoua.’” <verse eid="MAT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 17:21" />Vuno honi lihamba liangacije kuliekuhuma ngoco kuvanga na lilombelo na kuliumina kulia.<verse eid="MAT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahandeka naua via kulutue via ha kutsa cendi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Mako 9:30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43b-45">Luka 9:43b-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 17:22" />Omo valikunguluile hamo mu Ngalileya, Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Muna Muntu vanapande kumuhana ku mavoko a vantu, <verse eid="MAT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 17:23" />vaka mutsihia, kaha vakamusangula hanima ya matangua atatu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 17:23">Kaha vandongisi vevuile vusiua cikuma.<verse eid="MAT 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kufueta lisimu lia mu Njivo ya Njambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 17:24" />Omo Yesu na vandongisi vendi vezile ku Kapenauma, kaha vaka kutambula lisimu lia mu njivo ya Njambi vayile kuli Petulu nakuhandeka nguavo, “Nkuma mulongisi ueni kekufueta lisimu ndi?”<verse eid="MAT 17:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 17:25" />Kaha Petulu uavakumbuluile nguendi, “Eyo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 17:25">Kaha omo Petulu uakovelele mu njivo, Yesu uahandekele kuli ikeye ha kulivanga nguendi, “Simoni vika usinganieka? Nkuma kuli veya vimiene va hano ha mavu vakatambula lisimu? Kuli vana vavo indi kuveka?”<verse eid="MAT 17:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 17:26" />Kaha omo Petulu uakumbuluile nguendi, “Kuveka,” kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Nankuma vana kuvakafuete. <verse eid="MAT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 17:27" />Nankuma keti tuvapihisile, ya lika ku cisali ukalovele, kaha ukambate intsi uje uamaputukilo kaha omo ukafukula mu kanua kendi ukauanamo mbongo ya muuaya uaya, kaha yakayambate nakuvahanayo, linga ikapue lisimu liange nove.”<verse eid="MAT 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="MAT 18" />
  <para style="s">Iya uakama cikuma?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Mako 9:33-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luka 9:46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 18:1" />Ha ntsimbu ije vandongisi vezile kuli Yesu nakuhandeka nguavo, “Nkuma iya uakama cikuma mu Vumuene vua muilu?”<verse eid="MAT 18:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 18:2" />Kaha Yesu uasanene muanike nakumuhaka hakati kavo, <verse eid="MAT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 18:3" />kaha uahandekele nguendi, “Muavusunga njihandeka kuli yeni nguange, kuvanga mutenguluke kupua ngue vanike, keti ngoconi kumukakovela mu vumuene vua muilu. <verse eid="MAT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 18:4" />Uoshe uje alikehesa ikeye vavenia ngue ou muanike, ikeye napu uakama mu Vumuene vua muilu. <verse eid="MAT 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 18:5" />Uoshe uje atambula muanike ou mu lizina liange na tambula yange.<verse eid="MAT 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vieseko vije vituala ku vupi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:42-48">Mako 9:42-48</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luka 17:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 18:6" />“Vuno honi uoshe uje alingisa ava vanike vavandende vaje vatsiliela muli yange kulinga vupi, cacili kuli ikeye kumukutilila livue liakulolela vunga mu ntsingo yendi kaha nakumukokela ha seta ya cisali. <verse eid="MAT 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 18:7" />Cisingo ha mavu muomu ya vieseko vije vituala ku vupi! Muomu cilivene vieseko evi vija, vuno honi cisingo kuli muntu uje aneha evi vieseko!<verse eid="MAT 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 18:8" />“Kaha nga livoko liove cipue mukono uove vikulingisa linga ulinge vupi, vitete nakuviumbila kuti, cacili kuli yove kukovela mu muono oku ucisualonda cipue cilema kupulakana na mavoko avali cipue mikono ivali nakukumbila mu tuhia tuayaye. <verse eid="MAT 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 18:9" />Kaha nga lisho liove likulingisa linga ulinge vupi, licokovolemo nakuliumbila kuti, cacili kuli yove kukovela mu muono na lisho limo kupulakana na mesho avali aje akanehesa linga vakakumbile mu ngehena ya tuhia.<verse eid="MAT 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cisimo ca mpanga ua kuzimbala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 15:3-7">Luka 15:3-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 18:10" />“Taleni keti musembulule ava vanike vavandende, muomu njimileka nguange muilu muli tungelo vaje ntsimbu yoshe vakamono cihanga ca Tate uje ali muilu. <verse eid="MAT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 18:11" />[Muomu Muna Muntu uezile nakuovola vaje vanazimbala.]<verse eid="MAT 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 18:12" />“Vika musinganieka? Nga yala ali na vampanga cihita, kaha umo uavo nazimbala, nkuma kaseze vaje makumi atanu na auana na vatanu na vauana (99) ha munkinda nakuya mukutonda uje nazimbala ndi? <verse eid="MAT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 18:13" />Kaha nga amu uana, muavusunga njimileka nguange akavuahelela cikuma muomu yendi kupulakana vaje makumi atanu na auana na vatanu na vauana (99) vaje kuvazimbalele. <verse eid="MAT 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 18:14" />Mucifua cimo vene Tate ua muilu katondo ngeci umo uava vanike vavandende vanonge.<verse eid="MAT 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muntu nga nakupihisila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 18:15" />“Nga mukueni na kupihisila, ya uye ukamuleke vije via nakupihisila, muvuvali vueni lika. Nga akuivuilila kaha uamuovola. <verse eid="MAT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 18:16" />Vuno honi nga ka kuivuilila, kaha ambatako umo cipue vavali linga mezi oshe akapue navukaleho vua vantu vavali cipue vatatu. <verse eid="MAT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 18:17" />Nga aviana kuvevuilila, kaha lekesako cikungulukilo, kaha nga naua aviana kuivuilila cipue ku cikungulukilo, mupuise ngue vaje keti Vayunda na vaka kutambula lisimu.<verse eid="MAT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuvindika na kutavesa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 18:18" />“Muavusunga njimileka nguange, coshe cije civakavindika hano ha mavu na muilu naua vakacivindika, kaha coshe cije civakatavesa hano ha mavu na muilu naua vakacitavesa.<verse eid="MAT 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 18:19" />“Kaha naua njimileka nguange, nga muvuvali vueni mulitavasana hano ha mavu ha cuma mukalomba, vaka milingilaco kuli Tate ua muilu. <verse eid="MAT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 18:20" />Muomu kuje kunakungulukila vavali cipue vatatu mu lizina liange, kuje vene nange naua njili hakati kavo.”<verse eid="MAT 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cisimo ca ngamba uakuhona kukonekela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 18:21" />Ambahoni Petulu uezile kuli Yesu nakuhandeka nguendi, “Muene, nkuma lungahi njasa kukonekela muanetu nga na njipihisila? Nkuma lualuingi vintsimbu vitanu na vivali ndi?”<verse eid="MAT 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 18:22" />Yesu uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Njikulekesa nguange keti luakupua vintsimbu vitanu na vivali, vuno honi luakupua makumi atanu na avali na vintsimbu vitanu na vivali.” <verse eid="MAT 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 18:23" />Nankuma Vumuene vua muilu tuvusetekesa na muene uje uatondele kufueta vangamba vendi. <verse eid="MAT 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 18:24" />Omo uaputukile linga avafuete, kaha vamunehelele yala uje uakele na mukuli kuli ikeye ua vimbazuvuila via ngolinde viakupua makulukazi likumi (10 0 0 0) <verse eid="MAT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 18:25" />Kaha omo uje yala uahonouele kumufueta, uje muene uendi uashikile linga vamulandese hamo na mpueyendi, na vana vendi na vioshe vije viakele navio linga afuete. <verse eid="MAT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 18:26" />“Kaha uje ngamba uatsikamene nakumulomba nguendi, ‘Muene acinjivandameneko tahi, kaha njikakufueta vioshe!’ <verse eid="MAT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 18:27" />Kaha uje muene uevuililile ngozi uje ngamba kaha uamuecelele nakumukonekela mukuli uendi.<verse eid="MAT 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 18:28" />“Vuno honi uje vene ngamba omo uayile ualiuanene na umo uavakuavo vangamba uje uakele na mukuli uendi uakupua cihita ca vimbongo via muuaya uaya. Kaha uamukuatele ha milivu nakuhandeka nguendi, ‘Njifuete mukuli uange.’ <verse eid="MAT 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 18:29" />Kaha uje mukuavo ngamba uauililile ha mavu nakumulambelela nguendi, ‘Acinjivandameneko tahi, kaha njikakufueta.’ <verse eid="MAT 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 18:30" />Vuno honi uavianene kaha uamutualele mu kamenga noho hakafuetela uje mukuli uendi. <verse eid="MAT 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 18:31" />Omo vakuavo vangamba vamuene vije vialingiuile, kuvevuile muacili, kaha vayile nakuambulula kuli muene uavo vije vioshe vialingiuile. <verse eid="MAT 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 18:32" />Ambahoni uje muene uendi uamusanene nakuhandeka kuli ikeye nguendi, ‘Yove ngamba uamupi! Njakukonekelele uje mukuli uoshe muomu uanjilambelelele, <verse eid="MAT 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 18:33" />kaha vika honi yove ku uamuvuilileko cikeketima mukueni ngamba, ngue muje munjakuivuililile cikeketima yange?’ <verse eid="MAT 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 18:34" />Kaha na vutenu uje muene uendi uamutualele ku vaka kamenga linga vamuzangamese kuvanga noho akafueta mukuli uoshe uje uakele nauo.”<verse eid="MAT 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 18:35" />“Omu mukemo vene na Tate ua muilu akalinga yeni voshe, nga kumukakonekela vamuanoko kuhuminina ku mitima yeni.”<verse eid="MAT 18:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="MAT 19" />
  <para style="s">Yesu alongesa ha kutsiha vulo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:1-12">Mako 10:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 19:1" />Honi omo Yesu uamanusuile kuhandeka evi, uahumine mu Ngalileya uayile ku cihela ca Yundeya musinia lia ndonga ya Yundau. <verse eid="MAT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 19:2" />Kaha civunga cakama ca mukavele, kaha ua vakanguisile kuje.<verse eid="MAT 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 19:3" />Vafaliseho vamo vezile kuli ikeye nakumueseka, mukumuihula nguavo, “Nkuma capua lishiko yala kukondola mpueyendi ha mulonga uoshe indi?”<verse eid="MAT 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 19:4" />Nankuma Yesu uavakumbuluile nguendi, “Kumuatandele nguavo uje uavatangele ku maputukilo ua vatangele yala na mpuevo.” <verse eid="MAT 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 19:5" />Uahandekele nguendi, “Muomu hacifua eci yala akaseza vaishe na vaina na kulipandakana hamo na mpueyendi, kaha vavali va kapua muvila umo lika.” <verse eid="MAT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 19:6" />Kaha kuvapu vavali vuno honi vapua muvila umo lika. Kaha cije Njambi napandakana hamo naumo muntu uahi napande kucihangununa.<verse eid="MAT 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 19:7" />Kaha Vafaliseho vahandekele kuli ikeye nguavo, “Nkuma vikahoni Mosesa uashikile umo yala kuhana mukanda uakukondola kuli mpueyendi nakumusheka?”<verse eid="MAT 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 19:8" />Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Muomu yakukaluua ca mitima yeni Mosesa uamitavesele linga mukondole vampuevo veni, vuno honi hambangelo kucapuile ngoco. <verse eid="MAT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 19:9" />Kaha njihandeka kuli yeni nguange, uoshe akondola mpueyendi, kuakuhona kulinga vupangala, nakuambata mpuevo ueka, kaha alinga vupangala.”<verse eid="MAT 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 19:10" />Vandongisi vahandekele kuli ikeye nguavo, “Nga mukemo ngoco hali yala na mpueyendi, nkuma cacili kuhona kuambata.”<verse eid="MAT 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 19:11" />Vuno honi uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Keti muntu uoshe atambula evi vihandeka, kuvanga lika kuli vaje vava navihana. <verse eid="MAT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 19:12" />Muomu kuli vamo vaje kuvasa kuambata muomu vasemukile muje vene, kaha kuvali vamo vaje kuvasa kuambata muomu vantu vanavalingimo, kaha naua kuvali vamo vaje kuvambata muomu vanalingi vakevo vavenia ngoco vene muomu ya Vumuene vua muilu. Kaha uoshe uje atambula evi, avitambule.”<verse eid="MAT 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuisula vanike vavandende</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Mako 10:13-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luka 18:15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 19:13" />Ambahoni vanehele vanike vavandende kuli Yesu linga avasaleke mavoko endi nakuvalombelela. Vuno honi vandongisi vatenukilile vaje vantu vavanehele. <verse eid="MAT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 19:14" />Vuno honi Yesu uahandekele nguendi, “Eceleni vanike vavandende veje kuli yange, keti muvavindike, muomu Vumuene vua muilu vunapu vuavo.”<verse eid="MAT 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 19:15" />Kaha uavasalekele mavoko endi kaha uayile.<verse eid="MAT 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mukuenje uakufuka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Mako 10:17-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luka 18:18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 19:16" />Kaha taleni, umo muntu uezile kuli Yesu nakumuihula nguendi, “Mulongisi, cuma muka cacili njapande kulinga, linga njikakale na muono uayaye?”<verse eid="MAT 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 19:17" />Yesu uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Vika unjihuila vije viacili?” Kuli lika umo ikeye uacili. Vuno honi nga utonda kukovela mu vuyoye, niunga mashiko.<verse eid="MAT 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 19:18" />Uje muntu uamuhuile nguendi, “Vika?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 19:18">Kaha Yesu uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Keti ukatsihe, keti ukalinge vupangala, keti ukeve, keti ukahane vukaleho vua makuli, <verse eid="MAT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 19:19" />singimika isho na noko, kaha zanga mukueni ngue muje mu ualizangela yove vavenia.”<verse eid="MAT 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 19:20" />Kaha uje mukuenje uamuhuile nguendi, “Vioshe evi njaviniungu.” Vika naua vikuavo vinjasa kulinga?<verse eid="MAT 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 19:21" />Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Nga utonda kupua uakusungama, ya linga ukalandese viuli navio kaha uvihane ku vihutu, kaha ukakala na vufuko muilu, kaha ija, njikave.”<verse eid="MAT 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 19:22" />Omo uje mukuenje uevuile evi uayile navusiua, muomu uakele na vufuko vua vuingi cikuma.<verse eid="MAT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 19:23" />Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli vandongisi vendi nguendi, “Muavusunga njihandeka kuli yeni nguange, cikapua ca cikalu kuli muka kufuka kukovela mu Vumuene vua muilu. <verse eid="MAT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 19:24" />Njimileka naua nguange, ca casi kamelu kuhita mu lisho lia nguya, kupulakana muka kufuka kukovela mu Vumuene vua Njambi.”<verse eid="MAT 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 19:25" />Omo vandongisi vovuile eci, valikomokelele cikuma, nakuhandeka nguavo, “Kaha iya honi akovoka?”<verse eid="MAT 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 19:26" />Vuno honi Yesu uavatalele nakuhandeka kuli vakevo nguendi, “Eci cacikalu ku vantu vuno honi kuli Njambi vioshe viapua viaviasi.”<verse eid="MAT 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 19:27" />Ambahoni Petulu uahandekele nguendi, “Tala, tuaseze vioshe nakukukava. Vika honi tukakala navio?”<verse eid="MAT 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 19:28" />Yesu uavakumbuluile nguendi, “Muavusunga njimileka nguange, mu mavu a maha, omo Muna Muntu akatumama ha litanda liendi lia vumpau, yeni vaje muanjikavele neni naua mukatumama ha matanda makumi na avali, mukusompa miyati likumi na ivali ya Isaleli. <verse eid="MAT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 19:29" />Uoshe uje naseza vinjivo viendi, cipue vamunaina vavamala, cipue vamunaina va vampuevo, cipue vaishe, cipue vaina, cipue vana vendi cipue mehia, muomu ya lizina liange, akatambula cihita ku vioshe nakusuana muono uayaye. <verse eid="MAT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 19:30" />Vuno honi vavengi vaje vakulivanga vakapua vakumanusuila, kaha vakumanusuila vakapua vakulivanga.”<verse eid="MAT 19:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="MAT 20" />
  <para style="s">Vaka kupanga mu lihia lia vushuka vua viniu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 20:1" />“Muomu Vumuene vua muilu vunapu ngue vavenia njivo uje cimene mene uayile nakulania vaka kupanga mu lihia liendi lia vushuka vua viniu. <verse eid="MAT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 20:2" />Hanima ya kulitavasana na vaka kupanga ha fueto ya ha litangua, kaha uavatumine mu lihia liendi lia vushuka vua viniu. <verse eid="MAT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 20:3" />Kaha ha ntsimbu ya mucitanu na viuana ku cimene omo uayileko uamuene vamo vanemana ngoco ku cihela cakulandesela, <verse eid="MAT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 20:4" />kaha uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, ‘Neni naua yemuye mukapange mu lihia lia vushuka vua viniu, kaha njikamifueta fueto ije inapandemo. Kaha vayile.’ <verse eid="MAT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 20:5" />Kaha uayileko naua tele litangua lili hakati ka mutue na ha ntsimbu ya mucitatu ya mutania uacinguezi, kaha uatumineko vakuavo naua. <verse eid="MAT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 20:6" />Kaha ku ntsimbu ya mucitanu ya cinguezi uayile naua ku cihela ca kulandesela kaha uakauanene naua veka vanemana ngoco, kaha uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, ‘Nkuma vika honi munemanena lika kuno ngoco ha litangua lioshe liamutuntu?’ <verse eid="MAT 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 20:7" />Kaha vahandekele kuli ikeye nguavo, ‘Muomu naumo uahi natulania.’ Kaha uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, ‘Yemuye mu lihia neni.’<verse eid="MAT 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 20:8" />“Kaha omo cinguezi cahetele, uje vavenia lihia uahandekele kuli muka kutuamenena vaka kupanga nguendi, ‘Sana vaka kupanga linga uvafuete fueto yavo, putukila na vaje vakukotokela kaha manusuila na vaje vakulivanga.’ <verse eid="MAT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 20:9" />Kaha omo vaje vavalaniene ha ntsimbu ya mucitanu ya cinguezi vezile, umo na umo uavo uatambuile fueto ya ha litangua limo. <verse eid="MAT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 20:10" />Honi omo vaje vavalaniene ha kulivanga vezile, vasinganiekele nguavo hamo vakatambula viavingi, vuno honi umo na umo uavo navo uatambuile fueto ya ha litangua limo. <verse eid="MAT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 20:11" />Kaha omo vatambuile vaputukile kulinienieta kuli uje vavenia lihia nguavo, <verse eid="MAT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 20:12" />‘Ava vakukotokela vanapanga ntsimbu imo lika, kaha unavapuisa hamo netu vaje vanapanga litangua lioshe mukatania.’ <verse eid="MAT 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 20:13" />Vuno honi vavenia lihia uakumbuluile umo uavo nguendi, ‘Kavusamba, kunjakulingile mua mupi, nkuma kutualitavasanene kupangela fueto ya ha litangua limo ndi?’ <verse eid="MAT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 20:14" />Ambata vije vinakupande kaha ya, njinahangula kuhana vaje vakukotokela eci ngue muje munjinahanena yove. <verse eid="MAT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 20:15" />Nkuma kunjasa kulinga muje munjitondela na vimbongo viange ndi? Cipue nkuma yove uli nacipululu muomu ya ngozi yange ndi?”<verse eid="MAT 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 20:16" />Kaha omu mukemo vene mucikafua, vaka kukotokela vakapua vaka kulivanga, kaha vaka kulivanga vakapua vaka kukotokela.<verse eid="MAT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahandeka lua mucitatu via kulutue via ha kutsa cendi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Mako 10:32-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luka 18:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 20:17" />Omo Yesu tele alinakuya ku Yelusalema, uayile hamo na vandongisi vendi likumi na vavali kualikaliavo lika, kaha mu ngila uahandekele kuli vakevo muvushueke nguendi, <verse eid="MAT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 20:18" />“Taleni, tulinakuya ku Yelusalema, kaha Muna Muntu vakamuhana ku vakuluntu va vasasendote nakuli valongisi va mashiko kaha vakamuhisa nakumutuala ku kutsa, <verse eid="MAT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 20:19" />kaha vakamuhana kuli vaje keti Vayunda linga vaka mushendumune naku mupupanga nakumushukika ha cilindakano, kaha vakamusangula hanima ya matangua atatu.”<verse eid="MAT 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Catonda cisemi uampuevo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:35-45">Mako 10:35-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 20:20" />Ambahoni naye ya vana va Zembendeo uezile kuli Yesu hamo na vana vendi, uatsikamene ku mesho endi kaha uamulombele cuma cimo.<verse eid="MAT 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 20:21" />Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Vika utonda?” uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Shika linga ava vana vange vavali ngeci vatumame umo ku livoko liove liacilio mukuavo kulia cimoshue mu vumuene vuove.”<verse eid="MAT 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 20:22" />Vuno honi Yesu uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Ku uzivuka vika vije ulinakulomba. Nkuma muasa kunua nganja ije injikanuinamo ndi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 20:22">Vamukumbuluile nguavo “Tuasa.”<verse eid="MAT 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 20:23" />Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Mukanuina mu nganja yange, vuno honi kutumama ku livoko liange liacilio neli lia cimoshueni, keti yange njili nanzili yakucitavesa, vuno honi cinapu cavaje Tate navuahesele laja.”<verse eid="MAT 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 20:24" />Kaha omo vaje likumi vacuvuile, vanienguelele uje muntu namunaina. <verse eid="MAT 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 20:25" />Vuno honi Yesu uavasanene nakuhandeka nguendi, “Muazivuka ngueni vaka kuyula va vaje keti Vayunda vali nanzili hali vakevo, kaha na vantuama vavo vali na nzili yakama hali vakevo. <verse eid="MAT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 20:26" />Kucikafu muje hali yeni. Vuno honi uoshe uje akapua uakama hali yeni akapua ngamba yeni, <verse eid="MAT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 20:27" />Kaha uoshe akapua uakulivanga hali yeni akapua ngamba yeni, <verse eid="MAT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 20:28" />cipue Muna Muntu kezile mukumuovola vuno honi mukuovola, nakuhana muono uendi ngue fueto mukuovola vavengi.”<verse eid="MAT 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akanguisa vamala vavali vatupuputua</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Mako 10:46-52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luka 18:35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 20:29" />Kaha omo Yesu na vandongisi vendi vahumine ku Yeliko, civunga cakama camukavele. <verse eid="MAT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 20:30" />Kaha taleni, vamala vatupuputua vavali vatumamene ku mukulo ua tapalo, kaha omo vevuile nguavo Yesu alinakuhita, vatambekele nguavo, “Tuvuileko cikeketima Muna Ndaviti.”<verse eid="MAT 20:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 20:31" />Kaha cije civunga cavatenukilile nguavo vaholoke kuluu, vuno honi vatambakanene cikuma honi nguavo, “Muene, tuvuileko cikeketima, Muna Ndaviti!”<verse eid="MAT 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 20:32" />Kaha Yesu uemanene nakuvasana nguendi, “Vika mutonda linga njimilingile?”<verse eid="MAT 20:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 20:33" />Vahandekele kuli ikeye nguavo, “Muene tutonda kumona.” <verse eid="MAT 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 20:34" />Kaha Yesu hakuvevuila cikeketima uakuatele ha mesho avo, kaha hajevene vaputukile kumona kaha vamukavele.<verse eid="MAT 20:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="MAT 21" />
  <para style="s">Yesu akovela na kasingimiko mu Yelusalema</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mako 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luka 19:28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yiuano 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 21:1" />Kaha omo Yesu na vandongisi vendi vahetele kuyehi na Yelusalema, vayile ku Mbetefanje ku munkinda ua Oliveta, ambahoni Yesu uatumine vandongisi vavali, <verse eid="MAT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 21:2" />uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Yeni ku limbo lije lia litala neni, kaha hajevene mukauana cimulu vanamukutu na munendi, kaha vazituleni munjinehelevo. <verse eid="MAT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 21:3" />Nga muntu umo akahandeka cimo kuli yeni, mukahandeke ngueni, ‘Muene ali nakuvatonda, kaha akavahiluisa mu vuasi vuasi.’”<verse eid="MAT 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 21:4" />Evi vialingiuile linga vilishulisise vije viahandekele kananguizi nguendi,<verse eid="MAT 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 21:5" />“Leka muana ua mpuevo ua Siyone nguove,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:5">Tala, muene yove ali nakuija kuli yove</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:5">Uje uakulikehesa kaha nalondo ha cimulu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:5">na hali muna cimulu.”<verse eid="MAT 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 21:6" />Kaha vandongisi vayile nakukalinga muje muava shikililemo Yesu, <verse eid="MAT 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 21:7" />ambahoni vanehele uje cimulu na munendi, kaha vajalele tuzaku tuavo ha miongo ya vimulu, kaha Yesu uatumameneho. <verse eid="MAT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 21:8" />Vuingi vua vivunga vajalele tuzaku tuavo mu ngila, kaha vakuavo naua vatetele mintango ya miti vajalele mu ngila. <verse eid="MAT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 21:9" />Kaha vije vivunga viayile halutue luendi na vaje vamukavangeyele vatambekele cikuma nguavo, “Hosana kuli Muna Ndaviti! Uakukuisula uje eja mu lizina lia Muene! Lemeseni Njambi!”<verse eid="MAT 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 21:10" />Kaha omo uakovelele mu Yelusalema, nganda yoshe ya lijajelelele vahandekele nguavo, “Iya ou?”<verse eid="MAT 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 21:11" />Kaha vivunga via vantu vahandekele nguavo, “Ou ikeye kananguizi Yesu uaku Nazaleta mu Ngalileya.”<verse eid="MAT 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aya ku Njivo ya Njambi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Mako 11:15-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luka 19:45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yiuano 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 21:12" />Kaha Yesu uakovelele mu mbalanda ya njivo ya Njambi nakusheka voshe vaje vakele nakulandesa na vaje vakele nakulanda mu njivo ya Njambi, kaha uafulumikile vimesa via vaje vakele nakulandulula vimbongo na vitumamo via vaje vakele nakulandesa mavembe. <verse eid="MAT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 21:13" />Kaha uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Vacisoneka nguavo, njivo yange vakaitumbula njivo ya malombelo, vuno honi yeni muaipuisa cihela ca vezi.”<verse eid="MAT 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 21:14" />Kaha tupuputua na vilema vezile kuli ikeye mu vimbalanda via njivo ya Njambi, kaha uavakanguisile. <verse eid="MAT 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 21:15" />Vuno honi omo vakuluntu va vasasendote na valongisi va mezi omo vamuene viuma viacili vije vialingile, na vanike vavandende vatambekele mu njivo ya Njambi nguavo, “Hosana Muna Ndaviti,” Nankuma vanienguele cikuma, <verse eid="MAT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 21:16" />kaha vahandekele kuli ikeye nguavo, “Uli nakuvua evi vivali nakuhandeka ava ndi?” Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:16">“Eyo, nkuma kumuatandele nguavo, ‘Mu tunua tua vanike na vaje vali nakujamua mukemo mukahumu kushangala ca vusunga ndi?’”<verse eid="MAT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 21:17" />Kaha Yesu uavasezele, uahumine mu nganda nakuya ku Mbetaniya kukeko kuakakosele.<verse eid="MAT 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu asinga muti ua mukuyu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:12-14">Mako 11:12-14</ref>;<ref loc="MRK 11:20-24">20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 21:18" />Cimene mene omo Yesu uakele nakuhiluka ku nganda ya Yelusalema, uevuile njala. <verse eid="MAT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 21:19" />Kaha omo uamuene muti ua mukuyu ku mukulo ua ngila, uayileko kaha uauaneneko nacimo cahi kuvanga maputa lika. Kaha uahandekele kuli ukeuo nguendi, “Keti ukeme vushuka naua!” Kaha hajevene uje muti ua mukuyu uomine.<verse eid="MAT 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 21:20" />Omo vandongisi vacimuene valikomokelele cikuma, kaha vahandekele nguavo, “Nkuma vati honi ahavene ou muti ua mukuyu unomu?”<verse eid="MAT 21:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 21:21" />Kaha Yesu uavakumbuluile nguendi, “Muavusunga njimileka nguange, nga muli na lutsilielo nakuhona kulikanouela, kumukalingi lika evi vinalingiua ku muti ua mukuyu, vuno honi cipue nga mukahandeka kuli ou munkinda ngueni, ‘Katuka linga ukaliumbile mu cisali, kaha cikalingiua.’ <verse eid="MAT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 21:22" />Nga muli na lutsilielo, vioshe vimukalomba muli lombelo mukavitambula.”<verse eid="MAT 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cihula ca ha nzili yakama ya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mako 11:27-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luka 20:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 21:23" />Kaha omo Yesu uakovelele mu mbalanda ya njivo ya Njambi, tele acili nakulongesa, vakuluntu va vasasendote na vakuluntu vezile kuli ikeye nakuhandeka nguavo, “Nzili muka yakama ulinakulinga nayo viuma evi, iya uakuhanene eyi nzili yakama?”<verse eid="MAT 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 21:24" />Kaha Yesu uavakumbuluile nguendi, “Nange naua njimihula cihula kaha nga munjikumbulula, kaha nange naua njikamileka nzili yakama injikalingi nayo evi viuma. <verse eid="MAT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 21:25" />Nkuma kumbuitika ca Yiuano cahumine kuli? Cahumine muilu indi cahumine ku vantu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:25">Vakele navimpata hali umo na mukuavo nguavo, “Nga tuhandeka nguetu cahumine muilu, kaha akahandeka kuli yetu nguendi, ‘Nkuma vika honi kumua mutsilielelele?’ <verse eid="MAT 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 21:26" />Vuno honi nga tuhandeka nguetu, ‘Cahumine ku vantu,’ kaha tuteua civunga ca vantu, omo voshe vatsilielele nguavo Yiuano uapuile kananguizi.” <verse eid="MAT 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 21:27" />Kaha vakumbuluile Yesu nguavo, “Kutuzivuka.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:27">Kaha uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Nange naua kunjimilekesa kuje kunjikahumisa eyi nzili yakama injili nakulinga nayo viuma evi.”<verse eid="MAT 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cisimo ca vana va vamala vavali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 21:28" />“Nkuma yeni vika muyongolaho? Kuakele yala uje uakele na vana vavali va vamala, kaha uayile kuli uakulivanga nakuhandeka kuli ikeye nguendi, ‘Munange, lelo ya ukapange mu lihia lia viniu.’ <verse eid="MAT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 21:29" />Kaha uamukumbuluile nguendi, ‘Kunjiyiko’ vuno honi muka ntsimbu lika uatengulukile nakuya. <verse eid="MAT 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 21:30" />Kaha uayile kuli uamucivali nakukahandeka viakulifua, kaha uamukumbuluile nguendi ‘Njiya tate,’ vuno honi kaile. <verse eid="MAT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 21:31" />Nkuma hali ava vavali iya ualingile cizango ca ishe?” Vamukumbuluile nguavo,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:31">“Uakulivanga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:31">Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, muavusunga njihandeka kuli yeni nguange, vaka kutambula lisimu na vikoyi vakovela mu Vumuene vua Njambi yeni kanda. <verse eid="MAT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 21:32" />Muomu Yiuano uezile kuli yeni mu ngila ya vusunga, kaha kumua mutsilielele, vuno honi vaka kutambula lisimu na vikoyi vamutsilielele, vuno cipue vene yeni muacimuene, vuno kumuatengulukile nakumutsiliela.<verse eid="MAT 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cisimo ca vaka kupanga mu lihia lia vushuka vua viniu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Mako 12:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luka 20:9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 21:33" />Kaha Yesu uahandekele naua nguendi, “Ivuilileni cisimo cikuavo, Kuakele liavenia njivo uje uakunine lihia lia vushuka vua viniu, kaha uazenguisileko cipatanga, kaha uahindile cina ca kukamuinamo viniu, kaha uatungile kaposhi nakusezelako vaka kupanga, kaha uayile ku cifuti ceka. <verse eid="MAT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 21:34" />Omo ntsimbu ya kuteja vushuka yakele muyehi, uatumine vangamba vendi kuli vaka kupanga, linga vakambate vushuka vuendi, <verse eid="MAT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 21:35" />kaha vaje vaka kupanga vakuatele vangamba vendi kaha vapupileho umo, nakutsihaho umo, kaha nakuashaho umo mavue. <verse eid="MAT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 21:36" />Kaha naua uatumine vangamba veka, kupulakana vakulivanga, kaha navakevo vene vavalingile cifua cimo. <verse eid="MAT 21:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 21:37" />Kuhuma haje uatumine munendi kuli vakevo nguendi, ‘Vaka musingimika munange.’ <verse eid="MAT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 21:38" />Vuno honi vaje vaka kupanga omo vamuene uje muana, valihandekesele umo na mukuavo nguavo, ‘Ou ikeye muna uje vavenia lihia, tuyeni tumutsihe kaha tukasuana lihia liendi.’ <verse eid="MAT 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 21:39" />Kaha vamukuatele nakumumbila hambanza ya lihia, nakumutsiha.<verse eid="MAT 21:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 21:40" />“Nankuma omo liavenia lihia akeja, nkuma akalinga vika kuli vaje vaka kupanga?”<verse eid="MAT 21:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 21:41" />Vahandekele kuli ikeye nguavo, “Akatsiha vaje vantu va vapi kaha vakatsa mua mupi, kaha akahana lije lihia lia viniu kuvaka kupanga veka vaje vakamuhana vushuka mu ntsimbu yavuo.”<verse eid="MAT 21:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 21:42" />Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Nkuma kumuatandele mu visoneka nguavio,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">‘Livue lije vene vaka kutunga vavianene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:42">likelio linapu cisimi ca mu mbango.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">Eci cikeco calingile Muene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:42">kaha cinapu cakukomouesa kuli yetu!’<verse eid="MAT 21:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 21:43" />Nankuma njimileka nguange, “Vumuene vua Njambi vaka miniekavuo nakuvuhana ku vantu vaje vema vushuka.” <verse eid="MAT 21:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 21:44" />[Kaha muntu uoshe uje auila ha livue eli likamutetanga vipindi pindi, vuno honi nga uoshe uje likauila, likamutsena.]<verse eid="MAT 21:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 21:45" />Omo vakuluntu va vasasendote na Vafaliseho vovuile visimo viendi, vazivukile nguavo ali nakuhandeka vakevo. <verse eid="MAT 21:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 21:46" />Vuno honi omo vesekele kumukuta, vateuele civunga ca vantu, muomu vazivukile nguavo ikeye kananguizi.<verse eid="MAT 21:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="MAT 22" />
  <para style="s">Cisimo ca ciuano ca vulo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 14:15-24">Luka 14:15-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 22:1" />Kaha naua Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo mu visimo nguendi, <verse eid="MAT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 22:2" />“Vumuene vua muilu vunapu kusetekesa ngue muene uje ualingile ciuano ca vulo vua munendi ua yala, <verse eid="MAT 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 22:3" />kaha uatumine vangamba vendi mukusana vaje valaniene ku ciuano ca vulo, vuno honi kuvezileko. <verse eid="MAT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 22:4" />Kaha uatumine vangamba vakuavo naua nguendi, ‘Lekeni vaje vavanalania, Taleni njavuahesa laja viakulia viange, vangombe vange na vimuna vange vakuhindala vanavatsihi, kaha viuma vioshe vinavuaha laja, ijeni ku ciuano ca vulo!’ <verse eid="MAT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 22:5" />Vuno honi kuvahakeleleko mana, vayile kuavo, umo ku lihia liendi, mukuavo kumingoso yendi, <verse eid="MAT 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 22:6" />vakuavo vakuatele vaje vangamba vendi nakuvayandesa mua mupi, kaha va vatsihile. <verse eid="MAT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 22:7" />Kaha muene uanienguele cikuma, kaha uatumine masualale vendi nakukavanongesa vaje vatsihile vangamba vendi nakukatsimika nganda yavo. <verse eid="MAT 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 22:8" />Ambahoni uahandekele kuli vangamba vendi nguendi, ‘Ciuano ca vulo cavuaha laja, vuno honi vaje valaniene kuvezile. <verse eid="MAT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 22:9" />Nankuma yemuye mu vimbango via vitapalo, kaha mukalanie voshe vaje vamukauana veje ku ciuano ca vulo’ <verse eid="MAT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 22:10" />Kaha vaje vangamba vayile mu vitapalo nakukungulula voshe vaje vavauanene, voshe vacili na vaje va vapi, kaha ije njivo ya ciuano ca vulo yashulile na vangenzi.<verse eid="MAT 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 22:11" />“Vuno honi omo muene uezile nakukovela mukumona vaje vangenzi, uamuene ngeci yala umo kazalele vuzalo vua ha vulo, <verse eid="MAT 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 22:12" />kaha uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, ‘Kavusamba uakovela vati muno kuakuhona kuzala vuzalo vua ha vulo?’ Kaha uahonouele viakuhandeka. <verse eid="MAT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 22:13" />Ambahoni muene uahandekele kuli vaje vaka kukuasa vangenzi nguendi, ‘Mukuteni ku mavoko na ku mikono, mutualeni hambanza mu milima, kuje vantu vaka lila na kulishumanga ku mazo’”<verse eid="MAT 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 22:14" />“Muomu vavengi vavanasana, vuno honi vavandende lika vavanahangula.”<verse eid="MAT 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cihula ca ha kufueta lisimu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Mako 12:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luka 20:20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 22:15" />Ambahoni Vafaliseho vayile nakutumba vutumbe ngeci vakamueseke navihandeka viendi. <verse eid="MAT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 22:16" />Kaha vatumine vandongisi vavo kuli ikeye hamo na mpunga ya Helonde nguavo, “Mulongisi tuzivuka nguetu u yala uavusunga kaha ukalongesa ngila ya Njambi mu vusunga, cakuhona kuteua muntu uoshe, muomu kuuekutala muntu muafuilamo. <verse eid="MAT 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 22:17" />Tuleke vika usinganieka? Nkuma cinapu lishiko kufueta lisimu kuli Sezale, indi houe?”<verse eid="MAT 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 22:18" />Vuno honi Yesu uazivukile laja vupi vuavo kaha uahandekele nguendi, “Yeni vaka civembulu, vika honi munjesekela? <verse eid="MAT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 22:19" />Njimueseni vimbongo via lisimu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:19">Kaha vamunehelele mbongo ya muuaya uaya. <verse eid="MAT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 22:20" />Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:20">“Cihanga ceya eci?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:20">“Kaha lizina lieya vanasonekaho?” <verse eid="MAT 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 22:21" />Vahandekele nguavo, “Via Sezale.” Ambahoni uahandekekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Haneni viuma via Sezale kuli Sezale, kaha haneni viuma via Njambi kuli Njambi.”<verse eid="MAT 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 22:22" />Omo vovuile eci valikomokelele cikuma kaha vamusezele nakuya.<verse eid="MAT 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cihula ca ha kusanguka ku vatsi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mako 12:18-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luka 20:27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 22:23" />Ha litangua lije vene Vasanduki vezile kuli Yesu, vaje vakatsiliela nguavo kukuesi kusanguka ku vatsi. Kaha vamuihuile cihula nguavo,<verse eid="MAT 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 22:24" />Mulongisi, Mosesa uahandekele nguendi, “Nga yala atsa kuakuhona kuseza vana, kaha uje muanaye napande kuambata uje ntuluue, linga asemeneko vana vaje vanapandele kusemenako muanaye. <verse eid="MAT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 22:25" />Honi vapuile vatanu na vavali vamunaina, kaha uakulivanga uambatele, kaha uatsile, kaha kasezele vana kaha uasezele uje mpueyendi kuli muanaye. <verse eid="MAT 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 22:26" />Cuma cakulifua calingiuile kuli uamucivali na kuli uamucitatu, kuheta nakuli uje uamu citanu na vavali. <verse eid="MAT 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 22:27" />Kumamanusuilo uje mpuevo uatsile. <verse eid="MAT 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 22:28" />Kaha mukusanguka, nankuma, akapua mpuevo yeya ha vantu ava vatanu na vavali? Muomu voshe vamuambatele.”<verse eid="MAT 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 22:29" />Vuno honi Yesu uavakumbuluile nguendi, “Yeni muapihisa, muomu kumuzivuka visoneka cipue nzili ya Njambi. <verse eid="MAT 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 22:30" />Muomu mukusanguka ku vatsi kukukakala kuambata cipue kushombuesa, vuno honi vakapua ngue tungelo va muilu. <verse eid="MAT 22:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 22:31" />Kaha ngue ha kusanguka kuvatsi, nkuma kumuatandele vije viahandekele Njambi kuli yeni nguendi, <verse eid="MAT 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 22:32" />‘Yange Njambi ua Avilahama, na Njambi ua Isake, na Njambi ua Yakomba.’ Keti Njambi ua vaka kutsa, vuno honi Njambi ua vaka kuyoya.” <verse eid="MAT 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 22:33" />Kaha omo civunga ca vantu covuile eci, valikomokelele cikuma ha kulongesa cendi.<verse eid="MAT 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lishiko liakama cikuma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:28-34">Mako 12:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luka 10:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 22:34" />Vuno honi omo Vafaliseho vevuile nguavo naholuesa Vasanduki, kaha valikunguluile hamo lika. <verse eid="MAT 22:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 22:35" />Kaha umo uavo, uje uapuile muka kuimanena mashiko, uamuhuile cihula cakumueseka nguendi, <verse eid="MAT 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 22:36" />“Mulongisi, nkuma lishiko muka liakama cikuma ku mashiko oshe?”<verse eid="MAT 22:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 22:37" />“Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, ‘Ukazanga Muene Njambi yove na mutima uove uoshe, na muono uove uoshe, na mana ove oshe.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 22:38" />Eli likelio lishiko liakama cikuma lia kulivanga. <verse eid="MAT 22:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 22:39" />Kaha lia mucivali eli, ‘Zanga mukueni ngue muje muualizangela yove vavenia.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 22:40" />Ha mashiko aua avali hakeho hanemana mashiko oshe na tunanguizi.”<verse eid="MAT 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cihula ca hali Kilistu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Mako 12:35-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luka 20:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 22:41" />Honi omo Vafaliseho valikunguluile hamo, Yesu uavehuile cihula, <verse eid="MAT 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 22:42" />uahandekele nguendi, “Vika musinganieka hali Kilistu? Uapua Muna iya?” Vamukumbuluile nguavo,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:42">“Muna Ndaviti.”<verse eid="MAT 22:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 22:43" />Kaha Yesu uavehuile nguendi, “Nkuma capuile vati honi, nkuma Ndaviti vamulongesele kuli Cimbembesi, ngeci amusane nguendi Muene, omo uahandekele nguendi,<verse eid="MAT 22:43" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 22:44" />‘Muene uahandekele kuli Muene uange nguendi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 22:44">Tumama ku livoko liange lia cilio,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 22:44">noho njikahaka vitozi vove muintsi lia viliato viove?’<verse eid="MAT 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 22:45" />Nga Ndaviti amusana nguendi ‘Muene,’ nkuma akapua vati naua munendi?<verse eid="MAT 22:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 22:46" />Kaha naumo uahi uasele kumutava lizi, nankuma kuhuma ha litangua lije vene naumo uahi uesekele kumuihula cihula naua.<verse eid="MAT 22:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="MAT 23" />
  <para style="s">Yesu anangula hali valongisi va mezi a lishiko na Vafaliseho</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:38-39">Mako 12:38-39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:43-46">Luka 11:43-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-46">20:45-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 23:1" />Ambahoni Yesu uahandekele ku vivunga na kuli vandongisi vendi nguendi, <verse eid="MAT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 23:2" />“Valongisi va lishiko na Vafaliseho vatumama ha cituamo ca Mosesa, <verse eid="MAT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 23:3" />kaha lingeni nakutala vioshe vije vamileka, vuno honi keti vije vivalinga, muomu vakambulula vije kuvekulinga. <verse eid="MAT 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 23:4" />Vakakutu viteli via kulema vije viavikalu kuviambata, nakuvituika ha vitsili via vantu, vuno honi vakevo kuvekujundulako cipue na munie uavo ha kuvijundula. <verse eid="MAT 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 23:5" />Vioshe vije vivakalingi, vakavilingila linga vantu vavamone, muomu vakakutilila mikanda ya visoneka ha maholo avo na ha mavoko avo, na vulaha vua tundombe tua tuzaku tuavo, <verse eid="MAT 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 23:6" />kaha vakevo vazanga cihela ca vulemu ku viuano na vitumamo viacili mu vinjivo via malombelo, <verse eid="MAT 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 23:7" />nakuvameneka nakasingimiko ku vihela via kulandesela, nakuvasana nguavo ‘Mulongisi’ ku vantu. <verse eid="MAT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 23:8" />Vuno honi yeni keti vamisane mulongisi, muomu muli lika na mulongisi umo, kaha yeni voshe muva vusamba. <verse eid="MAT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 23:9" />Kaha keti mukasaneho muntu uoshe ‘Tate’ ha mavu, muomu muli lika na Ishueni umo, uje ali muilu. <verse eid="MAT 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 23:10" />Naua keti vakamisane muene, muomu muli lika na muene umo, ikeye Kilistu. <verse eid="MAT 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 23:11" />Uoshe uje uakama hakati keni akapua ngamba yeni. <verse eid="MAT 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 23:12" />Uoshe uje alijundula ikeye vavenia vaka mukehesa, kaha uoshe uje alikehesa ikeye vavenia vaka mujundula.<verse eid="MAT 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu avahisa ha civembulu cavo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:40">Mako 12:40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:39-42">Luka 11:39-42</ref>;<ref loc="LUK 11:44">44</ref>;<ref loc="LUK 11:52">52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:47">20:47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 23:13" />“Vuno honi tuyando kuli yeni, valongisi va mashiko na Vafaliseho, yeni vaka civembulu! Muomu mukashoko vikolo via Vumuene vua muilu ku vantu, muomu neni vavenia kumue kukovelamo, cipue kutavesa vaje vatonda linga vakovele. <verse eid="MAT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 23:14" />Tuyando kuli yeni, valongisi va mashiko na Vafaliseho, yeni vaka civembulu! Muomu yeni mukapihisa vinjivo via vantuluue mukulimuesa ha kulombela malombelo alaha. Nankuma mukatambula cihiso cakama.<verse eid="MAT 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 23:15" />“Tuyando kuli yeni, valongisi va mashiko na Vafaliseho, yeni vaka civembulu! Muomu yeni mukendangana ku cisali naku ntunda linga mutengululeko muntu umo, kaha omo natenguluka, mukamupuisa luvali kupua muana ua ngehena ngue yeni.<verse eid="MAT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 23:16" />“Tuyando kuli yeni vantuama vatupuputua, yeni vaje mukahandeka ngueni, ‘Nga umo alisinga na njivo ya Njambi, kaha cinapu cangoco, vuno honi nga umo alisinga na ngolinde ya njivo ya Njambi, kaha vanamukutu nacisingo cendi.’ <verse eid="MAT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 23:17" />Yeni tupuputua va vilema! Nkuma cika cakama, ngolinde indi njivo ya Njambi ije ilingisa ngolinde linga ipue yakulela? <verse eid="MAT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 23:18" />Kaha mukahandeka ngueni, ‘Nga umo alisinga na mutula, kaha cinapu cangoco, vuno honi nga umo alisinga na vuana vuje vuli ha mutula, kaha vanamukutu nacisingo cendi.’ <verse eid="MAT 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 23:19" />Yeni vantu vatupuputua! Nkuma cika cakama, vuana indi mutula uje ulingisa vuana linga vupue vuakulela? <verse eid="MAT 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 23:20" />Nankuma uoshe uje alisinga na mutula, nalisingi nauo na vioshe vije viliho, <verse eid="MAT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 23:21" />kaha uoshe uje alisinga na njivo ya Njambi, nalisingi nayo na uje uakalamo, <verse eid="MAT 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 23:22" />kaha uoshe uje alisinga na lilu, nalisingi na litanda lia Njambi na uoshe uje uatumamaho.<verse eid="MAT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 23:23" />“Tuyando kuli yeni, valongisi va lishiko na Vafaliseho, yeni vaka civembulu! Muomu yeni mukahana cavulikumi ca viuma vije mukatovesa mu visapa sapa via minte na ndilu na kumine, nakuyengula viuma viaseho via lishiko, via vusunga na cikeketima na lutsilielo, vije vimunapandele kulinga cakuhona kuyengula vikuavo. <verse eid="MAT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 23:24" />Yeni vantuama vatupuputua, mukahumisa mbulumbulu mu viakunua vieni nakuminisa kamelu!<verse eid="MAT 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 23:25" />“Tuyando kuli yeni, valongisi va lishiko na Vafaliseho, yeni vaka civembulu! Muomu yeni mukakushu nganja na lilonga hambanza yavio, vuno honi mukati kavio muashulu nalizangamena nakulizanga yeni vavenia. <verse eid="MAT 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 23:26" />Yeni Vafaliseho vatupuputua! Cakulivanga tahi kusheni mukati ka nganja na lilonga, kaha na helu liavio hakalela.<verse eid="MAT 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 23:27" />“Tuyando kuli yeni valongisi va lishiko na Vafaliseho, yeni vaka civembulu! Muomu yeni munapu ngue vihilo vije vivanakushu kaha vinatoko too, vije hambanza liavio vimoneka muacili, vuno honi mukati kavio munashulu na vitsihia via vantu vakutsa na via mazilo vioshe. <verse eid="MAT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 23:28" />Omu mukemo neni vene mumuli nakusholoka, hambanza musholoka ngue vaka vusunga ku vantu, vuno honi mukati keni munashulu na civembulu na vupi.<verse eid="MAT 23:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahandeka viakulutue via kashitiko kavo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:47-51">Luka 11:47-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 23:29" />“Tuyando kuli yeni valongisi va lishiko na Vafaliseho, yeni vaka civembulu! Muomu yeni mukatungu vihilo via tunanguizi nakupesapesa viakumunga via vaka vusunga, <verse eid="MAT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 23:30" />nakuhandeka ngueni, ‘Nga tuayoyele mu matangua aje a vakukuluila vetu, ngue kutualingile vije vivalingile vakevo viakumuania maninga a tunanguizi.’ <verse eid="MAT 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 23:31" />Nankuma mulina vukaleho hali yeni vavenia, ngueni mu vatekuluila va vaje vatsihile tunanguizi. <verse eid="MAT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 23:32" />Nkumani shulisiseni seteko ya va ishueni. <verse eid="MAT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 23:33" />Yeni manoka, yeni vana va manoka, nkuma mukateua vati cihiso ca ngehena? <verse eid="MAT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 23:34" />Nankuma njimitumina tunanguizi, na vaka mana na valongisi va lishiko, vamo vaje vamukatsihia na kushukika ha cilindakano, kaha vamo mukavapupa mu vinjivo vieni via malombelo, nakuvasheka kuhuma nganda nakuya nganda ikuavo. <verse eid="MAT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 23:35" />Kaha mukatambula kashitiko ka kutsiha vantu voshe vaje vakuhona mulonga, kuhuma ku maninga amuka vusunga a Avele kuya ku maninga a Zakaliya muna Mbelekiya, uje imuatsihilile mukati ka njivo ya Njambi na mutula. <verse eid="MAT 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 23:36" />Muavusunga njimileka nguange, cihiso coshe cikeja hali vantu va ntsimbu ino.<verse eid="MAT 23:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alilila Yelusalema</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:34-35">Luka 13:34-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 23:37" />“Yove Yelusalema, Yelusalema, mukakutsiha tunanguizi nakuasha mavue vaje va vanatumu kuli yove! Nkuma vintsimbu vingahi njakunguluile vana vove hamolika ngue cali muakavutamena vana vendi mu mambava endi, kaha yove ku uatondelemo! <verse eid="MAT 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 23:38" />Tala, njivo yove vanaiseze kaha ili mupulungua. <verse eid="MAT 23:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 23:39" />Kaha njikuleka nguange, ku ukanjimonoho naua, kuvanga noho ukahandeka nguove ‘Uakukuisula uje eja mu lizina lia Muene.’”<verse eid="MAT 23:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="MAT 24" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ahandeka via kulutue via kunonga ca Njivo ya Njambi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Mako 13:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luka 21:5-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 24:1" />Yesu uahumine mu njivo ya Njambi kaha uatondele kuya, omo vandongisi vendi vezile kuli ikeye nakumumuesa vinjivo via Njambi. <verse eid="MAT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 24:2" />Vuno honi uavakumbuluile nguendi, “Munamono viuma vioshe evi, indi houe? Muavusunga njihandeka kuli yeni nguange, kukuesi cipue livue limo likasala halikuavo, lije kuvakombila ha mavu.”<verse eid="MAT 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tuyando na mapakeso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Mako 13:3-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luka 21:7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 24:3" />Kaha omo Yesu uatumamene ha munkinda ua Oliveta, vandongisi vendi vezile kuli ikeye muvusueke nakuhandeka nguavo, “Tuleke ntsimbu muka eci cikalingiua, kaha cimueso muka cikalingiua hakuija cove na ha ntsimbu ya kuhua ca mavu?” <verse eid="MAT 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 24:4" />Kaha Yesu uavakumbuluile nguendi, “Zangameni linga keti umo akamikuise. <verse eid="MAT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 24:5" />Muomu vavengi vakeja mu lizina liange, nguavo, ‘Yange Kilistu!’ kaha vakakuisa vavengi. <verse eid="MAT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 24:6" />Kaha mukevua vinzita nakalua ka vinzita, keti mukakomoke, muomu evi viapande kulingiua, vuno honi eci keti cikeco kukotoka ca mavu. <verse eid="MAT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 24:7" />Muomu lifuti likatengulukila lifuti likuavo, vumuene vukatengulukila vumuene vukuavo, ku kakala njala yakama cikuma na mandunduma ku mitambela yakuliseza seza. <verse eid="MAT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 24:8" />Evi vinapu ngue kuputuka ca mushongo uakusema.<verse eid="MAT 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 24:9" />“Ambahoni vakamituala mukuyanda, nakumitsiha, kaha vaka mafuti voshe vaka mizinda muomu ya lizina liange. <verse eid="MAT 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 24:10" />Kaha ambahoni vavengi lutsilielo luavo lukahua, kaha vakalienda vungungu umo na mukuavo na kulizinda umo na mukuavo. <verse eid="MAT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 24:11" />Kaha tunanguizi va makuli vavengi vakeja na kukuisa vavengi. <verse eid="MAT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 24:12" />Muomu kulivuezelela ca vupi cinapu cakama, kaha cizango ca vantu vavengi cikatontola. <verse eid="MAT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 24:13" />Vuno honi uoshe uje akakateya nakuma manusuilo akovoka. <verse eid="MAT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 24:14" />Kaha Muzimbu Uacili ou ua Mumuene vaka uambulula ha mavu oshe, kupua ngue vukaleho ku mafuti oshe, ambahoni mamanusuilo akeja.<verse eid="MAT 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cimueso ca shuamua</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:14-23">Mako 13:14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luka 21:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 24:15" />“Nankuma omo mukamona cimueso ca shuamua cije cahandekele kananguizi Ndaniele cinemana mu cihela ca kulela (Yove uli na kutanda uvuisisa muvinalumbunukila!) <verse eid="MAT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 24:16" />Ambahoni eceleni vaje vali mu Yundeya vateuele ku minkinda, <verse eid="MAT 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 24:17" />uoshe uje hali helu lia njivo keti ashuluke ha mavu, linga ambate vije vili mu njivo yendi, <verse eid="MAT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 24:18" />kaha uoshe ali mu lihia keti ahiluke kunima nakuambata cikovelo cendi. <verse eid="MAT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 24:19" />Caluvinda kuli vaje vakemita na kuli vaje vakajamuesa mu matangua aje! <verse eid="MAT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 24:20" />Lombeleni linga keti cikalingiue mu cisika cipue ha litangua lia Sapalalo. <verse eid="MAT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 24:21" />Muomu honi ha matangua aje kukakala tuyando, tuje kutuakeleko hume hambangelo ya mavu kuheta na lelo, houe, kaha kutukakalako naua. <verse eid="MAT 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 24:22" />Kaha nga aje matangua kuva akehesele ngue na muntu uahi akovoka, vuno honi muomu ya vantu vendi vaje vahanguile, matangua aje vaka akehesa.<verse eid="MAT 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 24:23" />“Ambahoni nga umo ahandeka kuli yeni nguendi, ‘Taleni Kilistu uno!’ cipue ‘Uje ali kuje!’ keti mucitsiliele.” <verse eid="MAT 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 24:24" />Muomu Vakilistu va makuli na tunanguizi va makuli vakasholoka nakulinga vimueso viakama na vikomoueso, linga vamizimbalese, nga casiua ngeci vakazimbalese cipue vaje vavanahangula. <verse eid="MAT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 24:25" />Vuno honi taleni, njamilekela lumo ntsimbu kanda vihete.<verse eid="MAT 24:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 24:26" />“Cipue nga vahandeka kuli yeni nguavo, ‘Taleni ali mu mpambo,’ keti muyeko, cipue nga vahandeka nguavo, ‘Taleni, ali mu mulili ua mukati!’ keti mucitsiliele. <verse eid="MAT 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 24:27" />Muomu ngue muje muhiato ukahumu ku ngangela nakutua ceke kuheta ku kangombe ka yambi, omu mukemo mucikafua nakuija ca Muna Muntu.<verse eid="MAT 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 24:28" />“Kuoshe kuje kuli civimbi kukeko kukali kunguluila makuvi.<verse eid="MAT 24:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuija ca Muna Muntu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Mako 13:24-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luka 21:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 24:29" />“Hanima ya tuyando ha matangua aje litangua likazivala, kaha ngonde kuikatu ceke, na vintanga ntanga vikaua kuhuma muilu, kaha vinzili via melu vikaninganga. <verse eid="MAT 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 24:30" />Ambahoni kukasholoka cimueso ca Muna Muntu muilu, kaha miyati yoshe ya ha mavu ikalila, kaha vakamona Muna Muntu eja mu mashelua a muilu na nzili na vumpau vuakama. <verse eid="MAT 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 24:31" />Kaha akatuma tungelo vendi na mutambi ua tolombita, kaha vakakungulula vantu vendi vahanguile kuhuma ku vimbango viuana, kuhuma ku maputukilo a mavu kuheta naku mamanusuilo.”<verse eid="MAT 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cilongesa ca muti ua mukuyu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Mako 13:28-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luka 21:29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 24:32" />“Lilongeseni cilongesa ca muti ua mukuyu, muje mintango yauo ituikilila nakuhaka maputa, kaha muazivuka ngueni ntondue ili muyehi. <verse eid="MAT 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 24:33" />Kaha omo mumona viuma vioshe evi, kaha muzivuke ngueni ntsimbu ili muyehi. <verse eid="MAT 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 24:34" />Muavusunga njimileka nguange, vantu va ntsimbu ino kuvakatsi kuvanga viuma vioshe evi vinalingiua. <verse eid="MAT 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 24:35" />Melu na mavu vioshe vikahita, vuno honi mezi ange kuakahu.”<verse eid="MAT 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Naumo uahi azivuka litangua cipue ntsimbu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:32-37">Mako 13:32-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:26-30">Luka 17:26-30</ref>;<ref loc="LUK 17:34-36">34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 24:36" />“Vuno honi litangua lije cipue ntsimbu, naumo uahi avizivuka, cipue vene tungelo va muilu, cipue Muana, vuno honi kuvanga lika Tate. <verse eid="MAT 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 24:37" />Ngue mucafuile ku matangua a Noua, mukemo vene mucikafua hakuija ca Muna Muntu. <verse eid="MAT 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 24:38" />Muomu ngue mu matangua aje tele livazi kanda lije vantu vakele nakulia na kunua, vambatele na kushombuesa, kutuala na ha litangua lije Noua uakovelele mu vuato, <verse eid="MAT 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 24:39" />kaha kuvazivukile kuvanga noho livazi liezile nakuvanongesa voshe, omu mukemo mu cikafua nahakuija ca Muna Mutu. <verse eid="MAT 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 24:40" />Kaha vamala vavali vakakala mu lihia, kaha umo vakamuambata mukuavo vakamuseza. <verse eid="MAT 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 24:41" />Kaha vampuevo vavali vakatua mucini cimo, kaha umo vakamuambata, mukuavo vakamuseza. <verse eid="MAT 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 24:42" />Zangameni muomu kumukazivuka litangua lije Muene yeni akeja. <verse eid="MAT 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 24:43" />Vuno honi zivukeni eci, nga liavenia njivo akazivuka ntsimbu muka ya vutsiki muizi akeja, kaha nga akavandamena, nakumona nguendi njivo yendi keti vaituve. <verse eid="MAT 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 24:44" />Nankuma neni naua munapande kulivuahesela, muomu Muna Muntu akeja ha ntsimbu ije kumuzivuka.”<verse eid="MAT 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngamba ua kulongua cipue uakuhona kulongua</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:41-48">Luka 12:41-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 24:45" />“Iya honi ngamba ua kulongua ua mana, uje muene uendi uamuhakele kuendesa vakuavo vangamba nakuvahana viakulia ha ntsimbu ya cili? <verse eid="MAT 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 24:46" />Uakukuisula uje ngamba omo muene uendi muje ahiluka amuuana alinakulinga mujevene. <verse eid="MAT 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 24:47" />Muavusunga njimileka nguange, akamupuisa kupua mukuluntu ua vufuko vuendi vuoshe. <verse eid="MAT 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 24:48" />Vuno honi nga uje ngamba ikeye uamupi kaha akahandeka kuli ikeye vavenia nguendi, ‘Muene uange neshuala kuhiluka,’ <verse eid="MAT 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 24:49" />kaha aputuka kupupa vangamba vakuavo, na kulia na kunua na vaka kupenda, <verse eid="MAT 24:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 24:50" />muene ua uje ngamba akeja ha litangua lije ka muvandamenene na ntsimbu ije kazivukile, <verse eid="MAT 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 24:51" />kaha akamuhana kashitiko na kumuhaka hamo na vaka civembulu, kuje vantu vakalila na kulishumanga ku mazo.”<verse eid="MAT 24:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="MAT 25" />
  <para style="s">Cisimo ca vambanda likumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 25:1" />“Ha ntsimbu ije Vumuene vua muilu vaka vusetekesa ngue vambanda likumi vaje vambatele vindeya viavo nakuya linga vakaliuane na liavenia vulo. <verse eid="MAT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 25:2" />Vuno honi ava vatanu vapuile vilema, kaha vatanu vapuile vamana. <verse eid="MAT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 25:3" />Omo vaje vambanda va vilema vambatele vindeya viavo, kuvambatele na mazi eka naua, <verse eid="MAT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 25:4" />vuno honi vaje va mana vambatele mazi mu vintsazi na mu vindeya viavo. <verse eid="MAT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 25:5" />Kaha omo uje liavenia vulo uakotokelele kuija, kaha voshe vaje vambanda vanengukile na kuya mutulo.”<verse eid="MAT 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 25:6" />“Vuno honi mukati ka vutsiki vevuile mutambi nguavo, ‘Taleni liavenia vulo uje ali nakuija! Tuhukeni linga muliuane nendi.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 25:7" />Ambahoni voshe vaje vambanda vahindukile nakushukumisa vindeya viavo. <verse eid="MAT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 25:8" />Kaha vaje va vilema vahandekele kuli vaje va mana nguavo, ‘Tuhaneniko amo mazi eni, muomu vindeya vietu vitonda kuzima.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 25:9" />Vuno honi vaje vambanda vamana vakumbuluile nguavo, ‘Kutupuisamo kulipangelauo yetu neni, yemuye kuli vakakulandesa linga mukalilandele yeni vavenia.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 25:10" />Kaha tele vanayi mukulanda, liavenia vulo uezile, kaha vaje valivuaheselele vayile nendi ku ciuano ca vulo, kaha vashokele ku cikolo.”<verse eid="MAT 25:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 25:11" />“Hanima honi vaje vambanda va vilema vezile vahandekele nguavo, ‘Muene, muene, tushokolueleko.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 25:12" />Vuno honi uavakumbuluile nguendi, ‘Muavusunga njihandeka kuli yeni nguange, kunjimizivuka.’”<verse eid="MAT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 25:13" />Nankuma zangameni, muomu kumuzivuka litangua cipue ntsimbu.<verse eid="MAT 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cisimo ca vangamba vatatu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 19:11-27">Luka 19:11-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 25:14" />“Kaha naua Yesu uavalekele nguendi, Vumuene vua muilu vukafua ngue yala omo aya mu vungenzi kaha asana vangamba vendi, nakuvasezela vupite vuendi. <verse eid="MAT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 25:15" />Kuli umo uahanene makulukazi atanu a vimbazuvuila via ngolinde, kuli mukuavo makulukazi avali a vimbazuvuila via ngolinde, kuli mukuavo likulukazi limo lia vimbazuvuila via ngolinde, kuya kuvipangi viavo kaha uayile. <verse eid="MAT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 25:16" />Kaha uje uatambuile makulukazi atanu a vimbazuvuila via ngolinde uayile hajevene uakavilanduluile, kaha uakapangeleleho naua makulukazi atanu a vimbazuvuila via ngolinde. <verse eid="MAT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 25:17" />Kaha naua na uje mukuavo uatambuile makulukazi avali a vimbazuvuila via ngolinde, uapangeleleho naua makulukazi avali a vimbazuvuila via ngolinde. <verse eid="MAT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 25:18" />Vuno honi uje ngamba uatambuile likulukazi limo lia vimbazuvuila via ngolinde, uayile nakukahinda cina nakushitikamo vimbongo via muene uendi.”<verse eid="MAT 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 25:19" />“Omo kuahitile matangua amengi muene ua vaje vangamba uehilukile kaha uatandele navo vije vimbazuvuila via ngolinde. <verse eid="MAT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 25:20" />Kaha uje uatambuile makulukazi atanu a vimbazuvuila via ngolinde uezile, kaha uaneheleleho naua makulukazi atanu a vimbazuvuila via ngolinde, nakuhandeka nguendi, ‘Muene uanjihanene makulukazi atanu a vimbazuvuila via ngolinde, kaha naua njapangelaho makulukazi atanu a vimbazuvuila via ngolinde eka naua.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 25:21" />“Muene uendi uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, ‘Ualingi muacili, ngamba uacili uakulongua! Unapu uakulonua ha viuma via vindende, njikakupuisa mukuluntu ua viuma viavingi. Kovela mukuvuahelele ca muene uove!’” <verse eid="MAT 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 25:22" />“Kaha na uje uatambuile makulukazi avali a vimbazuvuila via ngolinde uezile kuli ikeye nguendi, ‘Muene uanjihanene makulukazi avali a vimbazuvuila via ngolinde, hano njapangelaho makulukazi avali a vimbazuvuila via ngolinde eka naua.’” <verse eid="MAT 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 25:23" />“Muene uendi uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, ‘Ualingi muacili, ngamba uacili uakunkokama! Unapu uakunkokama ha viuma via vindende, njikakupuisa mukuluntu uaviuma viavingi. Kovela mukuvuahelele ca muene uove.’” <verse eid="MAT 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 25:24" />“Kaha na uje uatambuile likulukazi limo lia ngolinde uezile, uahandekele kuli muene uendi nguendi, ‘Muene njikuzivuka nguange uapua u muntu uamukalu cikuma, ukateje vije ku uakuvile, kaha ukakungulula vije ku uashanduile, <verse eid="MAT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 25:25" />kaha njevuile liova, kaha njaile nakushitika ngolinde yove mu livu. Viuma viove evi.’” <verse eid="MAT 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 25:26" />Vuno honi muene uendi uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Yove ngamba uamupi ua cilenda! Uazivukile nguove yange njikateje kuje kunjakuvile, kaha njikakungulula vije kunjashanduile? <verse eid="MAT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 25:27" />Ambahoni ngue uasinganiekele kutulikisa vimbongo viange kuli vakakutulika vimbongo, kaha nga hakuija cange ngue njatambuile vije viapuile viange na kakondueso kayo. <verse eid="MAT 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 25:28" />‘Mutambuleni vimbongo vije vili kuli ikeye, kaha vihaneni kuli uje ali na makulukazi avimbongo likumi. <verse eid="MAT 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 25:29" />Muomu uje alinavio vakamuvuezelelako, kaha akakala na viavingi, vuno honi uje kesi navio, cipue vene vije via vindende vialinavio vakamuniekavio. <verse eid="MAT 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 25:30" />Nakushekela ngamba uje kesi nacimo hambaza ya milima, kuje vantu vakalila na kulishumanga ku mazo’<verse eid="MAT 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kusompa ca mamanusuilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 25:31" />“Omo Muna Muntu akeja mu vumpau vuendi, hamo na tungelo vendi voshe, kaha akatumama halitanda liendi lia vumpau. <verse eid="MAT 25:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 25:32" />Kuli ikeye miyati yoshe ya vantu ikalikungulula, kaha akavatepesa umo ku mukuavo ngue kaniungi muakatepesa vampanga ku vampembe, <verse eid="MAT 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 25:33" />Kaha akahaka vampanga ku livoko liendi lia cilio, vuno honi vampembe ku livoko liendi lia cimoshue. <verse eid="MAT 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 25:34" />Ambahoni Muene akahandeka kuli vaje vali ku livoko liendi lia cilio nguendi, ‘Ijeni, yeni vavanakuisula kuli Tate suaneni vumuene vuje vuanamivuaheselele kuhuma ha luvula lua mavu. <verse eid="MAT 25:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 25:35" />Muomu muje njakele na njala muanjihanene viakulia, kaha omo njakele na mpuila muanjihanene mema akunua, kaha omo njakele njimungezi muanjitambuile, <verse eid="MAT 25:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 25:36" />kunjakele na vuzalo kaha muanjizikile, njakele nakuvavala kaha muanjimenekelele, njakele mu kamenga kaha muezile mukunji menekela.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 25:37" />Ambahoni vaka vusunga vakamukumbulula nguavo, ‘Muene, kuli tuakumuene uli na njala kaha tuakulisile, cipue unevu mpuila kaha tuakuhanene via kunua? <verse eid="MAT 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 25:38" />Kaha kuli tuakumuene umungezi kaha tuakutambuile cipue cakuhona vuzalo kaha tuakuzikile? <verse eid="MAT 25:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 25:39" />Kaha kuli tuakumuene uli nakuvavala cipue uli mu kamenga kaha tuezile nakukumeneka?’ <verse eid="MAT 25:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 25:40" />Kaha Muene akavakumbulula nguendi, ‘Muavusunga njimileka nguange omo muacilingile ku vamo ava vamuanetu, muacilingile kuli yange.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 25:41" />Ambahoni akahandeka kuli voshe vaje vali ku livoko liendi lia cimoshue nguendi, ‘Humeni kuli yange, yeni vakusinga! Yeni mu tuhia tuje kutuekuzima tuje tuvanavuahesela Liyavolo na tungelo vendi. <verse eid="MAT 25:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 25:42" />Muomu njakele na njala kumuanji hanene via kulia, njakele na mpuila kumuanji hanene via kunua, <verse eid="MAT 25:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 25:43" />njapuile njimungezi kaha kumuanji tambuile, kunjakele na vuzalo kaha kumuanjizikile, njavavalele nakukala mu kamenga kaha kumuanji menekelele.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 25:44" />Ambahoni navakevo vakakumbulula nguavo, ‘Muene kuli tuakumuene uli na njala, cipue uli na mpuila, cipue umungezi, cipue cakuhona vuzalo, cipue uvavala, cipue mu kamenga, kaha kutuaku kuasele?’ <verse eid="MAT 25:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 25:45" />Ambahoni akavakumbulula nguendi, ‘Muavusunga njimileka nguange, ngue muje kumuacilingile kuli umo uava vavandende, kumuacilingile kuli yange’ <verse eid="MAT 25:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 25:46" />Kaha vaka vahana kashitiko ka yaye, vuno honi vaka vusunga vaka kovela mu muono uayaye.”<verse eid="MAT 25:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="MAT 26" />
  <para style="s">Vutumbe vua kutsiha Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mako 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luka 22:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yiuano 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 26:1" />Omo Yesu uamanusuile kuhandeka viuma vioshe evi, uahandekele kuli vandongisi vendi nguendi, <verse eid="MAT 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 26:2" />“Muazivuka ngueni omo hanima ya matangua avali Paseka ili na kuija, kaha Muna Muntu vaka muhana linga vakamushukike ha cilindakano.”<verse eid="MAT 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 26:3" />Ambahoni vakuluntu va vasasendote na vakuluntu va vantu valikunguluile mu lipela lia kasasendote uakama, uje ivatumbuile nguavo Kayafase, <verse eid="MAT 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 26:4" />kaha vatumbile vutumbe hamo linga vakute Yesu mu vushueke nakumutsiha. <verse eid="MAT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 26:5" />Vuno honi vahandekele nguavo, “Keti tulinge eci ha ntsimbu ya ciuano, hamo vantu vakaneha mpindangano.”<verse eid="MAT 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vavuavesa Yesu ku Mbetaniya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Mako 14:3-9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Yiuano 12:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 26:6" />Kaha omo Yesu uakele ku Mbetaniya mu njivo ya Simoni yala uje uakele na mbumba, <verse eid="MAT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 26:7" />Omo Yesu tele ali nakulia ku mesa, mpuevo umo uezile kuli ikeye na ntsazi ya mazi andando yakama akunika luengo luacili, kaha ua etilile ha mutue ua Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 26:8" />Vuno honi omo vandongisi vacimuene vanienguele cikuma nakuhandeka nguavo, “Nkuma vika apihisila mazi? <verse eid="MAT 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 26:9" />Muomu mazi aua vapandele ku alandesa na ndando yakama, nakuhana vimbongo ku vihutu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 26:10" />Vuno honi Yesu uazivukule vioshe evi, uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Nkuma vika muli nakupakesela ou mpuevo? Muomu na lingi cuma ca cili kuli yange. <verse eid="MAT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 26:11" />Muomu yeni ntsimbu yoshe muakala na vihutu, vuno honi yeni kumukakala nange ntsimbu yoshe. <verse eid="MAT 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 26:12" />Ha kunjitila aua mazi ha muvila uange, eci na cilingi mukunji vuahesela kunjitsinda. <verse eid="MAT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 26:13" />Muavusunga njimileka nguange, kuoshe kuje ku vakambulula Muzimbu Uacili ha mavu uoshe, evi vianalingi ou mpuevo vakavihandeka mukumuvuluka.”<verse eid="MAT 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yundasa atava kuenda Yesu vungungu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Mako 14:10-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luka 22:3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 26:14" />Kaha umo ua vaje vandongi likumi na vavali uje ivatumbuile nguavo Yundasa Isakaliote, uayile ku vakuluntu va vasasendote, <verse eid="MAT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 26:15" />na kuhandeka nguendi, “Vika mukanjihana nga njiminehelaye?” Kaha vamufuetele makumi atatu a vimbongo via muuaya uaya via siliva. <verse eid="MAT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 26:16" />Kaha kuhuma ha ntsimbu ije uatondesesele ngila ya kuendelamo Yesu vungungu.<verse eid="MAT 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alia na vandongisi vendi ku ciuano ca Paseka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Mako 14:12-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-13">Luka 22:7-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:23">21:23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yiuano 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 26:17" />Honi ha litangua lia kulivanga lia mbolo ya kuhona cimbaluila vandongisi vezile kuli Yesu nakuhandeka nguavo, “Nkuma kuli utonda yetu nguove tukuvuahese linga ukalileko Paseka?”<verse eid="MAT 26:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 26:18" />Uahandekele nguendi, “Yeni mu nganda kuli yala umo, kaha mukahandeke kuli ikeye ngueni, ‘Mulongisi nahandeka nguendi, ntsimbu yange inahete, njikalinga ciuano ca Paseka mu njivo yove hamo na vandongisi vange.’”<verse eid="MAT 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 26:19" />Kaha vaje vandongisi valingile ngue muje Yesu uavalekele, kaha vavuahesele ciuano ca Paseka. <verse eid="MAT 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 26:20" />Omo vahetele ku cinguezi, Yesu uatumamene ku mesa na vandongisi likumi na vavali, <verse eid="MAT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 26:21" />kaha omo vakele na kulia, uahandekele nguendi, “Muavusunga, Njihandeka ku liyeni nguange, umo ueni akanjenda vungungu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 26:22" />Kaha vakele na vusiua cikuma, kaha vaputukile kuhandeka kuli ikeye, umo na mukuavo nguavo, “Muene yange ndi?” <verse eid="MAT 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 26:23" />Yesu uavakumbuluile nguendi, “Uje akatanta hamo nange mu lilonga, ikeye vene akanjenda vungungu. <verse eid="MAT 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 26:24" />Muomu Muna Muntu akatsa ngue muje vanacisoneka hali ikeye, vuno honi tuyando hali uje yala enda vungungu Muna Muntu! Ngue capuile cacili kuli uje yala nga kasemukile.”<verse eid="MAT 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 26:25" />Yundasa uje uamuendele vungungu uendekele nguendi, “Muene yange ndi?” Yesu uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Omo vene munahandeka.”<verse eid="MAT 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mesa ya Muene</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Mako 14:22-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luka 22:14-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Kolinte 11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 26:26" />Kaha honi omo vakele nakulia, Yesu uambatele mbolo, na ku ikuisula, kaha uaipazuile, naku ihana kuli vandongisi vendi, kaha uahandekele nguendi “Ambateni mulie ou ukeuo muvila uange.”<verse eid="MAT 26:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 26:27" />Kaha uambatele nganja, kaha omo uamanuisuile kutsantsela uavahanene, nguendi “Nuenimo mu vavoshe, <verse eid="MAT 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 26:28" />muomu aua akeuo maninga ange a litavasano lialiha, aje anamuaniena hali vavengi mukukonekela vipi. <verse eid="MAT 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 26:29" />Njimileka nguange, kunjikanuho naua vushuka ovu vua viniu kuvanga noho ha litangua lije omo njikanua neni vushuka vua viniu vuavuha mu Vumuene vua Tate,”<verse eid="MAT 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 26:30" />Kaha omo vamanusuile kuimba muaso, vayile ku munkinda ua Oliveta.<verse eid="MAT 26:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahandeka via kulutue ngeci Petulu akamuviana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mako 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luka 22:31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yiuano 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 26:31" />Ambahoni Yesu uahandekele kuli vandongisi vendi nguendi, “Muva voshe mukateua muomu yange vutsiki vuno vene, muomu vacisoneka nguavo, ‘Njikapupa kaniungi, kaha vutanga vua vampanga vukalishandoka!’ <verse eid="MAT 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 26:32" />Vuno honi hanima ya kunjisangula, njikaya kulutue lueni ku Ngalileya.”<verse eid="MAT 26:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 26:33" />Petulu uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Cipue vene voshe vakakuteua, yange kunjikakuteue.”<verse eid="MAT 26:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 26:34" />Yesu uahandekele kuli Petulu nguendi, “Muavusunga njikuleka nguange, vutsiki vuno vene, ntsimbu kanda ndemba atambeke ukanjiviana lutatu.” <verse eid="MAT 26:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 26:35" />Petulu uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Cipue vene nga kutsa nove, kunjikakuviana.” Kaha na vandongisi vakuavo voshe vahandekele ngoco vene.<verse eid="MAT 26:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alombela mu Ngetesemani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mako 14:32-42</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luka 22:39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 26:36" />Ambahoni Yesu uayile navo kumutambela uvatumbuile nguavo Ngetesemani, kaha uahandekele kuli vandongisi vendi nguendi, “Tumameni hano ntsimbu njiciya nakulombela.”<verse eid="MAT 26:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 26:37" />Kaha uayile na Petulu na vana va Zembendeo vavali, kaha hajevene uaputukile kulivua vusiua na kulinienga. <verse eid="MAT 26:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 26:38" />Kaha uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Muono uange uli muvusiua noho kukutsa, saleni hano, nakutalelela hamo nange.”<verse eid="MAT 26:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 26:39" />Kaha uayile halahako kavundende, uavulumanene ha mavu nakulombela nguendi, “Tate, nga casiua, ecela eyi nganja injipulakane, keti kulingiue cizango cange, vuno honi kulingiue cizango cove.”<verse eid="MAT 26:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 26:40" />Kaha uahilukile kuli vandongisi vendi uavauanene vanakosa tulo, kaha uahandekele kuli Petulu nguendi, “Nkuma kumuasa kutalelela nange cipue ntsimbu imo lika indi? <verse eid="MAT 26:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 26:41" />Taleleni nakulombela linga keti mukovele mu vieseko, cilivene cimbembesi atonda, vuno honi muvila unazeye.”<verse eid="MAT 26:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 26:42" />Uayile naua lua mucivali na kulombela nguendi, “Tate, nga kucasiua nganja eyi kunjipulaka kuvanga vene nji inuine, kaha ecela cizango cove cilingiue.” <verse eid="MAT 26:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 26:43" />Kaha naua uahilukile nakuuana vanakosa tulo, muomu mesho avo alemene.<verse eid="MAT 26:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 26:44" />Nankuma, uavasezele naua, uayile nakulombela luamucitatu, uahandekele mezi acifua cimo. <verse eid="MAT 26:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 26:45" />Ambahoni uezile kuli vandongisi vendi nakuhandeka nguendi, “Nkuma hanga muacikosa na kuhuima? Taleni, ntsimbu inahete laja, kaha Muna Muntu vanamuende vungungu nakumuhana ku mavoko a vaka vipi. <verse eid="MAT 26:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 26:46" />Hindukeni tuyeni, taleni muka kunjenda vungungu uno ali hano.”<verse eid="MAT 26:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu vamukuata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mako 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luka 22:47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Yiuano 18:3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 26:47" />Tele Yesu acili nakuhandeka, Yundasa uezile, uje umo ua vandongisi likumi na vavali, kaha uezile na civunga cakama vaje vezile na mikuale na vimbueti, kuhuminina ku vakuluntu va vasasendote na vakuluntu va vantu. <verse eid="MAT 26:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 26:48" />Kaha honi uje muka kumuenda vungungu uavahanene cimueso uahandekele nguendi, “Uje njikatsemba ikeye yala mukakuata.”<verse eid="MAT 26:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 26:49" />Kaha hajevene uezile kuli Yesu nakuhandeka nguendi, “Uahinduka vati, Mulongisi!” Kaha uamutsembele.<verse eid="MAT 26:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 26:50" />Yesu uamukumbuluile nguendi “Yove kavusamba, linga vuasi vije viunezila.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:50">Ambahoni vezile nakumukuata naku mukuta. <verse eid="MAT 26:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 26:51" />Kaha taleni, umo ua vaje vakele navo Yesu uahumisile mukuale uendi, nakuluisa ndungo ua kasasendote uakama kaha uamutetele lituitui liendi. <verse eid="MAT 26:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 26:52" />Ambahoni Yesu uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Haka mukuale uove mu cindalo cauo, muomu voshe vaje vakambata mukuale vakatsa ku mukuale. <verse eid="MAT 26:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 26:53" />Nkuma musinganieka ngueni kunjasa kulomba kuli Tate, kaha hajevene akanjitumina masualale va tungelo vaje kumuasa kutanda ndi? <verse eid="MAT 26:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 26:54" />Vuno kaha vatihoni visoneka vikalishulisisa, ngeci cikafue muje?”<verse eid="MAT 26:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 26:55" />Ha ntsimbu ijevene Yesu uahandekele ku vivunga nguendi, “Nkuma muneja ngue muakuluisa muhuza, na mikuale na vimbueti mukukuata yange ndi? Ha litangua na litangua njatumamene mu njivo ya Njambi nakulongesa kaha kumuanjikutile. <verse eid="MAT 26:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 26:56" />Vuno honi vioshe evi vinalingiua linga visoneka via tunanguizi vilishulisise.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:56">Ambahoni vandongisi vendi voshe vamusezele nakuteua.<verse eid="MAT 26:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vasompa Yesu mu mpunga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:53-65">Mako 14:53-65</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luka 22:54-55</ref>;<ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Yiuano 18:13-14-19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 26:57" />Ambahoni vaje vakutile Yesu vamutualele kuli Kayafase kasasendote uakama, kuje kuvali kunguluilile valongisi va lishiko na vakuluntu. <verse eid="MAT 26:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 26:58" />Vuno honi Petulu uakele nakumukava halahako, uakele halahako noho vahetele ku cipango ca kasasendote uakama, kaha omo uakovelele mukati uatumamene na vaka kuniunga linga amone vika vikalingiua. <verse eid="MAT 26:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 26:59" />Kaha honi vakuluntu va vasasendote na mpunga yoshe vahanene vukaleho vua makuli hali Yesu linga vamutsihileho, <verse eid="MAT 26:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 26:60" />vuno honi kuvauaneneho cipue vumo, cipue vene kuakele vakaleho vavengi va makuli. Kaha kumamanusuilo vavali vezile kulutue, <verse eid="MAT 26:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 26:61" />nakuhandeka nguavo, “Ou mukuetu uahandekele nguendi, ‘Njasa kusiula eyi njivo ya Njambi nakuitunga naua mu matangua atatu.’”<verse eid="MAT 26:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 26:62" />Kaha uje kasasendote uakama uemanene nakuhandeka nguendi, “Nkuma kuuesi nacikumbululo ndi? Nkuma vikahoni ava vamala valinaku kuvangeya?” <verse eid="MAT 26:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 26:63" />Vuno honi Yesu uaholokele lika kuluu. Kaha kasasendote uakama uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Njikusinga mu lizina lia Njambi uakuyoya, tuleke nga yove Kilistu, Muna Njambi.”<verse eid="MAT 26:63" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 26:64" />Yesu uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Omu munahandeka mukemo vene. Vuno honi njimileka nguange, kuhuma ha ntsimbu ino mukamona Muna Muntu natumama ku livoko liacilio lia muka Nzili yoshe, kaha akeja mu mashelua a muilu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 26:65" />Ambahoni uje kasasendote uakama uatavuile kazaku kendi nakuhandeka nguendi, “Nashaula Njambi. Vika naua tutondela vakaleho veka? Munevu honi kushaula cendi. <verse eid="MAT 26:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 26:66" />Nkuma musompa ngueni vati?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:66">Vamukumbuluile nguavo, “Napande kutsa.”<verse eid="MAT 26:66" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="MAT 26:67" />Ambahoni vamujekuilile ku cihanga cendi nakumupupa, kaha vamo vamupupile vimbanda <verse eid="MAT 26:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MAT 26:68" />nakuhandeka nguavo, “Kilistu, handeka vunanguizi kuli yetu! Iya nakupupu?”<verse eid="MAT 26:68" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petulu aviana Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">Mako 14:66-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luka 22:56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Yiuano 18:15-18</ref>;<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MAT 26:69" />Honi Petulu uatumamene hambanza lia cipango. Kaha ngamba uampuevo uezile kuli ikeye nakuhandeka nguendi, “Nove vene uakele na Yesu uaku Ngalileya.”<verse eid="MAT 26:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="MAT 26:70" />Vuno honi uavianene ku mesho avo voshe nguendi, “Kunjizivuka evi uli nakuhandeka.” <verse eid="MAT 26:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MAT 26:71" />Kaha omo uayile hambanza lia cikolo, ngamba mukuavo uampuevo uamumuene kaha uahandekele ku vantu vaje vemanene kuje nguendi, “Ou yala uakele hamo na Yesu uaku Nazaleta.”<verse eid="MAT 26:71" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MAT 26:72" />Kaha naua uavianene nakulisinga nguendi, “Kunjimuzivuka ou yala.”<verse eid="MAT 26:72" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="MAT 26:73" />Hanima ya kantsimbu kakandende vaje vantu vemanene kuje vezile nakuhandeka kuli Petulu nguavo, “Cilivene nove naua umo uavo, muomu handekesi yove ikeyo ikujombolola.”<verse eid="MAT 26:73" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="MAT 26:74" />Ambahoni Petulu uaputukile kuhandeka visingo hali ikeye vavenia nakulisinga nguendi, “Kunjimuzivuka ou yala.” Kaha hajevene ndemba uatambekele.<verse eid="MAT 26:74" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="MAT 26:75" />Petulu uavulukile vije viahandekele Yesu nguendi, “Ntsimbu kanda ndemba atambeke ukanjiviana lutatu.” Kaha uayile hambanza nakulila cikuma.<verse eid="MAT 26:75" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="MAT 27" />
  <para style="s">Yesu vamutuala kuli Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:1">Mako 15:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-2">Luka 23:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-32">Yiuano 18:28-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 27:1" />Omo cimene cahetele vakuluntu va vasasendote voshe na vakuluntu va vantu vatumbile vutumbe vuakuluisa Yesu ngeci vamutsihe. <verse eid="MAT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 27:2" />Kaha vamukutile nakumutuala kuli Pilato uje uapuile nguvulu.<verse eid="MAT 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutsa ca Yundasa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 1:18-19">Vilinga 1:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 27:3" />Omo Yundasa uje uamuendele vungungu uamuene nguendi Yesu vanamuhisa linga vamutsihe, uatengulukile nakuhiluisa vije vimbongo via muuaya uaya via siliva makumi atatu ku vakuluntu va vasasendote na vakuluntu, <verse eid="MAT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 27:4" />uahandekele nguendi, “Njinalingi vupi hakuenda vungungu maninga akuhona mulonga.” Kaha vamukumbuluile nguavo,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:4">“Vikahoni ovio kuli yetu? Ouo mulonga uove.”<verse eid="MAT 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 27:5" />Kaha Yundasa uombilile vije vimbongo via muuaya uaya via siliva mu njivo ya Njambi, kaha uayile nakukalishukika.<verse eid="MAT 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 27:6" />Vuno honi vakuluntu va vasasendote omo vambatele vije vimbongo via muuaya uaya via siliva, vahandekele nguavo, “Kuya ku lishiko kucapandele kuvihaka mu mbango, muomu vinapu vimbongo via maninga.” <verse eid="MAT 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 27:7" />Nankuma valitavasanene linga vavilande lihia lia uje muka kushonga vindeho, ngeci lipue lia kutsindila vangenzi. <verse eid="MAT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 27:8" />Nankuma, nakuheta nalelo lino lije lihia valisana nguavo Lihia lia Maninga.<verse eid="MAT 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 27:9" />Ambahoni vialishulisile vije viahandekele kananguizi Njelemiya nguendi, “Kaha vambatele vimbongo via muuaya uaya via siliva makumi atatu, a ndando yendi ije ndando ivayonguele vamo vana Vaisaleli, <verse eid="MAT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 27:10" />kaha vije vimbongo vavilandele lihia lia muka kushonga vindeho, ngue muje muanji shikililemo Muene.”<verse eid="MAT 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pilato ehula Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:2-5">Mako 15:2-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:3-5">Luka 23:3-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:33-38">Yiuano 18:33-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 27:11" />Honi Yesu uemanene ku mesho a nguvulu ua Valoma, kaha nguvulu uamuhuile nguendi, “Yove Muene ua Vayunda ndi?” Yesu uamukumbuluile nguendi,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:11">“Omu munahandeka mukemo vene.” <verse eid="MAT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 27:12" />Vuno honi omo vamuvangeyele ku vakuluntu va vasasendote na vakuluntu, kavakumbuluile.<verse eid="MAT 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 27:13" />Ambahoni Pilato uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Nkuma kuuesi nakuvua viuma evi vivali nakuhana vukaleho hali yove indi?”<verse eid="MAT 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 27:14" />Vuno honi kamukumbuluile cipue lizi limo, Kaha honi nguvulu ualikomokelele cikuma.<verse eid="MAT 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu vamusompela Kutsa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Mako 15:6-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luka 23:13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39">Yiuano 18:39</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:16">19:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 27:15" />Honi ku ciuano uje nguvulu kuya ku lishiko liavo, uapandele kuhumisila civunga umo ua vinzinda uje ivatondele. <verse eid="MAT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 27:16" />Kaha ha ntsimbu ije kuakele cinzinda uje uakuhona kuvua, ivatumbuile nguavo Mbalambasa. <verse eid="MAT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 27:17" />Omo valikunguluile hamo Pilato uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Iya mutonda linga njimihumisile, Mbalambasa indi Yesu uje ivatumbula nguavo Kilistu?” <verse eid="MAT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 27:18" />Muomu Pilato uazivukile nguendi omo ya cipululu cavo mukemo vamuneheleleye Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 27:19" />Oku tele Pilato natumama ha cituamo cakusompela, mpueyendi uatumine lizi kuli ikeye nguendi, “Keti ulinge cimo kuli ou yala ua vusunga, muomu njinayanda cikuma kumulota.”<verse eid="MAT 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 27:20" />Honi vakuluntu va vasasendote na vakuluntu visindiyile vantu linga valombe Mbalambasa kaha Yesu vamutsihe. <verse eid="MAT 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 27:21" />Vuno honi nguvulu uavehuile naua nguendi, “Kuli ava vantu vavali iya mutonda linga njimihumisile?” Vahandekele nguavo,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:21">“Mbalambasa.”<verse eid="MAT 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 27:22" />Pilato uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Amba vika honi njikalinga nou Yesu ivatumbula Kilistu?” Kaha voshe vahandekele nguavo,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:22">“Mushukike.” <verse eid="MAT 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 27:23" />Kaha uahandekele nguendi, “Vupi muka vuanalingi?” Vuno honi voshe vatambekele cikuma nguavo, “Vamushukike.” <verse eid="MAT 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 27:24" />Nankuma omo Pilato uamuene nguendi nacimo cauanaho cahi, vuno honi mpindangano ikaputuka, uambatele mema na kutana ku mavoko endi ha mesho acivunga, nakuhandeka nguendi, “Yange kunjesi namulonga ha maninga ou yala, limueneni yeni vavenia.” <verse eid="MAT 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 27:25" />Kaha vantu voshe vamukumbuluile nguavo, “Maninga endi akale hali yetu na vana vetu!” <verse eid="MAT 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 27:26" />Ambahoni uavahanene Mbalambasa, kaha kumanusula kupupa Yesu, uavahaneneye linga vamushukike.<verse eid="MAT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Masualale vashendumuna Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:16-20">Mako 15:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Yiuano 19:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 27:27" />Ambahoni masualale va nguvulu vambatele Yesu nakumutuala mulipela, kaha vakunguluile civunga coshe ca masualale kuli ikeye. <verse eid="MAT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 27:28" />Vamushuluile, nakumuzika kazaku ka kuvenga. <verse eid="MAT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 27:29" />Kaha vavindile cilongo ca mambimbo vacihakele ku mutue uendi, kaha vamuhakele lihongo mu livoko liendi lia cilio. Vatsikamene ku mesho endi na kumushendumuna nguavo, “Uahinduka, Muene ua Vayunda!” <verse eid="MAT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 27:30" />Kaha vamujekuilile, kaha vambatele lihongo vamupupile ku mutue. <verse eid="MAT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 27:31" />Hanima ya kumushendumuna, vamushuluile kazaku, nakumuzika vuzalo vuendi nakumutuala mukumushukika.<verse eid="MAT 27:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu vamushukika ha cilindakano</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mako 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luka 23:26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yiuano 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 27:32" />Omo vakele nakuya, valiuanene na yala uaku Silene, lizina liendi Simoni, ou yala vamusindiyiye kuambata cilindakano ca Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 27:33" />Kaha omo vahetele ha cihela civasana nguavo Ngolongota (cije cilumbununa nguaco cihela ca Cikola), <verse eid="MAT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 27:34" />vamuhanene viniu linga anue, va vishingasanene na niangua, vuno honi omo uamakeleleko, kavinuine. <verse eid="MAT 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 27:35" />Kaha omo vamanusuile ku mushukika, valipangezelele vuzalo vuendi hakati kavo mukuta nkela, <verse eid="MAT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 27:36" />ambahoni vatumamene ha mavu oku vali nakumutalela. <verse eid="MAT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 27:37" />Kaha helu lia mutue uendi vahakeleho cimueso cavije vamuhisile navio nguavio, “Ou ikeye Yesu, Muene ua Vayunda.” <verse eid="MAT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 27:38" />Honi vamushukikile na mihuza vavali, umo kucilio mukuavo kucimoshue. <verse eid="MAT 27:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 27:39" />Kaha vaje vakele nakuhita vamushauile, nakuningangesa mitue yavo. <verse eid="MAT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 27:40" />Kaha vahandekele nguavo, “Yove uatondele kusiula njivo ya Njambi nakuitunga mu matangua atatu, liovole yove vavenia! Nga u Muna Njambi, huma ha cilindakano.” <verse eid="MAT 27:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 27:41" />Nankuma naua vakuluntu va vasasendote nava valongisi va lishiko na vakuluntu vamushendumuine nguavo, <verse eid="MAT 27:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 27:42" />“Uovuele vakuavo, vuno honi kasa kuliovola ikeye vavenia. Ikeye Muene ua Isaleli, ashuluke ha cilindakano, kaha tumutsiliela. <verse eid="MAT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 27:43" />Uatsiliela muli Njambi, eceni Njambi amuohiele hano vene, nga amuzanga, muomu uahandekele nguendi, Yange Muna Njambi!” <verse eid="MAT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 27:44" />Kaha na mihuza vaje vavamushukikile hamo nendi vamutukile navo naua.<verse eid="MAT 27:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutsa ca Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mako 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luka 23:44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yiuano 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 27:45" />Honi omo litangua liakele hakati ka mutue kutuala ha ntsimbu ya mucitatu ya mutania uacinguezi kuakele milima ha mavu hoshe. <verse eid="MAT 27:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 27:46" />Kaha ha ntsimbu ya mucitatu ya mutania uacinguezi Yesu ualilile nakutambakana nguendi, “Eloi, Eloi, lama sambakatani?” Kulumbununa nguavo, “Njambi yange, Njambi yange, nkuma vika uanjisezela?”<verse eid="MAT 27:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 27:47" />Kaha vamo vantu vaje vemanene kuje omo vovuile eci, vahandekele nguavo, “Ou yala alinakusana Eliya.” <verse eid="MAT 27:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 27:48" />Hajevene umo uavo uashatukile nakukambata mupelo, kaha ua umbuitikile mu viniu via kushasha naku ukutilila ku lihongo kaha uamuhanene linga anue.<verse eid="MAT 27:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 27:49" />Vuno honi vamo vahandekele nguavo, “Vandameneni, tuyeni tumone indi Eliya eja nakumuovola.”<verse eid="MAT 27:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 27:50" />Kaha Yesu ualilile nakutambakana naua, kaha uecelele cimbembesi cendi.<verse eid="MAT 27:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 27:51" />Kaha taleni, ntanga ya mu njivo ya Njambi yatavukile hakati, kuhuma kuilu nakuheta ha mavu. Kaha mavu aningangele, na mavue atavukile, <verse eid="MAT 27:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 27:52" />na vihilo naua navio viashokolokele, kaha mivila yaingi ya vaje vaka kulela vaje vatsile yasangukile. <verse eid="MAT 27:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 27:53" />Kaha omo vahumine mu vihilo hanima yakusanguka ca Yesu, vayile mu nganda ya kulela nakukalisholola ku vantu vavengi.<verse eid="MAT 27:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 27:54" />Omo uje mukuluntu ua masualale na vaje vakele navo vaje vakele nakuniunga Yesu, vamuene mandunduma na vije vialingiuile, kaha vovuile liova cikuma nakuhandeka nguavo, “Muavusunga vene ou uapuile Muna Njambi!”<verse eid="MAT 27:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 27:55" />Kujevene kuakele naua na vampuevo vavengi, vaje vakele nakutalela halahako, vaje vakavele Yesu kuhuma ku Ngalileya oku tele vali nakumupangela. <verse eid="MAT 27:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 27:56" />Vamo vavo vapuile Maliya Mangandalena, na Maliya vaina ya Yakomba na Yosefa, na vaina ya vana va Zembendeo.<verse eid="MAT 27:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vatsinda Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mako 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luka 23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yiuano 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 27:57" />Omo cinguezi cahetele, kuezile yala umo ua kufuka uaku Alamatiya, lizina liendi Yosefa, uje na ikeye naua uapuile ndongisi ua Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 27:58" />Uayile kuli Pilato nakulomba muvila ua Yesu. Ambahoni Pilato uashikile nguendi linga vamuhaneuo. <verse eid="MAT 27:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 27:59" />Kaha Yosefa uambatele muvila ua Yesu naku uzengela ha ntanga ya iha ya liniu, <verse eid="MAT 27:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 27:60" />kaha ua ulangekele mu cihilo caciha cendi vavenia, cije cacokuele mu livue, kaha uakokelele livue liakama ku cikolo ca cihilo, kaha uayile. <verse eid="MAT 27:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 27:61" />Maliya Mangandalena na Maliya mukuavo vatumamene kuje oku vanatalesa ha cihilo.<verse eid="MAT 27:61" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vaka kuniunga ku cihilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 27:62" />Liamukuavo, hanima ya litangua liakulivuahesela lije likelio litangua lia Sapalalo, vakuluntu va vasasendote na Vafaliseho valikunguluilile kuli Pilato, <verse eid="MAT 27:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 27:63" />kaha vahandekele nguavo, “Muene, tuvuluka muje uje muka kukuisa uahandekele tele aciyoya nguendi, ‘Hanima ya matangua atatu njikasanguka naua.’ <verse eid="MAT 27:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 27:64" />Nankuma shika vaje tuniungi linga vaniunge muacili cihilo noho ha litangua lia mucitatu. Keti ngoconi hamo vandongisi vendi vakeja nakuiva muvila uendi, kaha vakaleka vantu nguavo, ‘Nasanguka kuvatsi,’ kaha aua makuli akukotokela akapua amapi cikuma kupulakana aje akulivanga.”<verse eid="MAT 27:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 27:65" />Pilato uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Muli namuka kuniunga ua masualale, yeni mukaniunge muacili cihilo kuya muje mumuaselamo.”<verse eid="MAT 27:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 27:66" />Nankuma vayile nakuniunga cije cihilo, kaha vaciniungile mukuhakako kasateso ku livue nakuhakako muka kuniunga.<verse eid="MAT 27:66" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="MAT 28" />
  <para style="s">Kusanguka ca Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:1-10">Mako 16:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luka 24:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yiuano 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 28:1" />Honi hanima ya Sapalalo, ha ntsimbu yakuca ca litangua liakulivanga musondo, Maliya Mangandalena na Maliya mukuavo vayile mukumona ku cihilo. <verse eid="MAT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 28:2" />Kaha taleni, kuakele mandunduma akama, muomu kangelo ua Muene uashulukile kuhuma muilu, kuija nakuhumisa livue lije liakele ku cihilo kaha uatumameneho. <verse eid="MAT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 28:3" />Cifua cendi cafuile ngue muhiato, kaha vuzalo vuendi vuatokele too ngue mpemba. <verse eid="MAT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 28:4" />Muomu ya liova lia kangelo, vaje vaka kuniunga ku cihilo vajajele cikuma kaha valezumukile. <verse eid="MAT 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 28:5" />Vuno honi uje kangelo uahandekele kuli vaje vampuevo nguendi, “Keti muvue liova, muomu njazivuka nguange mulina kutonda Yesu, uje ivashukikile. <verse eid="MAT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 28:6" />Uahimo muno, nasanguka, ngue muje muahandekele. Ijeni, taleni mu cihela muje muakosele. <verse eid="MAT 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 28:7" />Ambahoni yeni vuasi vuasi, mukaleke vandongisi vendi ngueni, ‘Nasanguka ku vatsi, kaha taleni, nalivanga laja kuya ku Ngalileya, kuje kukeko kumuka mumuena.’ Taleni, vulukeni vinjinamileke.” <verse eid="MAT 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 28:8" />Kaha vaje vampuevo vahumine ku cihilo vuasi vuasi na liova na kujolelela cikuma, vashatukile na kukaleka vandongisi vendi. <verse eid="MAT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 28:9" />Kaha taleni, hajevene Yesu ualiuanene navo nakuhandeka nguendi, “Tambokeni.” Kaha vezile kuli ikeye nakumukuata ku viliato viendi nakumulemesa. <verse eid="MAT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 28:10" />Ambahoni Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Keti muvue liova, yeni mukalekese vamuanetu vaye ku Ngalileya, kaha kuje kukeko vakanjimuena.”<verse eid="MAT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vukaleho vua vaka kuniunga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 28:11" />Tele vali nakuya, taleni, vamo va masualale vayile mu nganda nakuleka vakuluntu va vasasendote vioshe vije vialingiuile. <verse eid="MAT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 28:12" />Kaha omo valiuanene hamolika na vakuluntu nakutumba vutumbe vuavo, vahanene vimbongo masualale <verse eid="MAT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 28:13" />nakuhandeka nguavo, “Lekeni vantu ngueni, ‘Vandongisi vendi vanezile vutsiki nakuiva muvila uendi tele tuli mutulo.’ <verse eid="MAT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 28:14" />Ngahoni eci ciheta mu matuitui a nguvulu, tukamuzika zika, linga keti mukale muvukalu.” <verse eid="MAT 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 28:15" />Ambahoni vambatele vije vimbongo kaha valingile ngue muje vavalekesele, kaha lutsimo lua muzimbu ou luashandokelele hakati ka Vayunda kuheta na lelo lino.<verse eid="MAT 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alisholola kuli vandongisi vendi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mako 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luka 24:36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yiuano 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Vilinga 1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 28:16" />Honi vandongisi likumi na umo vayile ku Ngalileya, ku munkinda kuje Yesu uavalekele. <verse eid="MAT 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 28:17" />Kaha omo vamumuene vamulemesele, vuno honi vamo valikanouelele. <verse eid="MAT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 28:18" />Kaha Yesu uezile nakuhandeka kuli vakevo nguendi, “Nzili yoshe yakama ya muilu na ya ha mavu vanaihana kuli yange. <verse eid="MAT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 28:19" />Nankuma yeni mukapuise mafuti oshe vandongisi, mukavambuitike mu lizina lia Tate, na lia Muana, na lia Cimbembesi Uakulela, <verse eid="MAT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 28:20" />valongeseni kuononoka viuma vioshe vije vinjinamishiki, kaha taleni, njikakala neni kutuala ku mamanusuilo a mavu.”<verse eid="MAT 28:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 28" />
</usx>